<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Genesis</book>
  <para style="h">Genesis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Genesis</para>
  <para style="toc2">Genesis</para>
  <para style="mt">Genesis</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tîra Pathianin lei leh vân a siam khân
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khawvêl chuan mu leh mal a la nei lo va, tuithûkpui chung pawh a thim mup a, Pathian Thlarau chuan tui chung chu a vil reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Êng lo awm rawh se,” a ti a, êng a lo awm ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin êng a hmuh chuan ṭha a ti hle a, êng leh thim chu a ṭhen hrang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathianin êng chu ‘chhûn’ a vuah a, thim chu ‘zân’ a vuah a. Tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni khatna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Tui leh tui ṭhen tûrin boruak zau tak vân kumkulh awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chuan vân kumkulh chu a siam a, kumkulh chunga tui awm leh a hnuaia tui chu a ṭhen ta a; chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathianin kumkulh chu ‘vân’ a vuah a, tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni hnihna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Vân hnuaia tui chu hmun khatah tling khâwm sela, khawmual lo lang rawh se,” a ti a. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianin khawmual chu ‘lei’ a vuah a, tui tling khâwm chu ‘tuifinriat’ a vuah a. Pathianin a han en a, ṭha a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Leiah thlai, a fang neia rah chi tinrêng te, thei, a mu neia rah chi hrang hrang ṭo ṭeuh rawh se,” a ti a. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei aṭang chuan thlai tinrêng, fang neia rah chi tinrêng te, thei, mu neia rah hrang hrang te a lo ṭo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin a han en chian chuan ṭha a ti hle a. Tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni thumna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Chhûn leh zân awmtîr tûrin vân kumkulhah êntute awm teh se, chûng chu hun bi, ni te leh kum chhiar nân te ni sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />lei tiêng tûrin êntute chu vân kumkulhah chuan awm rawh se,” a ti a. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian chuan êntu lian pui pahnih leh arsite a siam a; êntu lian zâwk chu chhûna êng tûrin a ti a, a tê zâwk chu zâna êng tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei ên tûr chuan Pathianin vân kumkulhah chuan êntute chu a dah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thim leh êng ṭhena, chhûna êng tûr leh zâna êng tûrin. Pathian chuan a han en a, ṭha a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni lina chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Tuiah nungcha awm noh noh sela, vân kumkulh hnuaia lei chungah sava thlâwk sup sup bawk rawh se,” a ti a. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian chuan tuifinriata sa hlauhawm pui pui te, a ruala lêng dûl dûl tinrêng te leh sava thla nei chi hrang hrangte chu a siam a. Pathianin a han en a, ṭha a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian chuan mal a sâwm a, “Inthlah pung zêl ula, pung duah duah rawh u, tuifinriatah khat ula; leia savate pawh pung chiam rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni ngana chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Leian thil nung tinrêng, ran te, ramsa te, leia vâk chi te lo awm noh noh rawh se,” a ti a. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian chuan ramsa te, ran te leh leia vâk chi te, thil nung tinrêng te chu a siam a. Pathianin a han en chuan ṭha a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Pathian chuan, “Keimahni ang, kan anpuiin mihring siam ila, tuifinriata sangha te, chunglêng sava te, ran te, ramsa te leh leia vâk chi zawng zawng chungah te thu nei teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian chuan amah angin mihring, mipa leh hmeichhia a siam a, Pathian anpui ngeiin a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian chuan anni chu mal a sâwm a, an hnênah, “Fanau neiin lo pung deuh deuh rawh u; lei hi luah khat ula, nei vek rawh u; tuifinriata sangha te, chunglêng sava te leh leia thil nung awm zawng zawng chungah thu nei bawk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian chuan heti hian a ti bawk: “Ngai teh u, in ei atân leia thlai, a fanga rah te; thei, a mu neia rah te ka pe a che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />leia ran zawng zawng te, chunglêng sava te leh nungcha lei chunga vâk chi te ei atân hnimhring ka pe bawk a ni,” tiin. Chutiang chu a ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian chuan a thilsiam zawng zawng chu a hmuhin ṭha a ti êm êm a. Tlai a lo ni a, zîng a lo ni leh a: a ni rukna chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lei leh vân leh thil engkim siam chu zawh a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni sarihna ni-ah Pathianin a thilsiam hna chu a zawh fel tâk avângin a ni sarih ni chuan a châwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thilsiam hna zawng zawng a tih zawha a chawlhsan tâk avângin Pathian chuan a ni sarih ni chu mal a sâwm a, a serh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu chu lei leh vân siam dân chanchin chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Pathianin lei leh vân a siam lai khân thlai rêng rêng leiah a la ṭo lo va, hnim pawh a la chawr hek lo; Pathianin ruah a sûrtîr rih lo va, lo neitu tûr mihring pawh an la awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei aṭangin tuihu a lo chhuak a, chu chuan lei chu a tihnâwng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan lei vaivutin mihring a siam a, a hnârah chuan nunna thaw a thaw lût a, mihring chu mi nung a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan khawchhak ram, Eden-ah huan a siam a; tah chuan a mihring siam chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan thing mawi tak tak leh rah tui tak huanah chuan a ṭotîr a, huan lai takah chuan nunna thing leh a chhia a ṭha thleina thing a ṭotîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan tihnâwng tûr chuan lui pakhat a luang tlang a, huan pâwnah chuan pêng liin a pêng darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pêng khat hming chu Pison a ni a, rangkachak tamna Havila ramah a luang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu rama rangkachak chu a ṭha bîk a, lungmantam Bidela leh Soham pawh a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lui pakhat hming chu Gihon a ni a, Kus ramah a luang tlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lui pathumna chu Hidekal a ni a, Asuria chhak lamah a luang a. A palina chu Eufretis lui hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mihring chu a hruai a, huan enkawla vêng tûrin huanah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mihring chu a hrilh a, “Huana thing rah hi i duh duh i ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A chhia a ṭha thleina thei erawh hi chu ei tûr a ni lo, i ei phawt chuan i ei niin i thi ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan, “Mihring, amah maia a awm hi a ṭha lo ve, ṭanpuitu tûr, a kawppui âwm tak ka siamsak teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan leiin ramsa tinrêng leh chunglêng sava tinrêng a han siam a. Mihring chuan engtin nge a lo koh dâwn hriat nân a hnênah a rawn hruai zêl a; mihringin a lo koh dân ang zêl chu thil nung tinrêng chuan hmingah an pu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihring chuan ran te, chunglêng sava te leh ramsa tinrêng te chu hming a neihtîr a; mahse, mihring chuan amah ṭanpuitu tûr, kawppui âwm a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mihring chu tui takin a muttîr a, a muthilh hlân chuan a nâkruh pakhat a lâksak a, tisain a tiping leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipa nâkruh a lâk aṭang chuan Lalpa Pathian chuan hmeichhia a siam a, mipa hnênah chuan a rawn hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hei zet zawng, ka ruh ang ruh nei, ka tisa ang tisa pu zu nia le! Mipa aṭanga lâk chhuah a nih avângin ‘hmeichhia’ tih tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hei vâng hian mipain a nu leh a pa a thlah a, a nupui a vuan a, tisa pumkhat an lo ni ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipa leh hmeichhia chu saruakin an awm a; mahse, an zak lêm lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian siam ramsa zîngah rûl hi a fing vervêk ber a, hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Huana thei rah rêng rêng hi Pathianin in ei a khap che u elo maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan rûl hnênah, “Huana thei rahte hi kan ei thei asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan laia awm thing rah hi erawh chu Pathian chuan, ‘Ei suh u, tawh pawh tawk suh u, in thi mai ang,’ min ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rûl chuan hmeichhe hnênah, “Thi teh suh e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In ei veleh in mit a lo vâr ang a, Pathian angin a chhia a ṭha in thlei ve tawh dâwn tih Pathian chuan a hria atin alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan thei tuihnai, tui âwm tak, fin theihna tûra thei îtawm tak a ni tih a hmuh chuan a lo va, a ei ta a; a ṭhen chu a pasal a pe ve a, ani pawh chuan a ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An pahnih chuan an mit a lo vâr a, saruak an nih an hrechhuak ta a; tichuan, theipui hnah an chilh khâwm a, fên tûr an insiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlai ni nêm chuan huana Lalpa lo lêng thâwm chu an hria a, mipa leh a nupui chuan thing zîngah Pathian chu an bihrûksan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mihring chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Khawiah nge i awm tâk?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Huana i thâwm ka hria a, saruak ka nih avângin ka hlau che a, ka biru a ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saruak i nih tu nge hrilh che? Ei loh tûr ka tih thei kha i lo ei a ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipa chuan, “Mi awmpui tûra i tih hmeichhia khân thei rah chu mi pe a, ka ei ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan hmeichhe hnênah, “Engtiziaa hetiang thil hi ti nge i nih?” a ti a. Hmeichhia chuan, “Rûlin min tihder a, ka ei ta mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan rûl hnênah, “He thil hi i tih tâk avângin ran zawng zawng leh ramsa tinrêng dawn aia nasa zâwk ânchhia i dawng dâwn a ni; leiah i tleng ang a, i dam chhûng zawng chu vaivut i ei ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nang leh hmeichhia hi ka inhmêlmâktîr ang che u a, i thlahte leh a thlahte pawh an inhmêlmâk zêl ang. I luruh a vaw keh ang a, nangin a keartui i chuk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I nau vei na ka tizual ang a, na ti takin fa i hring dâwn a ni; mahse, i thlâkhlelh chu i pasal a ni ang a, ani chuan i chungah thu a nei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adama hnênah chuan, ‘I nupui thu i zâwm a, ei loh tûr ka tih thei kha i ei a, i tân lei hi ânchhia ka lawh ta. I dam chhûng zawng hah takin ei tûr i thawk chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei te, hlohar te a ṭo vang a, chuta thlai chu i ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I lo pian chhuahna leia i kîr leh hma chu thlansaphûlkaiin ei i zawng ang. Vaivut i ni a, vaivutah bawk i kîr leh tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipa chuan a nupui chu mi zawng zawng nu a nih avângin a hmingah Evi a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mipa leh a nupui tân savun puan a siam a, a sintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan, “Mihring chuan keimahni angin a chhia a ṭha a thlei ve ta si a, nunna thing rah chu lovin a ei ang a, a nung reng thei mai ang a!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa , Pathian chuan a pian chhuahna ram chu lova nei tûrin Eden huan aṭang chuan a hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihring a hnawh chhuah hnu chuan Eden huan chhak lamah cherub-te leh khandaih vir tawn, huan vêng tûr chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adama chuan a nupui Evi chu a pâwl a, nau a pai a; Kaina a hring a, “ Lalpa zârah fapa ka nei ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nau Abela chu a hring leh a. Abela chuan berâm a vulh a, Kaina chuan lo a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng emawti hnuah chuan Kaina chuan a lova thlai thar chu Lalpa hnêna thilhlan atân a rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abela pawh chuan a berâmno piang hmasa zînga mi a rawn la a, a sa ṭha lai ber chu a hlan a. Lalpa chuan Abela leh a thilhlan chu a lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaina chungah leh a thilhlanah chuan a lâwm lo. Kaina chu a thin a ur a, a hmêl a dur ta khup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Kaina hnênah, “Engati nge i thin a ura, i hmêl a dur tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil ṭha ti la, i hmêl pawh a hlim ang chu. Thil ṭha i tih loh avângin sual chuan kawngkaah nghâkhlel takin a châng reng che a ni; mahse, i hneh tûr a ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaina chuan a nau Abela hnênah, “I feh ang hmiang,” a ti a. Lo an thlen chuan Kaina chuan a nau Abela chu a bei a, a that ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Kaina hnênah, “I nau Abela kha khawiah nge a awm tâk?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka hre nâng, ka nau vêngtu ka ni em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Engtizia nge hetiang thil hi i tih le? I nau thisen aw chuan lei aṭangin min au asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangma thah ngei i nau thisen lo dawngtu lei chungah hian i hmuingîl dâwn tawh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lo i neih pawhin a rah seng tûr i nei lo vang; leiah hian chanhai takin i vâkvai tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaina chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Min hrem na êm a, tuar zawh rual em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vawiinah he ram ata hi min hnawt chhuak a, i hmuh loh tûrin ka awm dâwn ta a ni si a; leiah hian chanhai takin ka vâkvai dâwn ta a ni. Chuvângin, min hmu apiangin min that mai ang asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “That lo ve, Kaina that chu a lêt sariha phuba lâk a ni ang,” a ti a. A hmu apiangin an thah mai loh nân Kaina chu chhinchhiahna a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa hma ata Kaina chu a chhuak a, khawchhak lam Nod ramah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kaina chuan a nupui a pâwl a, nau a nei a. Enoka a hring a. Khua a siam a, a fapa hming chawiin ‘Enok’ a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Enoka chuan Irada fapa a nei a; Irada chuan fapa Mehujaela a nei a, Mehujaela chuan fapa Methusaela a nei a, Methusaela chuan fapa Lameka a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lameka chuan nupui pahnih a nei a, pakhat hming chu Adaii a ni a, pakhat hming chu Zillaii a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adaii chuan Jabala a hring a, ani chu berâm vulha puan ina chêngho thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu mi nau chu Jubala a ni a, ṭingṭang leh phênglâwng tum mite thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zillaii pawh chuan Tubal-kaina a hring a, ani chu dâr leh thîr hmanraw tinrêng chhertu a ni. Tubal-kaina chuan farnu Naamaii a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lameka chuan a nupuite hnênah: “Adai, Zillai, ka thu hi ngaithla ula, Lameka nupuite u, ka sawi hi bengkhawn rawh u: Min tipemtu chu ka that a, min vawtu tlangvâl chu ka that bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kaina phuba laa mi pasarih an thih chuan, Lameka phuba lâk nân mi sawmsarih leh pasarih an that ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Adama chuan a nupui chu a pâwl leh a, fapa a hring a, a hmingah Setha a sa a. “Kainan Abela min thahsak tâk avângin a aiah Pathianin fapa min pe leh ta a nih hi,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Setha pawh chuan fapa a nei a, a hmingah Enosa a sa a. Chutih lai chuan a ni, miten Lalpa hming an lam ṭan tâk ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hetiang hi Adama thlahte chanchin chu a ni. Pathianin mihring a siam khân Pathian anpui ngeiin a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipa leh hmeichhia a siam a, mal a sâwm a, a siam ni chuan an hmingah ‘mihring’ a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A anpui, amah ang taka fapa a hrin khân Adama chu kum za leh sawmthuma upa a ni a, a fapa hmingah chuan Setha a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Setha a neih hnu chuan Adama chu kum zariat a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Adama chu kum zakua leh sawmthum chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fapa Enosa a pian khân Setha chu kum za leh pangaa upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Enosa a pian hnuah Setha chu kum zariat leh pasarih a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Setha chu kum zakua leh sâwm leh pahnih chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fapa Kenana a pian khân Enosa chu kum sawmkuaa upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenana a pian hnuin Enosa chu kum zariat leh sâwm leh panga a dam a; fanu fapa dangte a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Enosa chu kum zakua leh panga chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A fapa Mahalalela a pian khân Kenana chu kum sawmsariha upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahalalela a pian hnuin Kenana chu kum zariat leh sawmli a dam a; fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kenana chu kum zakua leh sâwm chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A fapa Jareda a pian khân Mahalalela chu kum sawmruk leh pangaa upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jareda a pian hnuin Mahalalela chu kum zariat leh sawmthum a dam a; fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahalalela chu kum zariat leh sawmkua leh panga chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A fapa Enoka a pian khân Jareda chu kum za leh sawmruk leh pahniha upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Enoka a pian hnuin kum zariat a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jareda chu kum zakua leh sawmruk leh pahnih chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapa Methusela a pian khân Enoka chu kum sawmruk leh pangaa upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Methusela a pian hnuin Enoka chu kum zathum chhûng Pathian nên an lêng dûn ṭhîn; fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Enoka chu kum zathum leh sawmruk leh panga chhûng a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Enoka chu Pathian nên an lêng dûn ṭhîn, Pathianin a lâk tâk avângin a awm ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A fapa Lameka a pian khân Methusela chu kum za leh sawmriat leh pasariha upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lameka a pian hnuin kum zasarih leh sawmriat leh pahnih a dam a; fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Methusela chu kum zakua leh sawmruk leh pakaw chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Fapa a neihin Lameka chu kum za leh sawmriat leh pahniha upa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“He mi hian leia kut hna rim taka kan thawh, Lalpa ânchhia aṭang hian min tihahdam tawh ang,” tiin a fapa hmingah chuan Nova a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nova a pian hnuin Lameka chu kum zanga leh sawmkua leh panga a dam a; fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lameka chu kum zasarih leh sawmsarih leh pasarih chhûng a dam a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kum zanga vêla upa a nih khân Nova chuan fapa Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te a nei a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leiah mihring an lo tam a, fanute pawh an ngah ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian fate chuan mihring nulate hmêlṭhatzia an hmuh chuan an duh duh nupuiah an nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Mihring hi an dam kumkhua ka remti lo, an tisa mi êm mai; kum za leh sawmhnih erawh chu dam thleng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutih hun lai chuan, a hnu deuhvah pawh leiah hian Nefil-ho an awm a. Chûng chu Pathian faten mihring fate nupuia an neiha an thlah tâkte an ni. Chûng mite chu hmânlai mi hrâtkhawkhêng, mi hmingthang tak tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan leia mihring sual nasatzia chu a hmu a, eng lai pawhin thil sual hlîr an ngaihtuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leiah mihring a siam ta chu pawi a ti a, a rilru a na hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Mihring te, ramsa te, a tlenga tleng mi te, chunglêng sava ka siam te hi ka nuai bo mai teh ang, ka siam ta kha pawi ka ti êm mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nova erawh chu Lalpa chuan a ngaina hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hei hi Nova thlahte chanchin chhuina a ni. Nova chu mi ṭha a ni a, a dam rualpuite zîngah sawisêl kai lo awm chhun a ni. Nova chu Pathian nên an lêng dûn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nova chuan fapa pathum, Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ngaihin lei chu a chhe let dêr a, inpâwngnêknain a khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêl chhiat tâkzia chu Pathian chuan a hmu a. Ngai teh, leia mi tin a sual zâwng hlîrin an khawsa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin Nova hnênah, “Mihringte hi tihboral ka tum ta. Lei hi anmahni avângin inpâwngnêknain a khat ta si a, lei pawh hi ka tichhe vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, thing ṭha chi hmangin lawng tuk rawh; lawngah chuan pindante siam la, a chhûng lam leh a pâwn lamah alkatra hnawih chhuak vek ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lawng chu tawng zathuma sei, tawng sawmngaa zau, tawng sawmthuma sângin tuk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lawngah chuan tukverhte siam la, bang leh a chung inkâr chu inchi sâwm leh pariat a ni tûr a ni; lawng kawngka chu a sîrah hawng ang che, chhâwng thum neiin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ngai teh, kei hian lei chîm pil tûr tui ka lêttîr dâwn a ni. Vân hnuaia nunna nei rêng rêng chu ka nuai bo vek dâwn; leia engkim a chhe nghâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang nên erawh chuan thu ka thlung ang a, lawngah i lût ang a, i nupui leh i fate pawh, an nupuite nên lawngah chuan in lût tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil nung tinrêng, tisa pu rêng rêng chu an him theih nân, pahnih zêl, a nu leh a pa hruai lût ve ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sava chi tin nên ran leh a tlenga tleng chi hrang hrang nên an him theih nân pahnih zêl an lût ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In tla tâwk tûr ei tûr la khâwm la, nangni leh anni ei atân chhêk khâwm ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nova chuan Pathian thupêk ang chuan a ti ta vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Nova hnênah, “Nang leh i chhûngte nên lawngah lût vek rawh u; tûnlai mite zîngah nang chauh hi mi dik tak ka hmuh chhun i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leia chi thlaha nung zêl tûrin sa thiang zînga mi tuak sarih zêl, a nu leh a pa; sa thiang lo zînga mi tuak khat zêl, a nu leh a pa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chunglêng sava zînga mi tuak sarih, a nu leh a pa, hruai lût bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûn aṭanga ni sarih ralah ni sawmli chhûng chhûn leh zân ruah ka sûrtîr dâwn a ni. Thil nung ka siam tinrêngte chu lei ata ka timang vek dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nova chuan Pathian thupêk ang chuan a ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei chunga tui a lo lêt khân Nova chu kum zaruka upa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui a lêt dâwn avângin Nova leh a nupui chu, an fate leh an nupuite nên lawngah chuan an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sa thiang leh thiang lo, chunglêng savate leh leia tleng ṭhîn chi tinrêngte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin Nova hnêna thu a pêk angin pahnih zêl, a nu leh a pa, Nova lawng chhûngah chuan an lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni sarih a ral hnu chuan lei chungah tui a lo lêt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nova kum zaruk a nih kum, thla hnihna, ni sâwm leh pasarih ni tak chuan tuithûkpui tuite chu a lo sah a, vân tukverhte chu a inhawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni sawmli leh zan sawmli chhûng ruahpuivânâwn a sûr ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Nova leh a fa pathum, Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te, Nova nupuite leh a mo pathumte chu lawngah an lût a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chumi ni ngei chuan ramsa tinrêng, ran tinrêng, thil nung tinrêng - leia tleng te, sava chi tinrêng, thlâwk thei tinrêng te chu lawngah an lût ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunna thaw nei, tisa pu zawng zawng chu an lût kim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nova hnêna Pathianin thu a pêk angin nupa kawp zêlin an lût a. Lalpa chuan lawng chu a khârsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leiah ni sawmli chhûng zawng tui a lo lêt ta a; tuiin a chîm ang zêlin lawng chu a lâng zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lei chungah tui chu a lo pung a, a chîm sâng tial tial a, lawng pawh chu a lâng zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei chungah tui chu a tam tulh tulh a, a lei chîm chin pawh a sâng tial tial a, tlâng sâng berte pawh a chîm pil ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlâng sâng ber chhîp pawh chu tawng sâwm leh panga laia thûkin a pil a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tisa pu, leia che thei awm zawng zawng, sava te, ran te, ramsa te, a ruala tla chi te, mihring te a chîm hlum zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thaw thei tawh phawt, khawmuala chêng zawng zawng chu an thi zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawvêla awm zawng zawng, mihring te, ran te, leia tleng chi te, chunglêng sava te an boral ta vek a. Nova leh lawng chhûnga awmte chauh chu zuah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tui chuan lei chu ni za leh sawmnga chhûng a chîm ta pûng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chuan Nova te, a awmpui ramsa te leh ran tinrêng chu a hre reng a. Pathian chuan lei chungah thli a tlehtîr a, tui chu a kâm ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuithûkpui sah leh vân tukverh inhawng chu a inkhâr a, vân aṭanga ruahpuivânâwn sûr chu a hân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawi zawiin tui chu a kâm hret hret a, ni za leh sawmnga a ral hnu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a thla sarihna, ni sâwm leh pasarih ni chuan lawng chu Ararat tlângah a innghat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thla sâwmna thleng chuan tui chu a kâm zêl a, a thla sâwmna ni khat ni chuan tlâng chhîpte chu a lang thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sawmli a ral hnu chuan lawng tukverh a siam chu Nova chuan a hawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Choak a chhuah a, leia tui a kâm fel nghâkin a thlâwk a thlâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tui a kâm zo tawh emaw hriat nân ṭhuro a chhuah leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ṭhuro chuan fûkna tûr leichâr a hmu lo va, lawngah chuan a lo kîr leh a, tui chuan lei chu a la chîm vek a ni. Tichuan, a kut a zen chhuak a, a man a, lawng chhûngah chuan a la lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni sarih dang a nghah hnuah lawng aṭang chuan ṭhuro a chhuah leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlai lamah chuan ṭhuro chu a lo kîr a, oliv hnah bal thar a rawn pu a. Nova chuan leia tui chu a kâm zo ta tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni sarih dang a nghah leh hnu chuan ṭhuro chu a chhuah leh a, a lo kîr ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nova kum zaruk leh pakhat kum, thla hmasa ber ni khat ni chuan lei ata tui chu a kang zo ta a. Nova chuan lawng chhîn chu a hawng a, lei chu a châr ta tih a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thla hnihna, ni sawmhnih leh pasarih ni chuan lei chu a ro ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian chuan Nova hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“I nupuite, i fate leh an nupuite nên lawng ata hi chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Savate leh rante pawh hi hruai chhuak ula, an inthlah ang a, leiah an awm darh dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Nova chu a fa te, a nupui te leh a mo te nên an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rannung zawng zawng, leia tleng chi te, chunglêng sava te, leia tla ṭhînte chu a chi chiin an lo chhuak ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nova chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, sa thiang leh sava thiang zînga mi a thlang ṭheuh va, maichâmah chuan hâlralah a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hâl ral rim chu tui a ti hle a; “Mihring avângin khawvêl pum pui hi ka sawisa leh tawh lo vang; mihring thinlung hi a naupan lai aṭangin suala khat a ni si a; thil nung dang pawh tûn ang chuan ka tihlum tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lei hi a awm chhûng chu buh tuh hun te, a seng hun te, khaw vâwt leh khaw lum te, nipui leh thlasik te, chhûn leh zân te a tâwp lo vang,” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chuan Nova leh a fate chu mal a sâwm a, “In chi ṭha sela, pung duah duah ula, lei hi luah khat ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leia ramsa zawng zawng leh tuipuia sangha zawng zawngin an ṭih ang che u a, an zah êm êm ang che u, in kutah ka dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In ei atân thlai hring tinrêng ka pe a che u, thil nung tinrêng, nunna nei zawng zawngte pawh in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa erawh chu a nunna thisen chawpin in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in nunna thisen chhuahtu chungah, ramsa an ni emaw, mihring an ni emaw, kut ka thlâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihring nunna thisen chhuahtu chu, Mi dangin a thisen an chhuahsak ve ang. Mihring hi Pathian anga siam a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tichuan, in chi ṭha sela, Pung deuh deuh ula, Leilung dâp chhuak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian chuan Nova leh a fate hnênah heti hian a ti bawk:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, nangni leh in thlah zêlte tân thu ka thlung ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu chu in hnêna awm, thil nung zawng zawng, sava te, ran te, ramsa te, lawng aṭanga lo chhuak, leia thil nung tinrêngte tân chuan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thuthlung, ka vawn reng tûr chu hei hi a ni: Thil nung tinrêng tihlum tûrin tui ka tilêt ngai tawh lo vang a, lei tichhe tûrin a lêt ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tin, ka kumkhaw thuthlung, nangni leh thil nung zawng zawng nêna kan inkâra ka thuthlung chhinchhiahna chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhûmah chhimbâl ka zâmtîr hi, khawvêl nêna kan inkâra thuthlung chhinchhiahna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei chunga chhûm ka zîntîr hunah chhimbâl chu a lo lang ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nangni leh thil nung tinrêng nêna kan inkâra thuthlung ka thlun chu ka hre reng ṭhîn ang a, tui lo lêtin mi nung zawng zawng a tihlum tawh dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûm zînga chhimbâl a lo lanin ka hmu ang a, nangni leh leia thil nung tinrêng nêna ka thuthlung chu ka hre reng ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu chu nang leh leia thil nung tinrêng nên kan inkâra ka thuthlung chhinchhiahna a ni zêl ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lawng aṭanga lo chhuak, Nova fate chu Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te an ni; Hama chu Kanan mite thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hêng mi pathum hi Nova fate chu an ni, an thlahte chuan lei pum pui hi an dâp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nova chu lo nei mi a ni a, grep huan a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uain chu a in a, a rui a, a puan in chhûnga a mu chu a mu sual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kanan mite thlahtu Hama chuan a pa mu sual chu a va hmu a, a unaute chu a rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sema leh Jafeta chuan puan an la a, an kokia inzâwnin hnungtawlhin an kal a, an pa mu sual chu an va khuh a, an pa mu sual hmu lo tûrin lehlam an hawi tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nova rui chu a lo harh a, a fapa naupang ber Hama thil tih dân chu a han hriat chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kanana chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se, A unaute zîngah chhiahhlawh tê ber ang ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sema Pathian chu fakin awm sela, Kanana chu mi dang chhiahhlawh ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathianin Jafeta tân hmun zuah sela, Sema puan inahte pawh chêng sela, Kanana erawh chu an chhiahhlawh ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nova chu tuilêt hnuah kum zathum leh sawmnga a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nova chu kum zakua leh sawmnga chhûng a dam a ni, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi Nova thlah chhâwng zêlte chanchin a ni. Nova fa Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te chuan tuilêt hnuah fa an nei hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jafeta fate chu Gomera te, Magoga te, Madaia te, Javana te, Tubala te, Meseka te, Tirasa te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gomera fate chu Askenaza te, Rifata te, Togarma te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Javana fate chu Elisa te, Tarsisa te, Kitima te, Dodanima te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu tuipui kam leh thliarkâra awm hnamte thlahtu an ni. Khîngte khi Jafeta thlahte chu an ni, a chi chiin hmun hrang hrangah an awm a, mahni ṭawng bîk an hmang ṭheuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hama thlahte chu Kusa te, Mizraima te, Puta te, Kanana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kusa thlahte chu Seba te, Havila te, Sabta te, Raama te, Sabteka te an ni. Raama fate chu Seba leh Dedana an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kusa chuan fapa Nimroda a nei a. Chu mi chu khawvêla râltu mi ropui tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa mit tlung, ramvâk mi a ni a. ‘Nimroda angin Lalpa mit tlung, ramvachal ni ve ang che,’ an inti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tîrah chuan Babulon-ah te, Erek-ah te, Akad-ah te a lal a, chûng zawng zawng chu Sinar rama awm vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu ram aṭang chuan Asuria ramah a kal a, Ninevi khua te, Rehobot-ir te, Kala khua te a din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ninevi leh Kala khaw inkârah an khawpui ber Resen pawh a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mizraima thlahte chu hêng mite hi an ni: Lud mi te, Anam mi te, Lebab mi te, Nafta mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros mi te, Kaslu mi te. Hêng mite hi Filistia leh Kaftor mite thlahtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kanana chuan fapa Sidona a nei hmasa a, Hetha pawh a nei leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jebus mi te, Amor mi te, Girgas mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiv mi te, Arka mi te, Sin mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arvad mi te, Zemar mi te leh Hamath mi te thlahtu a ni bawk. Nakin hnuah chuan Kanana thlahte chu an inzâr darh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sidon aṭanga Gaza bul Gerar thlengin an ram an zauh a; Sodom te, Gomora te, Adma te, Lasa bula Zeboim khaw thlengin an nei zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khîng khi Hama thlahte chu an ni, a hnam hnamin, mahni ram ramah an awm a, mahni ṭawng ṭheuh an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eber mite thlahtu Jafeta u Sema pawhin fate a nei ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sema fate chu: Elama te, Asura te, Arpaksada te, Luda te, Arama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Arama fate chu: Uza te, Hula te, Gethera te, Masa te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arpaksada chuan fapa Sela a nei a, Sela chuan fapa Ebera a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ebera chuan fapa pahnih a nei a, pakhat hming chu Pelega a ni, a hun laiin khawvêl mi an inṭhen ta a. A nau hming chu Joktana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joktana thlahte chu; Almodada te, Selefa te, Hazarmaveta te, Jera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hadorama te, Uzala te, Dikla te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Obala te, Abimaela te, Seba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ofira te, Havila te, Jobaba te an ni. Khîng zawng khi Joktana thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram luah chu Mesa aṭanga Sefar thleng zak a ni a, khawchhak lam tlângram zawng zawng khi a huam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khîng khi Sema thlahte chu an ni, mahni chi chi, mahni ram ramah a hnam hnamin an awm a, mahni ṭawng ṭheuh an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nova thlah hlâwm hrang hrangte chu an thlahtute leh an awmna ram ang zêlin khitiang khi a ni. Hnam dangte pawh tuilêt hnua an laka lo pianga darh ta an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawvêl pum puiah ṭawng khat an hmang a, an awphawi pawh a inang vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawchhak lam aṭangin mi an lo pêm a, Sinar phai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hawh u, leirawhchan siam ila, chang takin i rawh ang u,” an ti a. Lung aiah leirawhchan chu an hmang a, hlum banin an châr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hawh u, khawpui i din ang, in sâng tak, vân tawng sa ila, hmingṭha i chher ang u; chutilo chu, khawvêlah kan awm darh zo dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei miten khawpui an siam leh in sâng an sa chu en tûrin Lalpa chu a lo chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ṭawng khat hmang, hnam pumkhat thiltih duh dân heti hi a nih si chuan an tum ang ang tih theih loh an nei lo mai ang a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thu sawi inhre tawn lo tûrin hawh u, an ṭawng i zu tihhransak ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan chuta ṭang chuan khawvêl pum puiah a hnawt darh a, khua chu an sa thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, chu hmun chu ‘Babel’ tih a ni ta a; khawvêl pum pui mite ṭawng chu inhre tawn thei lovin Lalpa chuan a tihrang ta a; chuta ṭang chuan ram tinah a hnawt darh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hei hi Sema thlah chhâwng zêlte chanchin chu a ni: Tuilêt zawh kum hnih hnua a fapa Arpaksada a pian khân Sema chu kum za a ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arpaksada pian hnuin Sema chu kum zanga chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh panga a nihin Arpaksada chuan fapa Sela a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sela a pian hnu chuan Arpaksada chu kum zali leh pathum chhûng a la dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum sawmthum a nihin Sela chuan fapa Ebera a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ebera pian hnu chuan Sela chu kum zali leh pathum chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh pali a nihin Ebera chuan fapa Pelega a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pelega pian hnu chuan Ebera chu kum zali leh sawmthum chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum sawmthum a nihin Pelega chuan fapa Reua a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Reua pian hnu chuan Pelega chu kum zahnih leh pakaw chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh pahnih a nihin Reua chuan fapa Seruga a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Seruga a pian hnu chuan Reua chu kum zahnih leh pasarih a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum sawmthum a nihin Seruga chuan fapa Nahora a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nahora pian hnu chuan Seruga chu kum zahnih chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pakua a nihin Nahora chuan fapa Tera a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tera pian hnu chuan Nahora chu kum za leh sâwm pakaw chhûng a dam a, fanu fapa dangte a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abrama te, Nahora te, Harana te an pian chuan Tera chu kum sawmsarih a tling tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tera thlah zêlte chanchin chu hetiang hi a ni: Tera chuan fapa Abrama te, Nahora te, Harana te a nei a, Harana chuan fapa Lota a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Harana chu Kaldai ram Ur khuaah, a pianna ramah chuan, a pa Tera a la dam laiin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abrama leh Nahora chuan nupui an nei a: Abrama nupui hming chu Saraii a ni a, Nahora nupui hming chu Milkaii a ni. Milkaii leh Iskaii chu Harana fanu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saraii chu a ching a, fa a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tera chuan a fapa Abrama te, a tupa Lota, Harana fapa te, a monu Saraii, a fapa Abrama nupuite chu a hruai a, Kaldai ram Ur khua chu an chhuahsan a. Kanan rama kal tûrin an chhuak a; mahse, Haran khua an thlen chuan awmhmun an khuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tera chu kum zahnih leh panga chhûng a dam a, Haran-ah chuan Tera chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Abrama hnênah “In ram hi i laichînte leh i pa inte nên chhuahsan la, ka kawhhmuh tûr che ramah chuan kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam ropui takah ka siam ang che: mal ka sâwm ang che a, i hming ka tithang ang a, malsâwmna i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Malsâwmsaktu che chu mal ka sâwm ang a, ânchhe lawhtu che chu ânchhia ka lawh ang; khawvêla hnam tinrêng i zârah an nihlawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa thu ang chuan Abrama chu a thawk chhuak a, Lota pawh a rual chuan a kal ve a. Haran a chhuahsan khân Abrama chu kum sawmsarih leh pangaa upa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abrama chuan a nupui Saraii leh a nau fapa Lota chu a hruai a, Haran khuaa an awm chhûnga an sum deh chhuah zawng zawng kengin, ṭhuihruai an neih belh tâk zawng zawng nên Kanan ram an pan a, an va thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan Abrama chu a kal zêl a, Sekem hmun More sasaw thing awmna chu a thleng a. Chutih lai chuan Kanan mite chu chu ramah chuan an la awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrama hnênah Lalpa chu a inlâr a, “He ram hi a ni i thlahte ka pêk tûr ram chu,” a rawn ti a. Chutah chuan a hnêna lo lang Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuta ṭangin Bethel chhak lam tlângah a insawn a; tah chuan bûk a khuar a, khawthlang lamah Bethel a awm a, khawchhak lamah Ai khua. Chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam leh a, Lalpa hming chu a lam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Negeb ram panin zawi zawiin a insawn zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan ṭâm a tla a, ṭâm chu a nat êm avângin Abrama chuan ṭâm tlân tûrin Aigupta ram a pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta ram a thlen dâwn chuan a nupui Saraii hnênah, “Ngawi teh, i hmêlṭhatzia ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta miten an hmuh che chuan, ‘A nupui a ni,’ an ti ang a, min that mai ang a, nang an zuah si ang che; ‘A farnu ka ni,’ ti mai teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, nangmah avângin min ti ṭha ang a, min zuah dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abraman Aigupta ram a zu thleng a. Aigupta mite chuan a nupui chu hmêlṭha an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Farawa khâwnbâwlte chuan an han hmu ve a, Farawa hriata an fak tâk êm avâng chuan Farawa inah chuan an la lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah avâng chuan Abrama chu an ti ṭha hle a; berâm te, ran te, sabengtung te, chhiahhlawh nula leh tlangvâl te, sabengtungpui te, sanghâwngsei te an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Abrama nupui Saraii vâng chuan Farawa leh a chhûngte chu hri na tak a veitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Farawa chuan Abrama chu a ko va, “Ka chunga i thiltih dân hi engtizia nge? I nupui a nih engtizia nge min hrilh loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Ka farnu a ni,’ i ti a, nupuiah ka la lût mai a ni lâwm ni? I nupui hi hruai la, hawpui daih rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Farawa chuan mi a tîr a, Abrama chu a nupui leh a neih zawng zawng nên an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭang chuan Abrama chu Negeb-ah, a nupui leh a neih zawng zawng nên, an chho va, Lota pawh a tel zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrama chuan tangkarua leh rangkachak te leh ran rualte a ngah êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Negeb aṭang chuan a bûk khuarna hmun Bethel leh Ai inkâr panin Bethel lamah a inchhawp chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmaa maichâm a siamna hmun kha a thleng a; tah chuan, Lalpa hming a lam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abrama kalpui Lota pawh chuan berâm te, bâwng te a ngah hle a, chhûng hung tak an ni ve tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ran vulh an ngah êm a, awm dûn tûr chuan ramin a daih ta lo va; an awm ho hlei thei ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrama ran pute leh Lota ran pute inkârah innghirnghona a chhuak ta a. Chutih laiin chu ramah chuan Kanan mi leh Periz mite pawh an la awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abrama chuan Lota hnênah, “Nang leh kei, kan inkârah innghirnghona awm lul suh se, pafa kan nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram lah hei a awm duai a, awm hran zai rêl mai teh; vei lam hi i duh zâwk leh ding lamah ka kal ang a, ding lam i duh zâwk leh vei lam ka pan mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lota chuan a han thlîr vêl a, Jordan lui ruam chu Zoar thlengin Lalpa huan ang mai, Aigupta ram anga ram ṭha, tui ṭhatna ram a ni tih a hmu a, Sodom leh Gomora pawh Lalpa chuan a la tichhe si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lota chuan Jordan lui ruam chu awmna atân a thlang a, khawchhak lam chu a pan a, an awm hrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abrama chu Kanan ramah chuan a awm ta zêl a, Lota chuan phai ram khawpui zîngah, Sodom khaw bulah awmhmun a khuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sodom mite chu Lalpa ngaiha mi sual buru tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lota a awm hran tâk hnu chuan Lalpa chuan Abrama hnênah, “Han hawi kual la, chhim leh hmâr lam te, chhak leh thlang lam te thlîr vêl teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I hmuh phâk ram zawng zawng hi i thlahte pawhin an neih kumkhua atân ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leia vaivut anga tamin i thlahte ka tipung ang a, vaivut chhiar sên loh ang hian chhiar sên an ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tho la, ram dung leh vâng hi fang chhuak teh, ka pêk tawh che hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abrama chuan a puan in a sawn a, Mamre sasaw bul, Hebron kiangah awmhmun a khuar ta a. Chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sinar lal Amrafela te, Elasar lal Arioka te, Elam lal Kedorlaomera te, Goim lal Tidala te pali chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sodom lal Bera te, Gomora lal Birsa te, Adma lal Sinaba te, Zeboim lal Semebera te leh Zoar an tih tâk Bela lalte an rawn rûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng lal pangate hi Sidim ruam, Tuipui Thi ruamah an lo ṭang tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pahnih chhûng chu Kedorlaomera hnuaiah an awm a, a kum sâwm leh pathum kum chuan an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pali kum chuan Kedorlaomera leh a thurualpui lalte chu an lo thawk a, Asterot-Karnaim rama Refa-hote, Ham rama Zuzim-ho te, Seva-kiriathaim rama Enim-ho te leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thlalêr depa awm El-paran lui, Seir tlângrama awm Hor-ho te thleng chuan an rawn hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hawn pah chuan Kades an tih tâk En-mispat lamah an kual a, Amalek-ho ram zawng zawng leh Zazon-tamar rama Amor-ho te an tudawl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng avâng chuan Sodom lal te, Gomora lal te, Adma lal te, Zeboim lal te, Zoar an tih tâk Bela lalte chu an lo thawk a, Sidim ruamah ṭan an lo khawh tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Elam lal Kedorlaomera te, Goim lal Tidala te, Sinar lal Amrafela te, Elasar lal Arioka te pali chu hêng lal pangate hian an lo bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sidim ruamah chuan alkatra khur a awm thluah a, Sodom leh Gomora lal tlânchhia chu chûngah chuan an biru a; mi dang pawh an tlânchhia a, tlângramah an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomora mite thil neih zawng zawng, an buh te nên an mansak a, an ṭinsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abrama nau fapa Lota, Sodom khuaa awm pawh kha, a neih zawng zawng nên an man bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Indonaa tlânchhia pakhat chuan chûng thu chu Hebrai-pa Abrama chu a rawn hrilh a. Chutih lai chuan Eskola leh Anera laichîn Amor mi Mamre-a sasaw kûng bulah Abrama chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abrama chuan a nau fapa Lota chu salah an man tih a hriat chuan a ina piang râlkai tawh mi zathum leh sâwm leh pariat a hruai a, Dan thlengin a ûmzui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zâna hmêlma bei tûra ruat, ama hote chuan an hneh a, Damaska hmâr lam Hoba khaw thlengin an ûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An sum lâk zawng zawng chu an chhuhsak a, a nau fa Lota leh a neih zawng zawng chu hmeichhia leh mi dangte nên a hruai haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kedorlaomera leh a thurualpui lalte hneha a lo haw chu Sodom lal chuan Save ruamah a lo hmuak a, chu hmun chu ‘lal ruam’ an ti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Salem lal Melkisedeka pawhin chhang leh uain kengin a rawn hmuak bawk a, ani chu Pathian Chungnungbera puithiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mal a lo sâwmsak a, “Pathian Chungnungbera, lei leh vân neitu chuan Abrama hi malsâwm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hmêlmate ngamtîrtu Pathian Chungnungbera chu Fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a. Abrama chuan a râllâk engkim aṭang chuan ani chu sâwma pakhat a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sodom lal chuan Abrama hnênah, “Thil dang chu nei la, ka mite kha erawh chu mi pe kîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abrama chuan Sodom lal chu a chhâng a, “ Lalpa Pathian Chungnungbera, lei leh vân neitu hnênah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘La zai khat tê pawh, pheikhawk hrui khat tê pawh, i ta rêng rêng pakhat mah ka la lo vang,’ tiin thu ka lo tiam tawh a ni; chutilo chu, ‘Abrama chu ka tihhausak alâwm,’ I ti dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka miten an eiral tawh chu ei ral ni sela, a dang chu eng mah ka la lo vang; ka thurualpui Anera mite, Eskola mite leh Mamre-a mite erawh chuan an chanvo tûr chu la rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Abrama chu zêlin a awm a, Lalpa chuan a rawn bia a. “Abram, thlaphâng suh, I tân phaw ka nih hi, I dawn tûr hi a ropui a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrama chuan, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, fa ka nei lo hlen mai dâwn a, ka rokhâwmtu tûr lah Damaska mi Eliezara daih a ni ang a, eng nge mi dawntîr ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abrama chuan a sawi zêl a, “Ngai teh, fa min pe si lo va, ka ina piang ka chhiahhlawhin ka ro a luah ngei dâwn mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a rawn chhâng a, “Chu mi chu i roluahtu tûr a ni lo, nangma fa ngeiin i ro a luah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pâwnah a hruai chhuak a, “Vân lam khi thlîr teh, arsite khi i chhiar sêng em?” a ti a. “Khiti zât khi i thlahte an la ni dâwn” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ring a, chu chu a diknaah a lo pawmsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hnênah chuan heti hian a ti ta a: “He ram hi neihtîr tûr chein Kaldai ram Ur khua aṭanga ko chhuaktu che Lalpa kha ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, ka ta tûr a nih engtin nge ka hriat ang?” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bâwngpa kum thum mi te, kêlpui kum thum mi te, berâmpa kum thum mi te, ṭhuro leh pârva no nên mi han lâk teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng chu a rawn lâksak a, a laiah a phel a, a phel chu inepin a tlarin a dah a; savate erawh chu a phel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sa ruangahte chuan mu an lo ṭum ṭhîn a, Abrama chuan a lo hnawt zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni a tlâk dâwn suar suar chuan a muhîl ta sulh a, hlauhawm thim takin a rawn bawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abrama hnênah chuan, “I thlahte chu an hriat ngai loh ramah mikhual an ni dâwn; bawihah an tâng ang a, kum zali chhûng chu an tiduhdah ang tih hre rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rawng an bâwlsak hnamte chu ka hrem ang a, chumi hnuah chu ram chu muk ṭânin an chhuahsan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang erawh chu, thlamuang takin i pi leh pute hnênah i châwl ve ang a, tarkûna damin an phûm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi dang erawh chu chhuan li a ral hunah hetah hian an lo kîr leh ang, Amor mite suahsualna vâwrtâwp a thlen hunah chuan,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni a tlâka, khua a thim tâk hle hnuin thuk, khu lût lût leh meichher alh hluah hluah chu sa ruang kârah chuan a vei a vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Lalpan Abrama hnênah thu a thlung ta a, “He ram hi i thlahte hnênah ka pe ta. Aigupta ram lui aṭanga Eufretis luipui inkâr ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken mi te, Kenis mi te, Kadmon mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hit mi te, Periz mi te, Refaim te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amor mi te, Kanan mi te, Girgas leh Jebus mi te ram hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrama chu a nupui Saraii chuan fa a hrinsak lo va. Saraii chuan Aigupta mi, Hagari, bawih nula a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrama hnênah Saraii chuan, “Ngai teh, Lalpa chuan fa neih min phalsak si lo va, ka bawihnu hi mutpui mai teh; ka fa ve tûr min hrinsak dâwn nia,” a ti a. Abrama chuan Saraii thu chu a zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Abrama chu kum sâwm Kanan rama a awm hnu chuan a nupui Saraii chuan a bawihnu Hagari, Aigupta mi chu, hmei atân a pasal chu a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lo mutpui a, nau a pai ta a. Nau a pai tih a inhriat hnu chuan a pi chu a ngainêp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Saraii chuan Abrama hnênah, “Heti taka min thamlo ta hi i thiam loh a ni. Ka bawihnu hi keimah ngeiin hmeiah ka neihtîr che a nih kha; nau a pai tih a inhriat aṭangin min ngainêp ta hle si a; chuvângin, Lalpa chuan nang nêna kan inkâr thu hi tifel teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahse, Abrama chuan Saraii chu a chhâng a, “I bawihnu chu i kuta awm alâwm, ṭha i tih ang angin ti rawh,” a ti a. Saraii chuan a tiduhdah ta a, a tlân bo phah ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkohvin Hagari chu thlalêrah Sur kawnga tuikhur kiangah a lo hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnênah, “Saraii bawihnu Hagar, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i niha, khawiah nge i kal dâwn?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka pi Saraii ka tlân bosan a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan, “I pi hnênah kîr leh rawh, a hau che pawhin tuar hrâm hrâm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan a sawi zêl a, “I thlahte ka tihpunsak ṭeuh dâwn che asin, tu man an chhiar sêng lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh vêk chuan a sawi leh a, “Ngai teh, nau i pai hi; fapa i hring ang a, Lalpa chuan i manganzia a hre si a, a hmingah Ismaela sa ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chu ram sabengtung ang a ni ang a, mi tu pawh a bei zêl ang a, anni pawhin an lo bei ang. A unaute tu mah a ngeih lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hnêna thusawitu Lalpa hmingah chuan, “El-roi’ a vuah a. “Min hmutu chu ka hmu ve ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, chu tuikhur chu ‘Beer-lahai-roi’ tih a ni ta a, Kades leh Bered inkâra awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hagari chuan Abrama chu fapa a hrinsak a, Abrama chuan Hagari fa hmingah chuan, ‘Ismaela’ a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrama chu Hagarin Ismaela a hrinsak khân kum sawmriat leh paruka upa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrama chu kum sawmkua leh pakua a nihin a hnênah Lalpa chu a rawn inlâr a, “El-Sadaia ka nih hi, ka duhzâwng angin nung la, sawisêlbovin awm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang nêna kan inkârah thu ka thlung ang a, nasa takin ka tipung ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abrama chu hmai lei siin a kûn a, a Pathian chuan a be zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hei hi i tâna ka thuthlung chu a ni: Hnam tam tak thlahtu i ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />i hming hi Abrama ni tawh lovin Abrahama a ni tawh zâwk ang; hnam tam tak paah ka siam tâk che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I chi ka tiṭha ang a, hnam tam tak thlahtu i ni ang a, lalte pawh i hring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan inkâra ka thuthlung chu i thlah lo awm zêlte thlengin ka tinghet tlat ang; i tân leh i thlah zêlte tân kumkhaw Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“I thlah lo la awm tûrte rochun atân kumkhuaa an neih tûrin i mikhualna Kanan ram pum pui hi ka pe a che, an Pathian ka ni zêl bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian chuan Abrahama hnênah thu a sawi zêl a, “Nang pawhin ka thuthlung hi i vawng reng tûr a ni, i thlah lo awm tûrte pawhin an zâwm zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang leh i thlahte nêna ka thuthlung, in zawm zêl tûr chu hei hi a ni: in zînga mipa tawh phawt chu an serh tan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In serh vun hmâwr in tan tûr a ni; chu chu kan inkâra thuthlung chhinchhiahna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumkhuain in zînga mipa naupang chu ni riat a tlinah a serh in tan tûr a ni; in chhûng zînga piang, bawihte leh in chipui ni lo tangkaa in leite pawh an serh in tan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In ina piang bawih pawh in lei bawih pawh, an serh in tan ngei tûr a ni. In taksaah ka thuthlung chhinchhiahna chu kumkhuain a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipa tawh phawt, serh tan loh, a vun hmâwr tan loh chu a laichînte zîng ata tuithlâr tûr a ni, ka thuthlung a bawhchhiat avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian chuan Abrahama hnênah heti hian a ti bawk: “I nupui Saraii pawh hi Saraii ti tawh suh, a hmingah Sari a ni tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mal ka sâwm ang a, mal ka sâwm hnuah fapa a hrinsak ang che. Hnam tam tak nu a ni ang a, mi tam tak chunga lal tûrte pawh a thlah aṭangin an lo piang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abrahama chu lei siin a kûn a, a nuih a za a, “Kum za mi hian fa ka nei ang a, kum sawmkaw mi Sari hian nau a pai ang maw?” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abrahama chuan Pathian hnênah, “Ṭha i tih chuan Ismaela hi dam zêl teh phawt se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian erawh chuan a chhâng a, “I nupui Sari hian fa a hrinsak dâwn che alâwm, a hmingah Isaka i sa dâwn nia; ka thuthlung hi kumkhua atân amah leh a thlah zêlte tân ka vawng tlat dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ismaela thu i sawi pawh ka hria e; ngai teh, ani pawh mal ka sâwm a, a chi ka tiṭha ang a, nasa takin ka tipung ang. Lal sâwm leh pahnih a hring ang a, hnam lian takah ka din dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thuthlung erawh hi chu nakkum hetih huna Sarin a hrin tûr Isaka tân ka vawng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sawi zawh chuan Pathian chuan Abrahama chu a chhohsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Abrahama chuan a fapa Ismaela leh a bawih, a ina piang leh a lei pawh, a ina awm mipa zawng zawng chu a hruai a, chumi ni chuan Pathianin a hrilh ang chuan an serh vun hmâwr chu a tansak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A serh vun a tan chuan Abrahama chu kum sawmkua leh pakaw mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ismaela pawh serh a tansak ni chuan kum sâwm leh kum thum mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi ni ngei chuan Abrahama te, a fapa Ismaela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a ṭhuihruai zawng zawng, a ina piang bawihte leh hnam dang, bawiha a leite chu an serh a tansak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mamre-a sasaw bula a puan in kawngkaah, chhûn ni sat lai takin Abrahama chu a ṭhu a, a hnênah Lalpa chu a rawn inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A han en chuan a bul maiah mi pathum an lo ding reng a; a han hmuh veleh chuan anni chu lâwm tûrin puan in kawngka ata chu a tlân chhuak a. Kûnin chibai a bûk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pu, min khawngaih la, i chhiahhlawh hi min kal pêl lo hrâm teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui tlêm han la ila, in kete sil ula, thing hlimah hian châwl rih teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In chhiahhlawh in rawn tlawh ta sa sa, chhâng tlêm ka han lâk ang che u a, in intiharh dâwn nia; chumi zawhah chuan in kal zêl a ni ang chu,” a ti a. “Chuti chu, i sawi ang chuan ti ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abrahama chu puan inah a tlân lût a, Sari chu a ko va, “Chhangphut ṭha chi ṭîn khat la chhuak la, hmet la, chhangpêr siam thuai teh” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrahama chu bâwng rual awmnaah a tlân a, bâwngno chum thau tak a man a, chhiahhlawh a talhtîr a, a kang hmin ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bâwngsa kan chu bâwnghnute leh a dak nên a rawn la a, an hmaah a hlui a; an ei a, ani pawh chu an bulah, thing hlimah chuan a ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Khawnge i nupui Sari a awm?” an ti a. “Puan in chhûngah hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pakhat chuan, “Thla kua a ral hunah ka lo kal leh ang a, i nupui Sari hian fapa a hring ang,” a ti a. A hnung maiah, puan in luhna phênah Sari chuan a lo ngaithla reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abrahama leh Sari chu tar tawh tak, upa tak an ni; Sari pawh hmeichhe dân pangngaiin a awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sari chu a nuih a za a, “Kei tarzûr tawh hian ka pasal ka la thlahlel ang maw, ani pawh a upa hle tawh si?” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Abrahama hnênah, “Engtizia nge Sari nuih a zata, ‘Ka tar tawh vei nên fa ka la nei tak tak ang maw?’ a tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa tân tih theih loh a awm em ni? Thla kaw ral hnuah ka lo kal leh ang a, Sari hian fapa a lo hring tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sari chuan a hlau va, a pha chung a, “Ka nuih a za lo ve,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “I nuih a zat kha le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng mite chu chuta ta chu an tho va, Sodom khaw lam chu an zu thlîr a. Thlah tûrin Abrahama pawh an rualin a kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka thiltih tum hi Abrahama lakah ka zêp ang em aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abrahama hi hnam lian, hnam ropui tak a la ni ngei dâwn a, khawvêl hnam zawng zawngin mal insâwmsak nân tak ani hi an lam dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A fate leh a thlah zêlte Lalpa duhzâwnga awma, thil ṭha leh thil dik zirtîr tûrin ani hi ka thlan chhuah a ni si a. Lalpa chuan Abrahama hnêna a thutiam chu a tihlawhtling ngei dâwn si a,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Sodom leh Gomora khaw sual thu leh an thiltih râpthlâk thu ka beng a lo thleng hi a dik tak tak em tih en tûrin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka chhuk dâwn a ni, ka zu hre chiang teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite chu Sodom khuaa kal tûrin an chhuk ta a. Abrahama erawh chu Lalpa bulah a ding khawtlai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a hnaih a, “Mi sualte zînga awm mi ṭhate pawh chu i tiboral tel dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuaah chuan mi ṭha, mi pawi khawih lo sawmnga awm sela, chûng mi ṭha sawmngate avângin khawpui chu zuah lovin i tichhia ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi ṭhate leh ṭha lote tuar inang rengin mi ṭhate chu mi sualte nên i tiboral êm lo vang chu! Lei chung zawng zawnga thuneitu, nang meuh chuan dik lo takin thil i ti âwm si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Sodom khuaah mi ṭha sawmnga ka hmuh chuan anmahni avângin khua chu ka zuah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a sawi leh a, “Kei vaivut leh meivâp mai hian Lalpa chu ka be pawp ta sa sa si che a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mi ṭha pangain sawmnga tling lo ta sela? Pangaa an tlin loh avângin khaw pum chu i tichhia ang maw?” a ti a. “Mi sawmli leh panga ka hmuh chuan ka tichhe lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A la zâwt ta zêl a, “Mi sawmli chauh awm sela?” a ti a. “Mi sawmli avâng pawhin ka tichhe lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ka sawi zêl pawhin Lalpa chuan ninawm ti teh suh se, mi sawmthum chauh lo awm sela?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Mi sawmthum chauh pawh hmu ila ka tichhe lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu ka zâwt ta law law che a, sawmhnih chauh awm sela?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mi sawmhnih avâng pawh chuan ka tichhe lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a. “ Lalpa chuan lung lovah neih teh suh se, hei bâk hi chu ka zâwt tawh lo vang che, mi sâwm chauh awm ta sela?” a ti a. “Chûng mi sâwmte avâng pawh chuan ka tichhe lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abrahama nên an inbiak zawh chuan Lalpa chu a kal ta a. Abrahama pawh a in lamah a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vântirhkoh pahnih chuan tlaiah Sodom khua chu an zu thleng a, Lota chu Sodom khaw kulh kawngkhâr bulah a lo ṭhu a. Anni chu a hmuh chuan be tûrin a tho va, hmai lei si-a kûnin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pute u, in chhiahhlawh ina zân riak tûrin lo kal hrâm teh u. In kête in sil ang a, zîng takah in kal leh mai dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ni lo ve, khawlaiah kan riak ang,” an ti a. A sâwm tlut tlut avângin an zui a, a inah chuan an lût ta a. Ei tûr a buatsaih a, chhangpêr a hem hmin a, an ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mut hmain khuaa mi, Sodom khaw paho, a pui a pangin vêng tina mipa zawng zawng chuan a in chu an rawn hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lota chu an au va, a hnênah, “Zânina i mikhualte kha khawiah nge an awm? Han hruai chhuak rawh, kan lo pâwl teh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lota chu kawngkhârah chuan a va chhuak a, a khâr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ṭhiante u, hetiang thil sual hi tih tum lul lo teh hrâm u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipa la khawih loh fanu pahnih ka nei a, ka rawn hruai chhuahsak ang che u, in duh duhin in lo ti dâwn nia. Ka mikhual, ka in rawn pante hi zawng, eng mah tih lul suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kiang rawh, nang mikhual mai mai, kan chunga thu neih i tum vei em ni? Anni aiin kan sawisa na zâwk mai tûr che nia,” an ti a. Lota chu an rawn chîm ta huk a, kawngkhâr chu chhut chhiat an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vântirhkohte chuan an ban a, Lota chu an man a, inah an hnûk lût a, kawng chu an khâr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawngka bula awm a lian a tê chu an mit an chhun delsak a, kawngkhâr chu an hmu thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite chuan Lota hnênah, “He khuaah hian mi dang, fapa te, fanu te, laichîn hnai i neih apiangte khua aṭang hian hruai chhuak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He khua hi kan tichhe dâwn, an chanchin Lalpa benga thleng chu a râpthlâk êm a, tichhe tûrin min tîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lota chu a chhuak a, a fanu neitu tûr, a mâkpa hualte chu a va hrilh a, “Tho ula, kan khua hi tlânsan rawh u. Lalpa chuan a tichhe dâwn,” a ti a. A mâkpa hualte chuan fiamthu a thawhah an lo ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khawfîng a chahin vântirhkohte chuan Lota chu an tur sek a, “Hmanhmawh rawh, i nupui leh i fanu pahnih, heta awmte hi hruai chhuak teh, he khaw hremna hi in tuar ve dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani erawh chu muangchângin a che a. Tichuan, mite chuan a nupui leh a fanute kut chu a kut nên an chelh a, anni chu Lalpa chuan a lainat êm si a; chuvângin, khua ata chu an kai chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hruai chhuah hnu chuan, “Kal thuai thuai rawh u, hnung lam pawh hawi suh u, phaiah hian khawiah mah châwl hek suh u, tlângahte sâwn tlân rawh u, in tuar ve hlauh dah ang e,” Lota hnênah chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lota chuan, “Ni lo ve, ka pu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />min chhanhima min khawngaih ta sa sa, i chhiahhlawh hi dawh hrâm teh; tlângram pana ka tlân chuan he thil ṭha lo hian min nang hman ang a, ka thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hmaa khaw te tak tê saw tlân nân a hnai ber a, tah sâwn ka tlân ang e, ngaihmawh tham pawh a nih loh saw. Kan thih loh nân tah sâwn kan tlân mai ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“I thu chu ka zâwm mai a ni ang chu, i khaw sawi chu ka tichhe lo nâng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmanhmawh la, tah chuan tlân rawh; i thlen hma chu eng mah ka tih theih loh hi,” a ti a. Chuvâng chuan, he khua hian Zoar tih hming a pu ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lotan Zoar khua a thlenin chu ramah chuan ni a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, vân aṭangin, Lalpa mei, kât kâng chu Lalpa chuan Sodom leh Gomora khuaah chuan a sûrtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chûng khuate chu a tichhe vek a, phaizâwla khuate leh a chhûnga chêngte chu leia thil ṭote lamin a tichhe ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lota nupui erawh chuan a thlîr kîr vei a, chi khâwn dingah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abrahama chu zîng takah a tho va, Lalpa bula a dinna hmunah khân a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomora khua te leh a phairam pum chu a zu thlîr vêl a, meipui khu anga khu luih luih chauh chu a hmu thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin phairam khuate a tihchhiat khân Abrahama chu a hre reng a. Lota chênna khua a tihchhiat pawh khân Lota chu a chhan chhuahsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zoar khuaa awm reng a hlauh avângin Lota chu a fanu pahnih nên tlângramah an chho va, an awm ta a. A fanu pahnih nên chuan pûkah an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A upa zâwk chuan a nau hnênah, “Kan pa hi a tar tawh hle a, khawvêl pum pui tih dân anga min nei tûr mipa an awm tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ti rawh, kan pa hi uainin hrai ila, a bulah i mu ang; Tichuan, kan pa chi a mang dâwn lo nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan an pa chu uainin an hrai rui a. A upa zâwk chu a pa bulah chuan a va mu a, ani chuan a lo mut lai emaw, a thawh leh lai emaw a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A tûkah chuan a upa zâwk chuan a nau hnênah, “Ngai teh, nizân khân kan pa bulah ka mu a, zâninah pawh uainin i hrai leh ang; a bulah va mu ve ang che; tichuan, kan pa chi a mang dâwn lo nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An pa chu uainin an hrai a, a naupang zâwk chu a tho va, an pa bulah chuan a va mu a, a lo mut lai emaw, a thawh leh lai emaw a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lota fanu pahnih chuan an pa fa chu an pai ve ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A upa zâwk chuan fapa a nei a, a hmingah ‘Moaba’ a sa a; chu mi chu tûnlaia Moab-ho thlahtu hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A naupang zâwk pawh chuan fapa a nei a, a hmingah ‘Ben-amona’ a sa a, tûnlaia Amon mite thlahtu hi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrahama chu Negeb lamah a kal zêl a, Kades leh Sur inkârah awmhmun a khuar a, Gerar khuaa an awm laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a nupui Sari chu “Ka farnu a ni,” a ti a; tichuan, Abimeleka, Gerar lal chuan, mi a tîr a, Sari chu a inah a hruaitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zan khat chu mumangah Abimeleka hnênah Pathian chu a lo kal a, “He hmeichhia hi mi nupui a ni a, i lâksak vei a, i thi ngei ang,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan a kut hmâwr pawh a la dehsak lo va; “ Lalpa , pawi khawih lo pawh hi i tihlum tho dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ngeiin, ‘Ka farnu a ni,’ ka hnênah a ti a, a hmeichhia lahin ‘Ka nuṭa a ni,’ a ti bawk si a, rilru thianghlim leh dik tak pua ti ka ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathianin a mangah chuan a chhâng a, “Rilru thianghlim tak pua ti i nih ka hria e, ka laka thil sual i tih loh nân ka vêng tlat che atin alâwm a kut hmâwr i khawih pawh ka phal loh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />He mi nupui hi tûnah pe kîr leh rawh, zâwlnei a nih hi. I nun theih nân a dilsak ang che, i pêk kîr leh loh chuan i thi ang, i mi zawng zawngte pawh an thi vek ang tih hre rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûk zîngah Abimeleka chuan a ṭhuihruaite a ko khâwm a, a thil hmuh chu a hrilh vek a, an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan Abrahama chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Kan chungah eng nge i tih tâk le? I pawi eng nge kan sawia, ka chungah leh ka ram chungah hetiang thiam lohna nasa tak hi i rawn thlen? Thil âwm lo tak i ti a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimeleka vêk chuan Abrahama hnênah, “Eng vângin nge kan chungah hetiang thil hi i rawn tih?” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, “He khuaah hian Pathian ṭih mi tu mah an awm ka ring lo va, ka nupui avâng hian min lo that mai ang tih ka hlau atin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka farnu pawh a ni tak tak asin; nu hrang laka ka pa fanu a ni a, nupuiah ka nei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin kan pa in leh lo aṭanga min vahvaihtîr tâk hnuah hi chuan, ‘Ka chunga i khawngaihna i lantîr dân tûr chu hmun tinah, ka nuṭa a ni, ti zêl rawh,’ ka ti rêng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan berâm te, bâwngpa te, bawihpa te, bawihnu te a thlang chhuak a, Abrahama chu a pe a, a nupui Sari pawh a pe kîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan, “Hei, ka ram hi a awm duai alâwm, i duh duhnaah awm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sari hnênah pawh chuan, “Ngai teh, i nuṭa chu tangka sâng ka pêk tâk hi, in zaa tâna zângna dawmna ni rawh se, i fihlîm ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abrahama chuan Pathian hnênah a ngensak a, Pathianin Abimeleka chu, a nupui te leh a chhiahhlawh te nên a tidam leh a, nau an nei thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abrahama nupui Sari vâng chuan Abimeleka te chhûngkua chu Pathianin a tiching a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Sari chu a zu kan a. Lalpa chuan a tiam tawh ang khân Sari chu a tihsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sari chuan nau a pai ta a, Pathianin a sawi hun takah khân Abrahama chu, pa upa tak a nih hnuin, fapa a hrinsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abrahaman Sarin fapa a hrinsak hmingah chuan Isaka a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin thu a pêk angin a ni riat ni chuan Abrahama chuan a fapa Isaka serh chu a tansak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A fapa Isaka a pian chuan Abrahama chu kum zaa upa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sari chuan: “Pathianin min nuihtîr tâk hi, A hria apiangin min nuihpui ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Abrahama hnênah, ‘Sarin nau hnute a pe ang,’ tu nge tih nachâng hria ang? Mahse, a tar hnuin fapa ka hrinsak hi,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nau chu a ṭhang lian a, hnute hnêk bântîr a lo hun ta a. Chumi ni chuan Abrahaman ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta mi Hagarin Abrahama fapa a hrinsak khân a fapa Isaka chu a chhaih lai Sari chuan a hmuhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abrahama hnênah, “He bawihnu hi, a fapa nên hnawt chhuak rawh. He bawih fa hian ka fapa Isaka hi ro a luahpui tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chuan Abrahama rilru a tihrehawm hle a, a fapa a ni ve bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, Pathian chuan Abrahama hnênah, “Naupang chungchâng leh i bawihnu chungchâng hi lunglovah la suh. Sari sawi ang chu zâwm rawh, Isaka-ah hian a ni i thlahte chhui a nih dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawihnu fapa pawh nangma thlah ngei a nih avângin hnam ropui takah ka din tho dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tûk zîngah Abrahama chuan Hagari pêk tûr chhang leh savun tuithâwl tuia khat a la a, a phurhtîr a, a fapa nên chuan a tîr bo ta a, Beer-seba thlalêrah chuan kalna chin tûr hre lovin a vâk a vâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Savun tuithâwla tui chu an in zawh chuan naupang chu hnimbuk hnuaiah a dah a, hla fe, thal kah phâk tâwkah a kal a, a ṭhu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Naupang thi lai ka hmu ngam lo,” a ti a ni. Hla takah chuan a ṭhu a, a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naupang au râwl chu Pathianin a lo hria a, Pathian Vântirhkoh chuan vân aṭangin Hagari chu a au va, ‘Hagar, eng i ti nge ni? Thlaphâng suh, a awmna hmuna naupang râwl chu Pathianin a hria asin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ti rawh, naupang chu kaitho la, thlêm rawh, hnam ropui takah ka din dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian chuan a mit a tihvârsak a, tuichhunchhuah a hmu ta a. A va pan a, tuithâwl chu a thâl khat a, naupang chu a intîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naupang chu a lo ṭhang lian a, Pathianin a awmpui zêl a, thal kah a thiam êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Paran thlalêrah awmhmun a khuar a, Aigupta ram aṭangin a nu chuan nupui a neihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutih hun vêl chuan Abimeleka chu a sipai hotu Fikola nên Abrahama hnênah an lo kal a, “I thiltih apiangah Pathianin a awmpui che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka tu leh fate chungah emaw, ka chungah emaw thil ṭha lo ti lo tûrin Pathian hming chhâlin chhia chham rawh. I chunga ka ṭhat ang bawkin ka chungah leh i chênna ram chungah hian ṭhat chhuah tiam rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, “Tiam e a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimeleka chhiahhlawhte chuan Abrahama tuichhunchhuah an chhuhsak a; chumi chungchângah chuan Abimeleka chu a khak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan, “Chu, tu tih nge ka hre ve hlei nêm; min va hrilh lo ve, tûnah chauh a ni ka hriat,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abrahama chuan berâm leh bâwngpa a la a, Abimeleka chu a pe a, an pahnih chuan thu an thlung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, berâm rual zînga mi berâmla pasarih pawh a dah hrang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan, “Engtizia nge berâmla pasarih hi i dah hran le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“He tuichhunchhuah hi ka laih ngei a ni tih hriat nân hêng berâmla pasarih hi nei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, chu hmun chuan Beer-seba hming a pu ta a ni, an pahnihin thu an intiam tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thu an thlun zawh chuan Abimeleka chu a sipai hotu Fikola nên, an chhuak a, Filistia ramah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abrahama chuan Beer-seba-ah chuan Esel thing a phun a, Lalpa chatuan Pathian hming chu a lam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abrahama chu Filistia ramah kum tam fe a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Pathianin Abrahama chu a fiah a, “Abraham,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I fapa mal, i duh êm êm Isaka hi hruai la, Moria ramah kalpui teh; ka hrilh tûr che tlângah hâlral thilhlan atân hlân rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Abrahama chu zîng takah a tho va; sabengtung a siam a, a naute zînga tlangvâl pahnih leh a fapa Isaka chu a ko va; hâlral thilhlana hman tûr thing a ek a; a tho va, Pathian hrilh hmun lam pan chuan an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni thum ni chuan Abrahama chuan a han thlîr a, hla fe aṭang chuan chu hmun chu a hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a naute hnênah, “Hetah hian sabengtung hi lo awmpui ula, sawtah sâwn naupang nên hian kan kal ang a, Pathian chibai kan va bûk ang a, kan lo kîr leh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abrahama chuan hâlral thilhlan thing chu a la a, a fapa Isaka chu a puttîr a, ani chuan mei leh chem chu a keng a, an kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaka chuan a pa Abrahama chu a bia a, “Ka pa,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni, ka fapa?” a ti a. “En teh, mei leh thing chu kan keng a, hâl ral tûr berâmno chu khaw nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a chhâng a, “Ka fapa, Pathianin hâl ral tûr berâmno chu a hmu mai dâwn alâwm,” a ti a. Tichuan, an kal dûn ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin hmun a hrilh chu an thleng a; chutah chuan Abrahaman maichâm a siam a, thing chu a chhep a, a fapa Isaka chu a phuar a, maichâm thing chungah chuan a mut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a ban a, chem chu a la a, a fa chu tihhlum a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân aṭangin Lalpa tirhkohvin a rawn au va, “Abraham, Abraham,” a rawn ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Naupang chungah i kut thlâk suh, eng mah tih hek suh. Pathian i ṭihzia ka hre ta, i fapa neih chhun meuh pawh ka tân i ui loh hi,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abrahama chu a han hawi vêl a, a hnung lamah chuan berâmpa a hmu a, thingbukah a ki a lo tâng a. Abrahama chuan berâm chu a man a, a fapa aiah hâlral thilhlan atân a hlân ta hlauh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abrahama chuan chu hmun hmingah chuan, “ Lalpa Jireh” a sa a, tûn thlengin “ Lalpa tlângah chuan hmuh a ni,” tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh chuan Abrahama chu vân aṭangin a rawn be nawn leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“I fapa neih chhun chu ka tân ui lovin he thil hi i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mal ka sâwm ang che a, i thlahte chu chunga arsi zât leh hnuaia ṭiauvaivut zâtin ka tipung ang tih mahni inchhâlin thu ka tiam e. I thlahte chuan an hmêlmate kulh kawngkaah thu an nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawvêla hnam tinrêngin i thlahte chhâlin mal an insâwmsak ang, ka thu i awih avângin chûng chu tihsak che ka tiam a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abrahama chu a naute hnênah chuan a kîr a, Beer-seba-ah an haw ta a. Abrahama chu Beer-seba-ah chuan a awm ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan, “Milkaii chuan i nau Nahora chu fate a hrinsak ṭeuh asin,” tiin Abrahama chu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fa tîr chu Uza a ni a, a naute chu Buza leh Kemuela, Arama pa chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kheseda te, Hazoa te, Pildasa te, Jidlafa te, Bethuela te a hring bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bethuela chu Rebeki pa a ni. Hêng mi pasarihte hi Milkaii chuan Abrahama nau Nahora chu a hrinsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a hmei Reumi pawhin Teba te, Gahama te, Tahasa te, Maaka te a hrinsak bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sari chu kum za leh sawmhnih leh pasariha upa a ni. Sari dam chhûng kum zât chu chuti chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiriat-Arba khuaah, tûna Hebron khua an tih tâk, Kanan ramah chuan a thi a. Abrahama chu a sûn tûr leh ṭah tûrin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nupui ruang bul aṭang chuan a tho va, Hit mite chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“In zînga lo pêm mikhual mai ka la ni a, in ramah inphûmna tûr hmun min pe ve rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit mite chuan Abrahama chu an chhâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka pu, kan thu hi ngaithla teh, kan zîngah Pathian mi thlan i ni a, i duhna lai ber, kan thlân hmunah hian inphûm mai rawh u, tu man in inphûmna thlân hmun atân ram kan ui lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrahama chu a tho va, chu ram hotute leh Hit mite hmaah chuan a kûn a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kan inphûmna tûr hmun min duhsak takzet a nih chuan Zohara fapa, Efrona ram, Makpela biala pûk awmna, a ram kila ram awm hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a man tâwk a chhiar zâtin thlân hmuna ka neih atân min leitîr teh se, khawngaih takin min sawipui rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Efrona chu Hit mite zîngah chuan a ṭhu ve reng a. Hit mite hriatah, Hit mi Efrona chuan, khaw kulh kawngkaa hotu ṭhute hmaah ngei chuan Abrahama hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hralh lo ve, ka pu, ka thu hi ngaithla teh, pûk leh a awmna ram chu ka pe a che, ka laichînte hriat ngeiah ka pêk che hi, inphûm nân hmang mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng mite hmaah chuan Abrahama chu a kûn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an hriatah chuan Efrona hnênah, “Ngai teh, rem i tih chuan ram man chu ka pe zâwk ang che. La hrâm la; tichuan, inphûm nân ka nei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Efrona chuan Abrahama chu a chhâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka pu, ka thu hi ngaithla hrâm teh. He ram hi tangka sekel zali bûk man lek a ni a, chu chu nang leh kei, kan inkârah sawi tham a ni hlei nêm, inphûmna thlân atân chuan nei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahama chuan Hit mite hriata Efrona sawi zât tangkarua chu a bûk chhuahsak ta a; an tangka hman lai, sekel bûk zali chu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Makpela-a Efrona ram, Mamre dep pûk awmna chu, a ri chhûnga thing awm zawng zawng nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a nei ta a; Hit mite leh khaw kulh kawngkaa ṭhute hmaah chuan tihngheh a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Makpela rama pûkah chuan Abrahama chuan a nupui Sari chu a phûm ta a. Chu hmun chu Hebron an tih tâk Mamre dep, Kanan rama awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu ram chu Hit mite kut aṭangin thlân hmun atân Abrahama chuan a nei hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrahama chu a kum a lo tam a, a upa ta hle a, Lalpa chuan kawng tinrêngah Abrahama chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a chhiahhlawh min ber, an chhûngkaw enkawltu hnênah, “Ka malpui kârah i kut dah la, Lalpa , vân Pathian leh lei Pathian chhâlin chhia ka chhamtîr dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka chênna ram, Kanan nula zînga mi, ka fapa Isaka tân nupui i neihsak tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pianna ramah i kal ang a, ka laichînte zîngah, ka fapa Isaka nupui i va zawng zâwk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh chuan, “Hmeichhia chuan he ramah hian min rawn zui duh lo sela, i fapa hi i lo kalna ramah chuan ka hruai kîr leh tûr em ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, “Chu ramah chuan ka fapa hi i hruai kîr hauh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa vân Pathian chuan ka pa in leh lo, ka pianna ram aṭangin min hruai chhuak a, ‘He ram hi i thlahte hnênah ka pe ang,’ tiin a tiam tlat a ni. Ani chuan i hmaah Vântirhkoh a tîr ang a, ka fapa nupui tûr i rawn hâwn thei mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan a zui duh tlat loh che erawh chuan ka hnêna i chhechham lakah i fihlîm ang; eng pawh ni se, ka fapa hi chutah chuan i hruai kîr tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, chhiahhlawh chuan a pu Abrahama malpui inkârah chuan a kut a dah a, chu thil thu-ah chuan a hmaah chhia a chham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh chuan a pu sanghâwngsei sâwm a hruai a, thilpêk tûr chi tinrêng a keng a, Nahora awmna khua Aram-Naharaim lam chu a pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhe tuichawi hun, tlai ni nêmah, chu khaw dai kianga tuichhunchhuah bulah chuan a sanghâwngsei chu a bawhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Heti hian a ti a: “Aw Lalpa , ka pu Abrahama Pathian, ka pu Abrahama chungah ngilneih chhuah la, ka kawng hi tihmuingîl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei tuikhur bulah hian ka lo ding ang a, khuaa nulate chuan tui an rawn chawi ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Khawngaih takin i tuibêl chu han la thla la, ka lo in teh ang,’ ka ti dâwn a ni. ‘In rawh, i sanghâwngseite pawh tui ka han chawisak ang e,’ tia mi chhângtu chu i chhiahhlawh Isaka nupui tûra i nula ruat chu ni rawh se, chu chu ka pu chungah i ngilneihna i lantîr a ni tih chhinchhiahnaah ka ngai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sawi zawh hma chuan Abrahama nau Nahora fapa Bethuela fanu, Rebeki chu tuibêl kengin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu nula chu Milkaii fanu a ni a, nula hmêlṭha tak, nula thianghlim, mipa la khawih loh a ni. Tuikhurah chuan a chhuk a, a bêl chu a thâl khat a, a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh chu a lam pan chuan a va tlân a, “I bela tui kha mi lo intîr teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka pu, in rawh,” a ti a, a tuibêl put chu a la thla a, a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Duh tâwka a intîr hnu chuan, “I sanghâwngseite pawh an duh tâwka an in tûr tui ka han chawisak ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tuibêl chu ran tuikuangah chuan a chhûng thuai a, tuichhunchhuahah chuan a chhuk a, sanghâwngsei zawng zawng duh tâwka in tur a chawisak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutih chhûng chuan a kal chhan Lalpa chuan a tihlawhtling a ni nge ni lo ngaihtuah chungin a ding a, a en ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sanghâwngseite chuan duh tâwk tui an in hnu chuan, sekel chanvea rit rangkachak hnâr vuah a la chhuak a, a hnârah a vuahsak a; rangkachak ngûn pahnih, sekel sâwma rit a buntîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tu fanu nge i nih, min hrilh teh, zân kan riahna tûr i pa inah a awm thei ang em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Bethuela fanu ka nih hi, ani chu Milkaiin Nahora a hrinsak kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Buhpâwl leh ran chaw pawh kan ngah asin, riahna tûr pawh kan nei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu mi chu a kûn a, Lalpa hmaah a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka pu chunga a ngilneihna danglam ngai lo Abrahama Pathian Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, ka pu chhûngte inah, kei pawh min hruai lût ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thil chu a nute hrilh tûrin nula chu a tlân a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rebeki chuan nuṭa Labana a nei a; ani chu tuichhunchhuah rawn pan tûr chuan a tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A farnu hnâr vuah leh ngûn a hmuha, ‘chutiang khatiang chuan min bia,’ tih a sawi a hriat khân chu mi lam pan chuan a tlân a ni. A va thlen chuan tuikhura sanghâwngsei bulah a lo la ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Labana chuan, “Nang, Lalpa duhsak, lo kal teh, thlenna tûr leh sanghâwngsei awmna tûr ka buatsaih vek tawh asin, pâwnah engati nge i la din reng le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu Labana chuan inah a zui lût a, sanghâwngsei phurte chu Labana chuan a hlân thlâksak a, buhpâwl leh ran chaw te chu sanghâwngseite pawh a pe a. A kalpuite nêna an ke silna tûr tui a rawn la bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hmaa chaw an han hlui dâwn lai chuan Abrahama chhiahhlawh chuan, “Ka sawi tûr ka sawi zawh hma chu eng mah ka ei lo vang,” a ti a. “Sawi ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Abrahama chhiahhlawh ka ni a, ka pu chu nasa takin Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A neinung ta hle a ni. Berâm te, ran te, bawihpa te, bawihnu te, sanghâwngsei leh sabengtung te a pe ṭeuh va, tangkarua leh rangkachak nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka pu nupui Sari chuan upa tak a nih hnuin fapa a hrinsak a, ani chu a neih zawng zawng a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka pu chuan chhia min chhamtîr a; ‘Ka awmna ram Kanan mite nula zînga mi hi ka fapa tân nupui neihsak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka laichîn te, ka chhûngte hnênah i kal zâwk ang a, ka fapa tân nupui i zawng tûr a ni,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka pu hnênah chuan, ‘Hmeichhiain min zui duh lo ta sela engtin nge ni ang?’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘ Lalpa duhzâwngin ka awm ṭhîn a, ani ngei chuan a tirhkoh i rualin a kaltîr ang a; i tih tûr chu a tihhlawhtlinsak ang che. Ka chhûngte, ka laichînte zînga mi ngei ka fapa tân nupui i zawng tûr a ni. Ka laichînte hnên i thlen hunah chauh i chhechham aṭangin i thiang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka laichînte hnêna i kala, nupui tûr an lo pêk duh loh che chuan i fihlîm ang,’ tiin min ti a, chhia ka chham ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Vawiina tuikhur ka lo thlen khân heti hian ka ti a, ‘Aw Lalpa , ka pu Abrahama Pathian, ka thiltih tûrah min tihhlawhtlin takzet dâwn chuan heti hi ni teh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tuikhur bula ka awm lai hian khuaa nula, tuichawi tûrin an lo kal ang a; ‘I bêla tui kha ka lo in teh ang,’ ka ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘In rawh, i sanghâwngsei in tûr pawh ka han chawisak ang e,’ titu chu ka pu fapa nupui atân Lalpa mi ruat chu ni rawh se,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Rilrua ka sawi zawh hma chuan Rebeki a lo kal a, tuibêl a rawn pu a. Tuikhura tui chu a thâl zawh chuan, ‘Khawngaih takin i tui chu mi intîr teh,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A tuibêl chu a chawi thla a, ‘In rawh, i sanghâwngseite in tûr pawh ka han chawi ang e,’ a ti a. Ka in a, ka sanghâwngseite pawh chuan duh tâwk an in ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A hnênah chuan, ‘Tu fanu nge i nih?’ ka ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Bethuela fanu ka ni, ani chu Nahora fapa a ni, a nu chu Milkaii a ni,’ a ti a. Hnâr vuah ka vuahsak a, ngûn ka buntîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan ka kûn a, ka pu Abrahama Pathian Lalpa chu ka fak a; ka pu fapa nupui atân a laichîn fanu hnêna min hruai vang vang hi ka fak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ka pu chu in khawngaih dâwn chuan min hrilh ula, in khawngaih thei lo a nih pawhin min hrilh bawk ula, ka hawi lam lam ka hawi dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Labana leh Bethuela chuan an chhâng a, “He thil hi Lalpa tih a nih hi; keini remtih leh tih loh tûr pawh zu ni lo va!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Rebeki chu i kuta awm a ni a, hruai la, Lalpa thu angin i pu fapa nupuiah nei ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Abrahama chhiahhlawh chuan an thutlûkna a hriat chuan lei siin Lalpa hmaah a kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tangkarua leh rangkachaka siam thil, thawmhnaw te a rawn phawrh chhuak a, Rebeki chu a pe a, a nuṭa leh a nu chu thil hlu tak tak a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A kalpuite nên chuan an eiin an in ta a. Zânah chuan an mu a, a tûk zînga an thawh veleh, “Ka pu hnênah min kîrtîr rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Rebeki nuṭa leh a nu chuan, “Kan nau hi ni sâwm emaw tal la awm rih sela, chutah in kal dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Min chelh khawtlai suh u, Lalpa chuan ka kawng min tihtluansak ta si a, ka pu hnêna kîr min phal teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Nula chu ko ila, a ngaih dân amah ngei pawh zâwt ila,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Rebeki chu an ko va, “He mi hi i zui duh mai em?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Duh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tichuan, an farnu Rebeki chu a awmtu nên Abrahama chhiahhlawh leh a kalpuite nên chuan an kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Rebeki chu mal an sâwmsak a: “Kan farnu, a sînga sîng têl nu ni la, I thlahte chuan an hmêlmate kulh kawngkhârah Thu nei rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tichuan, Rebeki leh a chhiahhlawh nulate chu sanghâwngseiah chuan an chuang a, mi chu an zui ta a. Abrahama chhiahhlawh chuan Rebeki chu a hruai a, an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />An thang hlân chuan Isaka chu Beer-lahai-roi aṭangin a lo kîr a, Negeb lamah awmhmun a khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Isaka chu tlaiah daiah a lêng chhuak a, sanghâwngsei lo kalte chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Rebekin Isaka a han hmuh chuan sanghâwngsei aṭangin a chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Abrahama chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Saw, phûla min hmuak tûr lo kal saw tu nge ni?” a ti a. Chhiahhlawh chuan, “Saw saw ka pu chu alâwm,” a ti a. Tichuan, a hmai khuhna chu a phawrh a, a inkhuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh chuan a thil tawh zawng zawng chu Isaka a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Isaka chuan Rebeki chu a nu Sari puan inah a hruai lût a, an innei a, a nupui a ni ta a. Isaka chuan a duh êm êm a, a nu thi a ngaih pawh chu a nêp thei ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrahama chuan nupui a nei leh a, a hming chu Keturi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fapa Zimrana te, Joksana te, Medana te, Midiana te, Isbaka te, Suaha te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joksana chuan fapa - Seba te, Dedana te a nei a. Dedana thlahte chu Asur-ho te, Letus-ho te, Leum-ho te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midiana fate chu Efa te, Efera te, Hanoka te, Abida te, Elda te an ni; hêngho hi Keturi thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abrahama chuan Isaka chu a neih zawng zawng a rochuntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hmei fate erawh chu a dam lai ngeiin thilpêk a pe ṭeuh va, Isaka chîm buai lo tûrin khawchhak ram lamah a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrahama dam chhûng chu kum za leh sawmsarih leh panga a ni. Tarkûn khûp bihin a dam a, a hnuk a chat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a thi ta a ni; a laichînte hnênah hruai a ni ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fapa Isaka leh Ismaela chuan Makpela pûk, Hit mi Zohara fapa Efrona ram, Mamre depah chuan an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu ram chu Hit mite hnên aṭanga Abrahama ram lei kha a ni. Chutah chuan Abrahama leh a nupui Sari chu an phûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abrahama thih hnu chuan Pathianin a fapa Isaka chu mal a sâwm a, Beer-lahai-roi bulah Isaka chuan awmhmun a khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng hi Abrahama fapa, Ismaela, Sari bawihnu, Aigupta mi Hagarin Abrahama a hrinsak thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ismaela fate chu an indawt dân ang zêlin hêngte hi an ni: A fa tîr chu Nebaiota a ni a; Kedara te, Adbeela te, Mibsama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Misma te, Duma te, Masa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hadada te, Tema te, Jetura te, Nafisa te, Kedema te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khîng khi Ismaela fate hming leh an chênna ram leh awmna bîk hming an put tâk chu a ni. Khîng hnam sâwm leh pahnih thlahtute khi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ismaela chu kum za leh sawmthum leh pasarih a dam a; a hnuk a chat a, a thi ta a; a chipuite hnêna hruai a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Havila aṭangin Asur pan zâwngin Aigupta thlen hma lawk, Sur thlengin a fate chu an inzâr a, an unau dangte tu mah an ngeih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hei hi Abrahama fapa Isaka chanchin chu a ni: Abrahaman fapa Isaka a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum sawmli-a upa a nihin Isaka chuan Padanaram-a awm, Suria mi, Bethuela fanu Rebeki, Suria mi Labana farnu chu nupuiah a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chin avângin Isaka chuan a nupui tân Lalpa a dîlsak a. Lalpa chuan a aw chu a lo ngaithla a, Rebeki chuan nau a pai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pum chhûngah chuan nautête chu an insual nasa hle a, “Hetiang hi a nih chuan ka dam zo dâwn em ni?” a ti a. Lalpa râwn tûrin a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, “I chhûlah hnam hnih an awm a, I kawchhûngah chi hnih inngeih lo an awm; Pakhat chuan pakhat chu a khûm ang a, A u zâwk chuan a nau rawng a bâwl ang,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hrin a lo hun chuan phîr a pai a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lo piang hmasa zâwk chu sahmul puan anga hmul sen thur a lo ni a, a hmingah ‘Esauva’ an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pakhat chu a lo chhuak ve a, Esauva keartui chu a vuan chial a, a hmingah ‘Jakoba’ an sa a. An lo pian chuan Isaka chu kum sawmruk mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naupangte chu an lo ṭhang lian a, Esauva chu sa kâp thei, ramvachal tak a ni a; Jakoba erawh chu pa ti chet chawt, in lam ngaihsak mi tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isaka chuan Esauva chu sa a kah theih êm avângin a duh hle a, Rebeki erawh chuan Jakoba chu a ngaina zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vawi khat chu Jakoba chuan englo a chhûm a, ram aṭangin Esauva chu chau zetin a lo haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakoba hnênah chuan, “I thil sen chhum kha khawngaih takin mi lo eitîr teh, ka ṭâmchhâwl a ni e,” a ti a. Hemi avâng hian a hmingah Edoma an vuah bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakoba chuan, “Fa tîr nihnain lei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “Rilṭâmin ka thi mai dâwn alâwm, fa tîr nihna chu eng nge ka sâwtpui ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakoba chuan, “Chhia chham rawh,” a ti a, chhia a chham ta a, a fa tîr nihna chu Jakoba hnênah chuan a hralh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jakoba chuan chhang leh a dailuah chhum chu a pe a, a ei a, a in a, a tho va, a kal ta a. Chutiangin, Esauva chuan a fa tîr nihna chu a ngainêp a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrahama dam laia ṭâm tla ni lo, chu ramah chuan ṭâm a lo tla leh a. Gerar khuaah, Filistia lal Abimeleka hnênah Isaka chu a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu a hnênah a rawn inlâr a, “Aigupta ramah chuan chhuk suh, ka kawhhmuh tûr che ramah awm la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu ramah chuan châm reng ang che. Ka awmpui ang che a, mal ka sâwm ang che. Hêng ram zawng zawng hi nang leh i thlahte ka pe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thlahte chu vâna arsi zât khian ka tipung ang a, hêng ram zawng zawng hi i thlahte chu ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abrahaman ka aw a ngaih pawimawha, ka thu a zâwma, ka thupêkte, ka dânte leh ka zirtîrnate a pawm avâng khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gerar khuaah chuan Isaka chu a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuta mite chuan Rebeki chu a nupui a nih leh nih loh an hre duh a. “Ka farnu a nih hi,” a ti a. “Ka nupui ka tih chuan Rebeki vâng hian min that mai ang, a hmêl a ṭha hle si a,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi khuaa rei tak a awm hnu chuan Filistia lal Abimeleka chu tukverhah a han dâk a, Isakan a nupui Rebeki a chhaih lai chu a phâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan Isaka chu a ko va, a hnênah, “I nupui a lo ni reng a ni maw? Engtiziaa ‘ka farnu a ni,’ ti nge i nih le?” a ti a. Isaka chuan, “Amah avângin min thah mai ka hlau atin a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan, “I nupui ni si mutpui tumte kan lo awm mai thei asin; tlêmah tlêmah thil sual min tihtîr ṭhelh alâwm le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng hnênah Abimeleka chuan, “Tu pawh, he mi hi emaw, a nupui hi emaw khawih tawh phawt chu tihhlum an ni ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan Isaka chuan thlai a chîng a. Chumi kum chuan a lêt za a thar a, Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A neinung tial tial a, mi hausa tak a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Berâm rual te, bâwng rual te, ṭhuihruai te a ngah ta êm êm a. Filistia-ho chuan an îtsîk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, a pa Abrahama dam laia, a pa chhiahhlawhte tuichhunchhuah laih zawng zawng chu Filistia-ho chuan an hnawhsak a, lei an chhûng khat ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan Isaka hnênah, “Kan aiin i chak ta hle si a, heta ta hi insawn rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isaka chu chuta ṭang chuan a insawn a, Gerar ruamah awmhmun a khuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa Abrahama dam laia an tuichhunchhuah laih, Abrahama thih hnua Filistia-hovin an hnawhte chu a lai leh a, a pain hming a vuah te kha hmingah a puttîr leh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isaka chhiahhlawhten an awmna ruama tuichhunchhuah an laihah chuan tui a lo awm ṭha hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gerar berâm vêngtute chuan Isaka berâm vêngtute hnênah, “He tui hi kan ta a ni,” tiin an rawn chuh a. Tichuan, chu tuichhunchhuah hmingah chuan ‘Esek’ a vuah a, an rawn chuh buai avânga vuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuichhunchhuah dang an lai leh a, an rawn chuh leh a, a hmingah Sitna a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a insawn a, tuichhunchhuah dang a lai leh a, chu zawng an rawn chuh ta lo va, a hmingah Rehobot a vuah a, “Tûnah zawng Lalpa chuan kan inzârzauna tûr hmun min pe ta,” a tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Beer-seba-ah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan a hnênah Lalpa a rawn inlâr a: “Kei hi i pa Abrahama Pathian ka ni, Thlaphâng suh, ka awmpui che alâwm. Mal ka sâwm ang che a, Ka chhiahhlawh Abrahama avângin i thlahte ka tipung ang,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutah chuan maichâm a siam a, Lalpa hming a lam a. Tah chuan bûk a khuar a, Isaka chhiahhlawhte chuan tuichhunchhuah an lai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Gerar aṭangin Abimeleka chu a ṭhian Ahuzatha leh a sipai hotu Fikola nên an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isaka chuan, “Min ngaithei lo va, in zîng ata min hnawt chhuak a, eng nge in duha in lo kal tâk le?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan a awmpui che tih kan hre ta a, sa-ui tan ho ila kan ti a ni, kan inkârah inremna thu i thlung teh ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />kan tibuai ngai lo che a, kan khawngaih hle ṭhîn che a, i insawn dâwn pawh khân ṭha takin kan kaltîr che a, nang pawhin kan pawi khawih bîk suh ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ruai a ṭhehsak a, an ei a, an in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan chhia an chham dûn ta a. Isaka chuan a thlah a, ṭha takin an inṭhen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Isaka chhiahhlawhte chu an lo kal a, an tuichhunchhuah laihah tui ‘kan hmu ta e,’ an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hmingah Seba a vuah a, tûn thlengin chu khua chu Beer-seba an la ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hit mi, Beeria fanu Judithi leh Hit mi Elena fanu Basemathi chu kum sawmli-a upa a nihin Esauva chuan nupuiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chûng mite chu Isaka leh Rebeki thin tina rengtute an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isaka chu a upa ta hle a, a mit a thim a, khua a hmu thei ta lo hial a. A fapa upa zâwk Esauva chu a ko va, “Ka fapa,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka upa ta êm a, engtikah nge ka thih ang sawi theih a nih loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I thal leh thalngul, i hriamhrei chu la la, va ramkal la, sakhi min va kahsak teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka duhzâwng tak, hmui tui deuhvin siam la, mi han lâk ang che. Ka lo ei ang a, ka thih hma ngeiin ka malsâwmna i dawng dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isakan Esauva a bia chu Rebeki chuan a lo ngaithla reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ramvâka a pa tân sakhi kâp tûra Esauva a chhuah veleh Rebeki chuan a fapa Jakoba hnênah, “I pain i u Esauva hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Sa kâp la, hmui tui takin min han siam teh, ka lo ei ang e; ka thih hma ngeiin Lalpa remtih zâwng angin mal ka lo sâwmsak ang che,’ a tih ka hre ru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka hrilh ang che hian ti vat teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ran rual zîngah va kal la, kel no ṭha thlan chhuah pahnih han la ang che, i pa duhzâwng takin hmui tui deuhvin ka lo siam ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I pe ang a, a ei ang a, a thih hma ngeiin mal a sâwmsak dâwn che nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a nu Rebeki hnênah, “Ka u Esauva chu mi hmulphurh chhe tak a ni a, kei lah hmul nei lo, sa mâm tak ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pa chuan min han dap hlauh se amah ka tiduhdah emaw a ti ang a, mal sâwmsak ahnêkin ânchhia min lawh ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nu chuan, “Ka fapa, ânchhia i dawn leh ka chungah tla rawh se, ka sawi ang chuan ti phawt mai rawh. Kal la, va la thuai tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, a chhuak a, a va man a, a nu hnênah chuan a rawn la a, a nu chuan a pa duhzâwng takin a lo siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rebeki chuan ina a kawl, a fa u zâwk thawmhnaw ṭha chu, a la a, a fa naupang zâwk Jakoba chu a hâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A bân leh a nghâwng sam awm lo laite chu, berâmno vun chuan a tuamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sa leh a chhang siam chu Jakoba hnênah chuan a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa hnênah chuan a va kal a, “Ka pa,” a ti a. “Eng nge ni? Ka fapa tu zâwk nge i nih?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a pa chu a chhâng a, “Esauva, i fa tîr kha ka ni. Min tirh angin ka ti a, lo tho la, ṭhu kâng teh, ka sakhi sa hi ei rawh le; tichuan, i malsâwmsakna ka dawng dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaka chuan a fapa hnênah, “Ka fapa, engtizia nge i va hlawhtling hma teh thut ve?” a ti a. “ Lalpa i Pathian chuan min tihmuingîl a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaka chuan Jakoba hnênah, “Ka fapa Esauva i ni nameuh emaw; ka lo dap teh ang che, lo kal hnai teh,” a ti hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a va hnaih a, a lo dap vêl a. “A aw chu Jakoba aw a ni a, a kutte erawh chu Esauva kut zawng a nih si hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A bân chu a u Esauva bân angin a lo hmul si a, a hre hrang thei lo a ni. Mal a sâwmsak dâwn ṭêpah pawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka fapa Esauva i ni ngei maw?” a ti a. “Ni e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Han la teh, ka fapa sakhi kah sa chu ka lo ei teh ang; tichuan, mal ka sâwmsak dâwn che nia,” a ti a. A hmaah chuan a hlui a, a ei a, uain a rawn lâk chu a in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pa Isaka chuan, “Ka fapa, lo kal hnai la, mi han fâwp teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A va hnaih a, a fâwp a, a kawr rim chu a han hria a, mal a sâwmsak ta nge nge a: A! Ka fapa rim chu Lalpa malsâwm ram rim ang veng veng a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vân daifîm chu Pathianin pe che sela, Lei hausaknate chu pe che rawh se. Buh leh uain nei thûr thûr bawk ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan i rawng bâwl se, Hnam tinrêngten chibai bûk che rawh se. I unaute chungah lal la, I nu fate chu i hmaah kûn rawh se. Ânchhe lawhtu che chu ânchhia lawh a ni ang a, Mal sâwmsaktu che chu duhsak an ni ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isakan Jakoba mal a sâwmsak zo va, Jakoba chuan a pa a chhuahsan chiah tih chuan Esauva ramvâk chu a lo haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani pawh chuan hmui tui takin a siam a, a pa chu a rawn pe a, a pa hnênah chuan, “Ka pa chuan a fapa sakhi sa hi ei teh se; tichuan, mal a sâwmsak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pa Isaka chuan, “Tu nge i nih?” a ti a. “I fa tîr Esauva,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Isaka chu a khûr ta hlawk hlawk a, “Sa kâpa mi rawn petu kha tu nge ni ta ang le? I lo haw hma chiah khân ka lo ei zo hman a, mal ka sâwmsak tâk kha! Malsâwmna chu a chang hlen tho dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pa thu a han hriat chuan Esauva chu lungngai takin a ṭap ta zawih zawih a, “Ka pa, kei hi, mal min sâwmsak ve ta hrâm che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“I nau a lo kal a, min bum a ni, i dawn tûr malsâwmna chu a kalpui ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“A hming Jakoba a ni rêng a, vawi hnih tlawng min bum tâk hi. Ka fa tîr nihna min neihsak a, malsâwmna ka dawn tûr pawh min dawn khalh ta a nih hi. Malsâwmna tlêm tal i la nei lâwm ni?” tiin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isaka chuan Esauva chu a chhâng a, “I chunga lal tûrin ka lo ti diam tawh, a laichîn zawng zawngte a bawih atân ka pe a, buh leh uain nei ṭeuh tûrin ka lo ti tawh bawk a. Chuvângin, ka fapa, eng nge maw tihsak tûr che ka la neih ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “Malsâwmna pakhat mai em ni i neih? Ka pa, kei hi, mal min sâwmsak ve hrâm teh,” a ti a. Esauva chu a ṭap chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isaka chuan a hnênah heti hian a ti leh a: I chênna chu ram ṭha aṭanga hla tak a ni ang a, Vân daifîmte chu i dawng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I khandaih hmangin i nung ang a. I nau rawng i bâwl ang. Tharum i thawh hunah chuan A nghâwngkawl i bah chu i thing thla ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A pain mal a sâwmsak tâk avângin Jakoba chungah Esauva chu a lungnilo hle a. Esauva chuan, “Ka pa kan sûn ni chuan ka nau Jakoba chu ka that ve ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a fapa upa zâwk Esauva chu a ṭawng tih Rebeki an hrilh a, a fa naupang zâwk Jakoba chu a ko va, “Ngai teh, i u Esauva hian thah che tumin a inhnêm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thu hi ngaithla teh. Haran khuaah ka nuṭa Labana hnênah tlânchhe daih la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />a hnênah chuan eng chen emaw va awm ang che. I u thinrim a daiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />i thiltih avânga i chunga a thin na chu a dam hma chu va awm ang che, chutih hunah chuan mi ka rawn tîr ang a, a rawn hruai kîr dâwn che nia. Tichuan, in pahnihin ni khatah ka sûn dâwn lo che u nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Rebeki chuan Isaka hnênah, “Hêng Hit hmeichheho vâng hian dam pawh manhla ka ti ta lo; Jakoba hian hêng lai mi, Hit nula a neih ve lek phei chuan ka tân nun thlâkhlelh tlâk em ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Jakoba chu Isakan a ko va, chibai a lo bûk a, hetiang hian a hrilh a: ‘Kanan nula nupuiah i nei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tho la, Padan-aram-ah, i nu pa Bethuela inah kal la, i nu nuṭa Labana fanute zînga mi nupui va nei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />El-Sadaia chuan malsâwm che sela, i chi tiṭhain tipung che sela, tihtham tak hnam thlahtu ni ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abrahama ang khân nang leh i thlahte chu malsâwm sela, Pathianin Abrahama a pêk, i mikhualna ram hi nei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaka chuan Jakoba chu a kaltîr a, Padan-aram-a Suria mi Bethuela fapa, Jakoba leh Esauva nu nuṭa, Labana hnênah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakoba chu Padan-aram lama nupui zawng tûra Isakan a tirh khân mal a sâwmsak a, mal a sâwmsak pah khân, “Kanan nula nupuiah i nei tûr a ni lo,” tiin a hrilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a nu leh pa thu awihin Jakoba chu Padan-aram lamah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Kanan hmeichhiate chu Isaka chuan a ning hle ṭhîn a lo ni tih Esauva chuan a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Esauva chu Abrahama fapa Ismaela hnênah a kal a, a nupui neih sa bâkah Abrahama fapa Ismaela fanu Mahalathi, Nabaiotha farnu chu nupuiah a neih belh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakoba chu Beer-seba ata chu Haran khuaa kal tûrin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni a tlâk chuan hmun pakhat chu a va thleng a, riah zai a rêl ta a. Lung pakhat hi a la a, a lukham a, a mu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mumang a nei a, lei aṭanga vân thleng kailâwn lo awm zur chu a hmu a. Pathian Vântirhkoh rual an lo chhovin an lo chhuk zut zut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a lo dinchilh reng a, “Kei Lalpa hi, i pa Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian ka ni. I mutna lei hi nang leh i thlahte ka pe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I thlahte chu leia vaivut zât an ni ang a, chhak leh thlang, chhim leh hmârah an inzâr darh ang, leia hnam tinrêngin nang leh i thlahte chu induhsakna ṭawngkam takah an hmang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai rawh, ka awmpui a che, i kalna apiangah ka vêng ang che a, he ramah hian ka hruai kîr leh ang che, ka thutiam ka tihhlawhtlin hma chu ka thlahthlam lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoba chu a lo ṭhangharh a, “Hetah hian Lalpa a lo awm a nih hi, ka lo hre si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlauvin a khûr a, “He hmun hi hmun ṭihbaiawm tak a nih hi, Pathian in a lo ni reng mai, vân lama chhohna kawngka chu,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zîngah chuan Jakoba chuan lung a lukham chu a la a, a phun a, a chhîpah hriak a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu hmun hmingah chuan Bethel a vuah a, tûn hma chuan chu hmuna khaw awm hming chu Luz a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakoba chuan thu a tiam a, “Pathianin min awmpui a, ka khualzinna lama min vên zêla, ei tûr leh sin tûr min pêk zêla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka pa ina him taka ka lo kîr leh chuan Lalpa hi ka Pathian a ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />He ka lungphun pawh hi Pathian in a ni ang, i thil min pêk zawng zawng aṭangin sâwma pakhat ka pe ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chu a kal ta zêl a, khawchhak mite ram chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutah chuan tuichhunchhuah a va hmu a, a bulah chuan berâm rual pâwl thum an lo bawk chu a va hmu a. Chu tuichhunchhuah tui chu an intîr ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuichhunchhuah chhinna lung chu a lian hle a, berâm rual an rawn khalh thlen kim hunah chauh a chhîn chu an lum sawn thei a, tui an intîr ṭhîn a ni; an in zawhah an chhîn ṭha leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakoba chuan berâm vêngtute hnênah, “Ṭhiante u, khawii khua nge in nih?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Haran khua kan ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nahora fapa Labana kha in hria em?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Hria e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, “An dam lai em ni?” a ti a. “Dam e, a fanu Rakili pawh, saw, a berâm rual nên a lo kal saw,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ni a la sâng hle si a, engati nge berâmte chu tui in intîr loh, an la tla leh hman alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Berâm rual zawng zawng an lo thlen kim vek hunah tui kan intîr thei chauh ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An inbiak lai chuan Rakili pawh chu, a pa berâm rual nên a lo thleng a, berâm a vêng ve rêng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nu nuṭa Labana fanu Rakili chu, a nu nuṭa Labana berâmte nên a hmuh chuan tuichhunchhuah chu a hnaih a, a chhinna lung chu a lum sawn a, a nu nuṭa Labana berâm rual chu tui a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Rakili chu a fâwp a, aw chhuahin a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“I pa tupa, Rebeki fapa ka nih hi,” Rakili hnênah chuan Jakoba chuan a ti a. Ani chu a pa hrilh tûr chuan a tlân hâwng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Labanan a farnu fapa Jakoba chanchin a hriat chuan lâwm tûrin a tlân chhuak a, a pawm a, a fâwp a, a inah a hruai lût ta a. Chanchin engkim Labana chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Labana chuan a hnênah, “Ka thisen zawmpui ngei i ni alâwm,” a ti a. Jakoba chu Labana inah thla khat a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Labana chuan a hnênah, “Ka tupa i nih avângin a thlâwna ka chhawr reng thu che a awm lo, eng nge hlawh i duh, min hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Labana chuan fanu pahnih a nei a, a upa zâwk hming chu Leaii a ni a, a naupang zâwk hming chu Rakili a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leaii chu a meng mawi hle a; Rakili phei chu tituai ṭha deuh, hmêlṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Rakili chu a ngaizâwng a. “Kum sarih min chhawr la, i fanu naupang zâwk Rakili hi ka hlawh ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Labana chuan, “Mi dang daih neihtîr ai chuan nang neihtîr che chu a ṭha zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Rakili hlawh tûrin kum sarih a thawk a, a ngaihzâwn êm avângin ni rei lo tê lek niin a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Labana hnênah, “Ka hun ka tlâk ta bawk a, ka nupui tûr chu min neihtîr tawh rawh le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Labana chuan khuaa mite chu a sâwm a, ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zân thimah chuan a fanu Leaii chu a kai a, Jakoba hnênah chuan a hruai a, a lo mutpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Labana chuan a bawih nula Zilpaii chu Leaii a chhawmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zîng a lo nih chuan Leaii a lo ni reng mai si a. Jakoba chuan Labana hnênah, “Min tih dân hi engtizia nge? Rakili hlawhah min chhawr a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge min bum?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Fanu upa zâwk aiin a naupang zâwk kaltîr hmasak hi hêng lai ram dân a ni hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mo lawm hapta chhûng hmang tlingtla zet la, a nau zâwk pawh i nei mai dâwn nia; kum sarih dang ka chhawr leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a nupui hmasa zâwk lawmna hapta khat chu a tlingtla a, Labana chuan Rakili pawh chu nupuiah a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Labana chuan a chhiahhlawh nula Bilhaii chu a fanu Rakili a chhawmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a lo nei ta a, Leaii ai chuan a duh zâwk a. Labana chuan Jakoba chu kum sarih dang a chhawr zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Leaii chu a chuang hle tih a hriat chuan a chhûl a hawnsak a, Rakili erawh chuan nau a nei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leaii chuan nau a nei a, fapa a hring a, a hmingah Reubena a sa a. “Tûnah chuan ka manganna a hmu” tihna a ni. “Ka pasal pawhin min duh deuh tawh ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nau a nei leh a, fapa a hring a, “ Lalpa chuan hmangaih ka hlawh lo tih a hria a, hei pawh hi min pe a nih hi,” a ti a, a hmingah Simeona a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nau a pai leh a, fapa a hring a, “Tûnah zawng ka pasal fapa pathum ka hrinsak ta a, min lungrualpui tawh ang,” a ti a, a hmingah Levia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nau a pai leh a, fapa a hring leh a, “Tûn ṭum chu Lalpa ka chawimawi dâwn e,” a ti a, a hmingah Juda a sa ta a ni. Nau a pai nawn leh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rakilin Jakoba chu fa rêng a hrinsak loh avâng chuan a laizâwnnu Leaii chu a îtsîk hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakoba hnênah Rakili chuan, “Fa min pe ve rawh; chutilo chu, ka thi mai ang,” a ti a. Jakoba chu Rakili chungah chuan a thinur a, “Fa nei thei lova siamtu che Pathian em ka nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rakili chuan, “Hei, ka chhiahhlawhnu Bilhaii hi mutpui teh, mal chunga ka chawi ve tûr fa min hrinsak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmei atân a chhiahhlawh Bilhaii chu Jakoba a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bilhaii chuan nau a pai a, Jakoba chu fapa a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rakili chuan, “Pathianin ro min rêlsak a, ka dîl angin fapa min pêk tâk hi,” a ti a, a hmingah Dana a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rakili chhiahhlawh Bilhaii chuan nau a pai leh a, Jakoba chu fa a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rakili chuan, “Ka laizâwnnu nên namên lovin inchuh kan nei a, ka chan a ṭhat tâk hi,” a ti a, a hmingah Naftalia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leaii chuan nau a pai thei ta lo tih a inhriat chuan a chhiahhlawh Zilpaii chu hmeiah Jakoba chu a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leaii chhiahhlawh Zilpaii chuan Jakoba chu fapa a hrinsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leaii chuan, “A va nihlawhthlâk êm!” a ti a, a hmingah Gada a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leaii chhiahhlawh Zilpaii chuan Jakoba chu fa dang a hrinsak leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leaii chuan “Nihlawh min va ti dâwn e,” a ti a, a hmingah Asera a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ni khat chu huit seng laiin Reubena chu lovah a kal a, zâwlaidi a hmu a, a nu Leaii a hawnsak a. Rakili chuan Leaii hnênah, “I fapa zâwlaidi chu a ṭhen min pe ve hrâm teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leaii chuan, “Ka pasal min chhuh mah tihin ka fapa zâwlaidi leh zêl pawh min lâksak i tum em ni?” a ti a. Rakili chuan, “I fapa zâwlaidi min pe la, zâninah i bulah a mu dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, tlaia Jakoba feh haw chu Leaii chuan a lo hmuak a, “Zânin chuan ka hnênah i awm tûr a ni, ka fapa zâwlaidiin ka thleng tawh che a ni,” a ti a. Chumi zân chuan a bulah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian chuan Leaii dilna chu a ngaithla a, nau a pai a, Jakoba chu a pangana tûr fapa a hrinsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leaii chuan, “Pathianin ka pasal hmeia ka chhiahhlawh ka neihtîr man min pe ta a nih hi,” a ti a, a hmingah Isakara a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leaii chuan nau a pai leh a, Jakoba chu a parukna atân fapa a hrinsak leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pathianin thil hlu tak min pe a nih hi. Tûn ṭum hi chuan ka pasal fapa paruk ka hrinsak tâk avângin thilpêk hlu tak min pe ngei ang,” a ti a, a hmingah Zebuluna a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan fanu a hring a, a hmingah Dinaii a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathianin Rakili chu a hre reng a, Pathianin a khawngaih a, a chhûl a hawnsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nau a pai a, fapa a hring a. “Pathianin ka hmingchhia min chhilhsak ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hmingah Josefa a sa a. “ Lalpa chuan fapa min pêk belh ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rakilin Josefa a hrin hnu chuan Jakoban Labana hnênah, “Kan ram, kan in leh lo lamah min hawtîr tawh rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thawh hlawh, ka nupui leh ka fate hi min pe la, ka kal chhuak dâwn nia, ka thawhsak nasatzia che i hria alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Labana chuan, “Ngawi hrâm teh rih. Nangmah avângin Lalpa chuan min tihmuingîl a ni tih hriatna ka nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, hlawh i duh zât zât min dîl rawh, ka pe mai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka tha i hlâwkpuizia i hria a, ka enkawl chhûngin i ran lo pun tâkziate pawh i hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lo kal hmaa tlêm tê kha tûnah chuan a tam tâk êm hi; ka thawhna lam apiangah Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm zui zêl che a ni. Ka puala eng emaw ka tih chu a hun ta hle a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Eng nge ka pêk ang che?” a ti a. Jakoba chuan, “A hrana hlawh min pêk a ngai lo, hetiang hi i remtih theih chuan i rante hi ka thlah ang a, ka enkawl leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vawiin hian i ran rual va en chhuak ila, berâm zînga a dum te, kêl zînga a vâr pheuh pheuh leh a ṭiala vâr ṭhik ṭhek te la chhuak la, ka hlawh atân dah hran ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka hlawh i rawn enfiah leh hunah ka rinawm leh awm loh chu rang takin i hre mai thei ang. Ka ran zîngah berâm dum ni lo, kêl pawh a vâr pheuh pheuh leh a ṭial ṭhik ṭhek ni lo i hmuh chuan ka rûkah ngai zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Labana chuan, “Ni e maw le, i sawi ang chu ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi ni chuan kêlpa ṭial leh vâr pheuh pheuh, kêlpui vâr phoh phoh leh ṭial ṭhik ṭhek, a vâr kahte leh berâm dumte chu a la hrang a, a fate a enkawltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jakoba awmna aṭanga ni thum kalah a awmtîr a; Jakoba chuan Labana ran la awmte chu a khalh a, a enkawl zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jakoba chuan chawngtlai ṭang te, theite ṭang te, sehawr ṭang te a la a, a pil a khawk ṭial thluah thluah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng thingṭang ṭial chu ran tui inna kuang bulah, an hmuh theih tûrin a dah a, tui in tûra an lo kal chu an inbawh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kêl chuan tiang ṭial en chunga an rai chuan ṭial phoh phoh te, ṭial ṭhik ṭhek te, a vâr kah te an hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jakoba chuan berâm leh kêl chu a dah hrang a, tiang ṭial chu Labana kêl dumte hmuh tûrin a dah a. Chutiang chuan ama ta tûr chu a tipung a, Labana ta nên chuan a dah hrang zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ran hrisêl deuh chu an inbawh dâwnin tiang ṭial chu an hmuh tûrin tui kuang bulah chuan a dah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ran sawngnawi deuhte hmaah chuan tiang ṭial chu a dah ve duh lo. Tichuan, a sawngnawi deuhte chu Labana chuan a nei ta zêl a, Jakoba chuan a pianṭha deuhte chu a nei ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ani chu a neinung ta hle a, ran a ngah ta êm êm a, chhiahhlawh, mipa leh hmeichhia pawh a ngah a, sanghâwngsei te leh sabengtung te pawh a nei a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Labana faten, “Jakoban kan pa thil neih zawng zawng a lâksak zêl a, kan pa ta tûrin a intihausa a ni,” an tih thâwm chu Jakoba chuan a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Labanan a en dân pawh ni dang a ang ta lo tih a hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakoba hnênah, “I pianna, i pate ramah kîr leh tawh rawh, ka awmpui zêl ang che,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Rakili leh Leaii chu ran tlatna phûla lo kal tûrin a chah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an hnênah, “In pa mi en dân hi tûn hma a ang ta lo tih ka hmu thei a ni; mahse, ka pa Pathian chuan min awmpui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In pa tân theihtâwp chhuahin ka thawk ṭhîn tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, in pa hian a duh duhin min chawkzân a, ka hlawh tûr lah a nawm a mâkin a tidanglam a. Ka chhiat dêr erawh chu Pathianin a phal lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘A ṭial ṭhik ṭhek i hlawh dâwn nia,’ a tih leh ran rualte chuan a ṭial thik thek hlîr no an nei a; ‘a vâr phoh phoh i hlawh dâwn nia,’ tia a thu a thlâk leh pawhin ran rual chuan a vâr phoh phoh hlîr an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutiangin Pathianin in pa ran chi ṭha chu a chhuhsak a, min pe zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Vawi khat ran rual hur laiin mumang ka nei a, a bawhtu kêlpa zawng zawng chu a ṭial ṭhik ṭhek te, a vâr phoh phoh te, a vâr kah zeuh zeuh te vek an lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mumangah chuan Pathian Vântirhkohvin min lo bia a, ‘Jakob,’ a ti a. Kei chuan, ‘Eng nge ni?’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Dâk la, en chiang teh, ran rual bawhtu, a pa zawng zawng saw, a ṭial ṭhik ṭhek te, a vâr phoh phoh te leh a vâr kah zeuh zeuhte an nih vek saw. Labanan i chunga thil a tih dân ka hmuh ve reng avângin sawtiang sâwn thil a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bethel-ah i lungphun hriak i hnawih a, thu i tiam a, khata i hnêna inlâr Pathian kha ka nih hi. Tho la, he ram hi chhuahsan la, i pianna ramah kîr leh tawh rawh,’ min ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rakili leh Leaii chuan an chhâng a, “Kan pa ro kan chan ve tûr eng mah a awm tawh lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mikhual ang lekah min ngai tawh a ni lâwm ni? Min hralh a, kan man te lah a ei zo vek tawh bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan pa sum, Pathianin a chhuhsak zawng zawng hi kan chan tûr rêng a ni asin, Pathianin a hrilh che ang chuan ti zêl mai rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, a fate leh a nupui te chu sanghâwngsei chungah a chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ran rualte chu a khalh a, a thil neih zawng zawng, Padan-aram-a a awm chhûnga a thil neih thar zawng zawng chu a keng a, Kanan ram, Isaka awmna ram chu pan tûr chuan a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutih lai chu Labana, berâm hmul mêt tûra a thang bo hlân a ni a, Rakili chuan a pa chhûngkaw pathian milimte chu a rûksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakoba pawh chuan Suria mi Labana chu a thlim a, eng mah hrilh lovin ngaihngam takin a awmtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a neih zawng zawng nên a kal ta a, Eufretis lui chu a kân sawk sawk a, Gilead tlângram chu a pan ta vang vang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni thum ni chuan Jakoba tlânchhiat thu chu Labana an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ṭhuihruaite a khâwm a, a ûm ta a. Ni sarih a kal hnu chuan Gilead tlângramah a va ûmpha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria mi Labana chuan zâna a mumangah Pathian a hmu a, “A chhia a ṭha Jakoba hnênah fîmkhur takin thu sawi rawh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Labanan a ûmphâk khân Jakoba chuan tlâng sâng laiah puan in a lo zâr tawh a, Labana leh a ṭhuihruaite chuan Gilead tlângah bâwk an zâr ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Labana chuan Jakoba hnênah, “Ngaihngam takin min awmtîr a, min bum a, ka fanute hi engtizia nge râl man ang hrima i lâk daih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Min hrilh duh lo va, min thlim a, a rûka i tlân bo mai hi engtizia nge? Benchhek te leh perhkhuangte tumin hlim takin kan thlah tûr che alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tu leh fate thlahin a fawh takngial pawh min fawhtîr phal lo va. I thil tih dân hi a âtthlâk lutuk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichhe vek thei che ka ni asin; mahse, nizâna ka mumangah i pa Pathian ka hmu a, ‘Jakoba hnênah a chhia emaw, a ṭha emaw, fîmkhur takin thu sawi rawh,’ min rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I pa in lam i ngai a, i haw châk êm a nih pawhin kan chhûngkaw pathian leh zêl engati nge min rûksak?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a chhâng a, “I fanute hi min chhuhsak mai ang tih ka hlau êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In chhûngkaw pathian erawh chu kan zînga lo la an awm a niha, i hmuh chhuah chuan thah ni rawh se. Hêng kan unaute hmaah ngei hian, eng pawh i ta i hmuh chuan la zêl ang che,” a ti a. Jakoba chuan Rakilin a lo ru tih a hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakoba puan in chu Labana chuan a dap hmasa a, Leaii puan in leh an chhiahhlawhte puan in chu a dap zêl a, a hmu zo lo va. Leaii puan in ata a lo chhuak a, Rakili puan inah chuan a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rakili chuan milimte chu sanghâwngsei zângdam zîngah a lo thukru hman a, a ṭhut hnan a. Labanan puan in chhûng chu a dap vek a, eng mah a hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rakili chuan a pa hnênah, “Ka lalpa chuan a hmaa ka tho lo hi ngaih loh lamah ngai teh suh se, hmeichhe dân angin ka fel loh lai a ni atin a ni,” a ti a. A dap ngun hle na a, milimte chu a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jakoba chu Labana chungah chuan a thinur a, a âng ve ta thung a. “Eng nge ka bawhchhiata, thil eng nge ka tih suala min rawn ûm hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka neih zawng zawng i dap chhuak a, in chhûngkaw thil pakhat tê pawh i hmu em ni? I hmu a nih chuan han phawrh teh; hêng kan unaute hian kan inkâr thu rêl mai teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Kum sawmhnih i hnuaia ka thawh chhûng khân i berâm leh kêlpuite chuan no an chhiat ngai lo va, i berâmpa lah ka talh ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ramsa seh ka sawi ngai lo, keiman ka rûl zêl a. A bo rêng rêng, zâna bo emaw, chhûna bo emaw, min rulhtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chhûn nisain min em chau fo va, zân vûr tla khaw vawtin min hmet khawng fo bawk a, mutmu pawh ka tuah thei ṭhîn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih i hnêna ka awm chhûng khân i fanute pahnih hlawh tûrin kum sâwm leh pali min chhawr a. Kum ruk, i ran hlawh tûra i ran ka vên chhûngin ka hlawh vawi sâwm i tidanglam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka pa Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Ṭiha chu ka lamah ṭang lo se kut bêngin min kaltîr dâwn a nih hi. Amaherawhchu, Pathianin ka hahzia te, ka thawhrimzia te a hmu a, nizân khân i hriat tûrin ka thu a lo rêl fel a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Labana chuan Jakoba chu a chhâng a, “Hêng hmeichhiate hi ka fanute an ni a, an fate pawh ka ta an ni, ran rual chen hian ka ta a ni, dân ang chuan i hmuh apiang hi ka ta a la ni. Ka fanute leh an fa hrinte hi vawiin hian eng nge ka tihsak tâk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ti teh, keini pahnih hi, kan inkârah thu i thlung teh ang; lung rem vûm ila, chu chu a chhinchhiahna ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jakoba chuan lung a la a, a phun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a ṭhuihruaite chu, “Lung pu khâwm teh u,” a ti a. Lung a la khâwm a, an rem vûm a, chutah chuan chaw an ei ho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Labana chuan chu chu Jegarsahadutha a vuah a; Jakoba erawh chuan Galeed a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Labana chuan, “He lung rem vûm hi vawiin aṭangin kan inkâra thuthlung chhinchhiahna ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, a hmingah Galeed an vuah tâk ni. Mizpa an ti bawk, Labana chuan, “Hmêl kan inhmuh loh chhûngin Lalpa chuan min vêng tawn rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka fanute hi i tihnawmnah emaw, nupui dang i neihsan emaw a nih chuan tu dangin min hre lo mah se, kan inkâra thuhretu chu Pathian a ni tih hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Labana chuan Jakoba hnênah, “Hei, lung vawm vûm leh kan inkâra lungphuna ṭang tûr ka phun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ka lung rem vûm leh lungphun hi ka pawi khawih tûrin i rawn pêl tûr a ni lo tih hriatna ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Abrahama Pathian, Nahora Pathian, an pahniha Pathian chuan kan inkâr thuthlung hi vawng him rawh se,” a ti a. Jakoba chuan a pa Isaka Ṭiha chhâlin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tlâng sângah chuan Jakoban ran a hlân a, a sa ei tûrin a ṭhiante chu a sâwm a. An ei zawh chuan tlâng sângah chuan an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan a fanute leh a tute chu Labana chuan a fâwp a, “Dam takin,” a ti a, a awmna lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chu a kal zêl a, Pathian Vântirhkohte chuan an lo tâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chu a hmuhin Jakoba chuan, “He lai hi Pathian sipaite ṭanhmun a ni phawt mai,” a ti a, chu hmun chu Mahanaim a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A u Esauva chu Edom mite chênna Seir ramah a awm a, Jakoba chuan mi a tîr a, hetiang hian a hrilhtîr a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka Lalpa Esauva hnênah chuan ‘I chhiahhlawh Jakoba chuan heti hian a ti: Labana hnênah ka han awm a, tûn thlengin min lo chelh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bâwng leh sabengtung, berâm pawh, chhiahhlawh mipa leh hmeichhia nên ka nei ve ta. Min lo lawm beiseiin ka Lalpa hnênah ka chanchin hi ka rawn than lâwk a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mi tirhte chu an lo haw leh a, Jakoba hnênah, “I u Esauva chu kan va hmu a, hmuak tûr chein amah ngei pawh a lo kal e, mi zali a rawn hruai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a hlau ta hle a, a thlaphâng mangang chuan a mi hruai te, a ran te, a bâwng te leh sanghâwngsei te chu pâwl hnihah a ṭhen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Esauvan pâwl khat hi rawn nangchîngin bei mah se, pâwl khat hi an la insaseng thei ang,” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba chu a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , ka pu Abrahama Pathian, ka pa Isaka Pathian, ‘in ramah, i laichînte hnênah haw tawh rawh, i chungah ṭhat ka chhuah zêl dâwn,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chungah ngil i nei tlat zêl ṭhîn hi ka phu loh a ni. Jordan lui ka kân khân ka tiang chauh lo chu eng mah ka nei lo va; tûnah zawng, pâwl hniha ṭhen tham hial ka lo nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka u Esauva lakah hian min hum teh, ka ngên a che; chutilo zawng, nunau lamin mi a rawn sâm dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang chuan, ‘I chungah ṭhat ka chhuah ngei ang a, tuipui kama ṭiau chhiar sên loh angin i thlahte ka tipung ang,’ i tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi hmunah chuan a riak a, a ran kawl zîng ata a u Esauva pêk tûr a thlang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kêlpui zahnih leh a pa sawmhnih, berâmpui zahnih leh a pa sawmhnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sanghâwngsei sâwr lai sawmthum an notê nên; bâwngpui sawmli leh a pa sâwm; sabengtungpui sawmli leh a pa sâwm a dah hrang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng chu a pâwl zêlin a chhiahhlawhte a khalhtîr a, an hnênah chuan, “Lo kal hmasa rawh u, kâr nei deuhvin kal ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pâwl hmasa ber khalhtu hnênah chuan, “Ka u Esauvan a lo hmuh che-a, ‘Tu mi leh sa nge i nih, khaw nge i kal dâwn? I ran khalh zozai kha tu ta nge?’ a tih che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘I nau Jakoba mi ka ni a, ka lalpa Esauva pêk tûr min khalhtîr a ni, amah Jakoba pawh kan hnung lawkah sâwn a lo kal,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin pâwl hnihna khalhtu chu a hrilh a, a pâwl dang dang pawh a hrilh vek a, “Chutiang tak chuan Esauva hnên in thlen hunah sawi ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘I chhiahhlawh Jakoba pawh hnung lawkah sâwn a lo kal e,’ ti tel ngei ngei ang che u,” a ti a. “Thilpêktea ka tihlungawi hmasak chuan amah ka hmuh hunah mi ngaidam ngei ang,” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thilpêkte chu lui an khalh kai hmasa a, chumi zânah chuan Jakoba chu bûkah chuan a riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan a tho va, a nupui pahnihte leh a chhiahhlawhnu pahnihte chu, a fa sâwm leh pakhatte nên a hruai a, Jabok lui kaiah chuan a kaipui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kaipui hnu chuan a thil neih zawng zawng pawh a thiar kai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jakoba chu amah chauhvin a awm ta a; khawvâr hma chu mi pakhat hian a buan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jakoba chu a hneh tâk loh avângin a khêl a khawihsak a, a khêlruh chu an inbuanna lamah chuan a pelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ni a chhuak dâwn, mi thlah rawh,” a ti a. Jakoba chuan, “Mal mi sâwm hma chu ka thlah lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tu nge i hming?” a ti a. “Jakoba,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Jakoba an ti tawh lo vang che, Israela i ni tawh zâwk ang. Pathian leh mihring i buan a, i hneh tâk zâwk avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakoba chuan, “Khawngaih takin i hming min hrilh teh,” a ti a. “Engati nge ka hming min zawh?” a ti a, mal a sâwm a, a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakoba chuan chumi hmun chu Peniel a vuah a, “A hmai chhanah Pathian ka hmu a; mahse, nungdamin ka la awm a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Peniel a kalsan chuan ni a chhuak a, a khêl avâng chuan a bai ta suih suih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûn thlengin Israela thlahte chuan khêlruh inzawmna lai tha hi an ei duh lo, Jakoba khêl tha thlung a khawihsak avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chu a han dâk a, Esauva leh a mi hruai zali chu a hmu a. A fate chu an nute ṭheuh, Leaii te, Rakili te leh a hmeite bulah chuan a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmeite leh an fate chu an kal hmasa a, Leaii leh a fate chuan an dawt a, Rakili leh Josefa chu a hnuhnûng berah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah Jakoba chuan hma a hruai a, a u bul a thlen dâwn chuan vawi sarih lei si-a kûnin a u chu chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah tâwk tûrin Esauva chu a lo tlân a, bek insiin an inpawm a, an infâwp a, an ṭap dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Esauva chuan a han en vêl a, hmeichhiate leh naupangte chu a hmu a, “Hêng i mi hruaite hi tute nge ni?” a ti a. “Naupangte hi Pathianin i chhiahhlawh a khawngaih a, a pêkte an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhiahhlawhte chu an fate nên an lo kal a, Esauva hmaah chuan an kûn a, chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leaii leh a fate an lo kal a, a hmaah chuan an kûn a, a tâwp berah Josefa leh Rakili chu an lo kal a, an rawn kûn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “I hmaa ran i rawn khalhtîr zozai kha engtizia nge ni?” a ti a. “Min lo khawngaih theih nân ka ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “E, Mama, kei pawhin ka ngah asin, i ta chu nei zêl zâwk rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakoba chuan, “Ni lo ve, khawngaih takin ka thilpêk theih chhun che kha pawm hrâm teh, min lo lâwma, i hmêl ka hmu ngawt pawh hi Pathian hmu ang ka ni alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thilpêk ka rawn kensak che hi pawm hrâm teh. Pathianin min khawngaih a, ka la ngah alâwm,” a ti a. A tih tlat avâng chuan Esauva chuan a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “Ti rawh, i kal zêl ang, hma ka han hruaisak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Naupangte hi an la tê hle a, berâm leh ran dangte pawh no hruai an ni tih ka lalpa chuan i hria, ni khat pawh khalh chak lui ila an thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka lalpa chuan i chhiahhlawh hi lo kal hmasaksan la, kei chu zawi awiin naupang leh ran rual zai ngaiin Seir-ah ka lo kal ve ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esauva chuan, “Ka rawn kalpui, mi ṭhenkhat hi ka hnutchhiah ang che,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Engah nge ka tihhah ang che, a ṭûlna a awm lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Esauva chu Seir lam pan chuan a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakoba chu Sukot-ah a kal a, bâwk a khawh a, a rante awmna tûr a siam bawk a. Chumi avâng chuan chu hmun hming chu ‘Sukoth’ tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Padan-aram aṭang chuan Jakoba chu Kanan ram Sekem khua chu dam takin a lo thleng a. Chu khaw bulah chuan awmhmun a khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu hmun chu tangka sekel za-in Sekema pa Hamora thlahte hnên aṭangin a lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tah chuan maichâm a siam a, a hmun hmingah chuan El-Elohe-Israel a vuah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leaiin Jakoba a hrinsak Dinaii chu, chu ram nulate tlawh tûrin a lêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu lai mite hotupa chu Hiv mi, Hamora a ni. A fapa Sekeman ani chu a lo man a, a mutpui lui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakoba fanu Dinaii chu a ngaizâwng êm êm a, tihlâwm a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sekema chuan a pa hnênah, “Nula hi mi neihsak rawh,” a ti ta tlut tlut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a fanu Dinaii chu Sekeman a lo tibawrhbâng tih a lo hria a, a fate kha ramhnuaiah ran rual nên an awm lai a ni a; an lo haw hma chu a ngawi mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakoba fanu dîl tûr chuan Sekema pa Hamora chu a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Jakoba fate chu ram aṭangin an lo haw a, chanchin an han hriat chuan an so sa phut a, an thin a ur ta êm êm a. Sekeman Jakoba fanu a lo pâwngsual mai chu Israel-te zîngah tih thiang lo a ni a, ngawihpui mai mai chi a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hamora chuan an hnênah, “Ka fapa Sekema chuan in fanu hi duh tak têin a duh tlat a ni. Khawngaih takin neihtîr hrâm teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inneih pawlh ila a ṭha ang. In fanute min neihtîr ula, kan fanute nei bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, kan awm ho thei ang a, in duhna lai laiah in awm thei ang a, in duh angin in khawsa ang a, rante in nei thei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nula pa leh a nuṭate hnênah Sekema chuan, “Min khawngaih teh u, in phût ang ang ka ti ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A man chu eng zât pawh min dîl ula, ka pe zêl ang che u, min neihtîr hrâm teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jakoba fate chuan an farnu a tihbawrhbân avâng chuan Sekema leh a pa chu fing takin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Kan remti thei lo; serh tan loh kan farnu kan neihtîr chuan kan tan thil zahthlâk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimahni anga mipa zawng zawng serh in tan ve vek erawh chuan kan neihtîr thei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, kan fanute in nei thei ang a, in fanute kan nei thei bawk ang a, in zîngah awmin laichîn unau kan ni thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Serh in tan duh loh chuan kan farnu chu kan hruai ang a, kan kal daih ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hamora leh a fapa chuan an thil phût chu âwm an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba fanu chu a duh êm kher a, tlangvâl chuan an thu chu a bawh zui ta chung chung a; a chipuite chuan ani chu an ngaisâng hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hamora leh a fapa Sekema chu kulh kawngkaa khaw hotute hnênah chuan an kal a, an khaw mite hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hêngho hi nêlawm tak an ni. Ram hi kan thâwl bawk a, awm ve sela, an duh duhin sumdâwng teh se. An fanute nupuiah kan nei ang a, kan fanute pawh nupuiah nei ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng mite hian kan zînga awmin laichîn unau kan nih theih nân thil pakhat chauh an tih anga kan mipa zawng zawng serh tan an phût tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An ran neih zozai, an sum leh pai, an sate nên hian kan ta a ni mai dâwn asin. Kan zînga an awm ve duh nân an phût ang chu i ti mai ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hamora leh a fapa Sekema thu chu mi pangngai chin chuan rem an ti a, an zînga mipa pangngai chin chuan serh an tan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ni thum ni, a nat zual lai tak chuan Dinaii nuṭa Simeona leh Levia, Jakoba fapa pahnih chuan an khandaih an keng a, tu ma lo dan lohvin khuaah chuan an lût a, mipa zawng zawng chu an râwt ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hamora leh a fapa Sekema pawh an sât hlum a, Sekema in aṭang chuan Dinaii chu an la chhuak a, an hâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakoba fa dangte chuan an mi thahte an va hmuh chuan khua chu an suam ta a, an farnu tihbawrhbân man phuba an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An berâm te, bâwng te, sabengtung te, khaw chhûng leh pâwna an thil neih zawng zawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an sum leh pai zawng zawng chu, an fate leh an nupuite nên an man a, an in chhûnga awm zawng zawng pawh an lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Simeona leh Levia hnênah, “He rama chêng Kanan mite leh Periz mite tana hnawksakah min siam a, mi timangang hle a ni. Kan tlêm si a, min rawn bei sela kan mi zawng zawngte nên hian min nuai bo ang asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kan farnu hi mihur anga lo sawisak tûr em ni?” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathianin Jakoba hnênah, “Bethel-ah kal la, han awm rawh. I u Esauva i tlânbosan laia i hnêna inlâr Pathian kha maichâm siamsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a chhûngte leh an zînga awm zawng zawng chu a hrilh a. “Pathian dang lim in kawlte chu paih bo rawh u. Inthian thianghlim ula, silhfên thar inbel ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethel-ah kan kal dâwn a, ka mangan laia min ngaihventu Pathian tân maichâm ka siam dâwn a ni; ani chuan ka kalna apiangah min awmpui ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An zînga pathian dang lim awm zawng zawng chu Jakoba an pe a, an bengbehte pawh an pe a; Sekem sasaw thing hnuaiah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An chhuak ta a, chûng lai hmuna awmte chu hlauhna nasa takin a man a, Jakoba hote chu an ûmzui ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Kanan ram Luz khua tih ṭhin Bethel chu a mite nên chuan an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tah chuan maichâm a siam a, a u a tlân bosan laia chumi hmuna a hnêna Pathian a rawn inlâr avângin chu hmun chu El-bethel a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Rakili awmtu Debori chu a thi a, Bethel chuan hnuai sasaw bulah an phûm a, chu hmun chu Alon-bakut an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Padan-aram aṭanga Jakoba a lo hâwn khân a hnênah Pathian a inlâr a, mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian chuan a hnênah: “I hming Jakoba a ni a, Jakoba ka ti tawh lo vang che, I hming chu Israela a ni tawh ang,” a ti a. Chuvângin, Israela tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian chuan a hnênah: “El-Sadaia ka ni, I chi ṭha sela, pung duah duah ang che, Hnam, pung khâwm tih tham zet I thlah dâwn a ni. I ṭhâlbe aṭang tein lalte an lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abrahama leh Isaka ka pêk ram chu Tûnah ka pe a che, I thlah lo la awm tûrte tân He ram hi ka pe che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biakna hmun ata chu Pathian chuan a kalsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Pathianin a biakna hmunah chuan lung a phun a, inthawina uain a bun a, hriak a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathianin a rawn biakna hmun chu Jakoba chuan Bethel a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bethel aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Efratha khaw thlen hma deuh chuan Rakili chuan nau a vei a, a na hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nau vei nat vânglai chuan nau chhartu chuan, “Thlaphâng suh, fapa i nei leh dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thi a ni ta mai a, a ṭawng hnuhnûngah a fa hmingah chuan Benoni a ti a. A pa erawh chuan a hmingah Benjamina a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rakili chu a thi ta a, Efratha khaw kawngah chuan an phûm a, Efratha chu Bethlehem an tih tâk hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thlânah chuan Jakoban hriatrengna lung a phun a, chu chu tûn thlengin Rakili thlânah chuan a la awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israela chu a kal zêl a, Mig-dal-eder piahah bûk a khuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />heta a awm lai hian Reubenan a pa hmei Bilhaii a lo mutpui a, Israela chuan chu chu a hria. Jakoba chuan fapa sâwm leh pahnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leaii hrinte: Jakoba fa u ber chu Reubena a ni a; a dawttu chu Simona te, Levia te, Juda te, Isakara leh Zebuluna te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rakili hrinte: Josefa leh Benjamina.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rakili bawih Bilhaii hrinte: Dana leh Naftalia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leaii bawih Zilpaii hrinte: Gada leh Asera. Khîng khi Jakoba fa, Padan-aram-a a awm laia piangte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kiriat-arba, Hebron an tih tâk rama Mamre khua, a pa Isaka awmna chu, Jakoba chuan a thleng ta a. Chu hmun chu a ni Abrahama leh Isaka mikhualna hmun chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isaka chu kum za leh sawmriata upa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hnuk a chat a, tarkûn khûp bihin a thi ta a; a laichînte hnênah hruai a ni a. A fapa Esauva leh Jakoba chuan an phûm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi Esauva thlahte chanchin chhuina a ni; ani hi Edoma tih a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Esauva chuan hêng Kanan hmeichhiate hi nupuiah a nei a: Hit mi Elona fanu Adaii te, Hiv mi Zibeona fapa Ana fanu, Oholibami te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ismaela fanu Nebaiota farnu Basemathi te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adaii chuan Esauva chu fapa Elifaza a hrinsak a; Basemathiin Reuela a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oholibami chuan Jeusa te, Jalama te, Kora te a hring a. Khîng khi Esauva fapa, Kanan rama piangte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esauva chuan a nupui te, a fanu leh fapa te, an chhûng zînga awm ve zawng zawng te, a ran vulh, ran chi hrang hrang te, Kanan rama sum leh pai a neih tâk te chu chhawmin, a nau Jakoba dîp lo tûrin, Seir tlângramah a pêm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An neihnun dun tâk êm avângin an awm ho hlei thei tawh lo a ni, an mikhualna ram chuan an ran tlatna tûr a daih tawh ngang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Esauva chu Seir tlângramah chuan a awm ta a. Esauva chu Edoma tih a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Seir tlângrama Edom-ho thlahtu Esauva thlahte chanchin chu hetiang hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng hi Esauva fate chu an ni; Elifaza, Esauva nupui Adaii hrin; Reuela, Esauva nupui Basemathi hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Elifaza chuan fapa - Temana te, Omara te, Zefoa te, Gatama te, Kenaza te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Esauva fa Elifaza chuan hmei, Timnai a nei a; chu chuan Elifaza chu fapa Amaleka a hrinsak a. Chûng chu Esauva nupui Adaii thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêng hi Reuela fate chu an ni: Nahata te, Zera te, Sama te, Miza te: chûng chu Esauva nupui Basemathi thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Esauva nupui Oholibami, Zibeona fapa Ana fanu chuan Esauva chu fapa pathum - Jeusa te, Jalama te, Kora te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esauva thlah chi hrang hrangte chu hêng hi an ni: Esauva fa tîr Elifaza thlahte: Teman-ho te, Omar-ho te, Zefo-ho te, Kenaz-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kora-ho te, Gatam-ho te leh Amalek-ho te hi an ni. Khîng khi Elifaza chi, Edom rama awm, Adaii thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Esauva fa Reuela thlahte chu hêng hi an ni: Nahat-ho te, Zera-ho te, Sama-ho te leh Miza-ho te; khîng khi Reuela chi Edom rama awm, Esauva nupui Basemathi thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Esauva nupui Oholibami thlahte chu hênghote hi an ni: Jeusa chi te, Jalam chi te, Zera chi te, khîngho khi Ana fanu Oholibami, Esauva nupui thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng chu Esauva, Edoma an tih bawk, thlah chi hrang hrang hmingte chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />He rama lo awm sa Hor mi, Seira thlahte chu hêng hi an ni: Lotana te, Sobala te, Zibeona te, Ana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Disona te, Ezera te, Disana te, Edom rama Hor hnam Seira thlahte chu khîngte khi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotana fate chu Hora leh Hemana an ni. Lotana chuan farnu Timnai a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sobalan fa hêngte hi a nei: Alvana te, Manahata te, Ebala te, Zefoa te, Onama te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zibeonan fapa pahnih Aia leh Ana a nei. Ana hi a ni, a pa Zibeona sabengtung thlaha thlalêra tuihna hmu chhuaktu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ana chuan fapa Disona leh fanu Oholibami a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Disona chuan fapa Hemdana te, Esbana te, Ithrana te, Kherana te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezera chuan fapa pathum Bilhana te, Zavana te, Akana te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Disana chuan fapa - Uza leh Arana a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lotana chi te, Sobal chi te, Zibeon chi te, Ana chi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dison chi te, Ezer chi te, Disan chi te hi Hor hnam an ni. Seir rama Hor hnam awmte chu a chi chiin khîngte khi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel rama lal an awm hmain hêngte hi Edom rama lal awm tawhte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Beora fapa Bela chu Edom ram lalah a ṭang a, a khawpui hming chu Dinhaba a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bela a thih chuan Bozra khaw mi Zera fapa Jobaba chuan a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jobaba a thih chuan Teman-ho rama mi Husaman a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Husama a han thih ve chuan Bedada fapa Hadada chu a aiawhin a lal a, ani hi Moab rama Midian-ho hnehtu kha a ni; a khawpui hming chu Avit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hadada a thih chuan Masreka mi Samlaa chu a aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Samlaa a thih chuan Rehobot khaw awmna Luipui an tih aṭanga lo kal Saula chuan a ai a rawn awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saula a thih chuan Akbora fapa Baal-hanana chu a aiawhin a lal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />a khawpui hming chu Pau a ni. A nupui chu Mehetabeli a ni a, Mezahaba fa Matredi fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hêng chi, Timna chi te, Alva chi te, Jethet chi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Oholibam chi te, Ela chi te, Pinon chi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kenaz chi te, Teman chi te, Mibzar chi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Magdiel chi te, Iram chi te hi Esauva thlahte an ni. An awmna bial chuan a awmte chi hming chu a pu ṭheuh zêl a. Chûng chu Esauva thlah, Edom mi, Edom rama chêngte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chu a pa mikhualna ram, Kanan ramah chuan a awm ta a. Hei hi Jakoba chhûngte chanchin chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pasarih a tlinin Josefa chuan a ute berâm vênpuiin a pa hmei Bilhaii leh Zilpaii fate chu a zui ve ṭhîn a, an chanchin ṭha lo a pa hnênah a rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israela chuan Josefa chu a tar lam fa a nih avângin a fa dang zawng aiin a duat zâwk a; kawrfual mawi tak a ṭhuisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An pa chuan a fa dang zawng zawng aiin ani chu a ngaina zâwk tih a ute chuan an hriatin an haw ta êm êm a, ṭawng ṭha pawhin an be duh ta lo hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vawi khat chu Josefa chuan mumang a nei a, a ute chu a hrilh a, chumi avâng chuan an haw zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Ka mumang hi lo ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lovah buhphal kan lo têl a, ka buhphal têl chu a ding hlut a, in buhphal têlte chuan an rawn din hual a, chibai bûkin zu rawn kûn a!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ute chuan, “Nang tehchai hian kan chungah ro i rêl ang maw? Kan hotu i ni vei ang maw?” an ti a; a mumang a sawi chu an huat lehzualna chhan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mumang dang a nei leh a, a ute chu a hrilh leh bawk a: “Ngai teh u, mumang dang ka nei leh asin. Tûn ṭuma ka mumangah chuan ni te, thla te leh arsi sâwm leh pakhatte khi ka hmaah lo zu kûn a!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pa pawh a hrilh a, ani chuan a lo zilh a, “I mumang hi engtihna nge ni ngai! Kei leh i nu te, i ute hi i hmaah lei siin kan la kûn ang maw!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ûte chu a chungah an lungni lo hle a, a pa erawh chuan a ngaihtuah neuh neuh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni khat chu a ute chuan an pa berâm Sekem-ah an va thlah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israela chuan Josefa hnênah, “I uten Sekem-ah berâm an thlah kha. Ti teh, an hnênah ka tîr teh ang che,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Mi tîr ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Kal ta la, i ute leh an berâmte chu eng angin nge an awm va chian la, min rawn hrilh leh ang che,” a ti a. Hebron ruam aṭang chuan a tîr chhuak a, Sekem lam chu a pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phûla a tei a tei lai chuan mi pakhat a lo kal a, “Eng nge i zawn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka ute ka zawng a ni, Khawiah nge berâm an thlah i hre lo maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Heta ṭanga an insawn dâwn khân, ‘Dothan lamah i kal ang u,’ an ti ni âwmin ka hria e,” a ti a. Tichuan, Josefa chuan a ute chu a ûmzui a, Dathan-ah chuan a va ûm phâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hla fea a la awm laiin a ute chuan an lo hmu a, a lo thlen hnaih hma chuan tihhlum zai an lo rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“En teh u, mumang neia a lo kal saw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Engah nge kan thah mai loh vâng? Khurah kan paih ang a, sa-in a seh a ni kan ti mai tûr alâwm. A mumang kha eng meuh nge a nih phah dâwn kan hre mai ang,” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu chu Reubenan a lo hria a, an kut ata chhan chhuah a tum a, “A thah zawng i that êm lo vang u. Thisen zawng chhuah teh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saw lai thlalêra khurah sâwn i thlâk mai ang u. Nangni meuh chuan kut thlâk lo hrâm teh u,” a ti a; an kut ata chhan chhuaha, an pa hnêna hawtîr a tum rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josefa a lo thlen chuan a ute chuan a kawr hâk lai, a kawrfual mawi takte nên chuan an hlihsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an man a, khurah an thlâk ta a. Khurah chuan eng mah a awm lo, tui tlêm pawh a awm hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, chaw an fâk lai chuan an han thlîr a, Ismael-ho, sanghâwngsei rual nên, Gilead aṭanga lo kal an hmu a, beraw te, thinghnai damdawi te, Mura te an phur a, Aigupta ramah an chhukpui dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Juda chuan a unaute hnênah, “Kan nau hi i that lo vang u, kan thah a nih thu zêp bo thei pawh ni ila eng nge kan tân hlâwkna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ti rawh u, Ismael-ho hnênah i hralh mai ang u. Keimahni êm chuan kan nau, kan thisen zawmpui ngei chungah zawng kut i thlâk lo vang u,” a ti a. An unauza chuan an remti tlâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutih chhûng chuan Midian sumdâwng rual an lo kal a. Khur aṭang chuan Josefa chu an khai chhuak a, Ismael mite hnênah tangka sawmhnihin an hralh a. Josefa chu Aigupta ramah an hruai thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Reubena chu khurah chuan a va kal a, Josefa chu a lo awm tawh si lo va, a puan a pawtthlêr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a unaute hnênah chuan a lo kîr a, “Ka nau a bo ta, engtin nge kan tih tâk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Josefa kawrfual mawi chu an la a, kêltê an talh a, a kawr chu thisenah chuan an hnim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kawrfual chu an pa hnênah an hâwn a, “Hei hi kan chhar ngawt a, i fapa kawr kha a ni nge ni lo en chiang teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lo hre mai a, “Ka fapa kawr zu nia le! Ramsain a seh a ni phawt ang. Josefa hi ramsa kutah a thi ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a, saiip a vêng a, ni rei tak chhûng a fapa chu a sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A fapa leh a fanu zawng zawng chuan hnem an tum a; mahse, hnem rual a ni lo. “Hnem mi ka ni lo, lusûnin Seol-ah ka fa hnênah ka liam dâwn e,” a ti a. Chutiang chuan a pa chu amah ngaiin a ṭap ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutih chhûng chuan Midian-ho khân Josefa chu Aigupta ramah an kalpui a, Farawa hmaa milian Potifara hnênah an hralh a. Ani chu vêngtu pâwla hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih lai vêl chuan Juda chuan a unaute chu a kalsan a, mi pakhat, Adulam mi Hira chu a zu kawp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda chuan Sua fanu nula chu a hmu a, nupuiah a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nau a pai a, fapa a hrinsak a, a hmingah Era a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nau a pai leh a, fapa a hring a, a nu chuan a hmingah Onana a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Fa dang a hring leh a, a hmingah Sela a sa a; chu mi pian lai chuan Juda chu Khezib khuaah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda chuan a fa tîr Era chu nupui Tamari a neihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda fa tîr Era chu Lalpa hmuhin a sual hle a, Lalpa chuan a tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda chuan Onana hnênah, “I u nupui hi pâwl teh, pasalte nau tih tûr chu tihsak la, i u tân chi thlahsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onana chuan chi thlah tûr chu ama fa a ni dâwn lo tih a hria a; a u nupui a pâwl apiangin a u tân chi a thlahsak lohna tûrin a chi chu leiah a titla ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thiltih chu Lalpa ṭha tih loh zâwng tak a ni a, a tihlum ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda chuan a monu Tamari hnênah, “Ka fapa Sela hi a puitlin hma chu in in lamah pasal nei lovin va awm tawh,” a ti a; Sela pawh chu a ûte angin a thi ve mai ang tih a hlau a ni. Tamari chu a pate in lamah chuan a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rei fe hnuah chuan Sua fanu, Juda nupui chu a thi a. Lusûn hun bi a ral hnu chuan a ṭhianpa Adulam mi Hira nên chuan Timna khuaah berâm hmul mêt tûrin an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miin Tamari chu, “I pasala pa chu berâm hmul mêt tûrin Timna khuaah a lo chho dâwn,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lusûn thawmhnaw chu a hlîp a, a hmêl hriat theih loh tûrin hmai khuhnain a intuam tlat a, Timna khaw kawnga kulh kawngah chuan a lo ṭhu a; Sela chu a puitling tawh si a, a pa chuan nupuiah a neihtîr lo zo ta a ni tih a hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda chuan ani chu a hmu a, a hmai a khuh tlat avângin nawhchizuar emaw a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kawng sîra a ṭhu chu a pan a, “Ti teh, i mu dûn ang,” a ti a, a monu kha a ni tih reng a hre lo. “Min mutpui manah eng nge min pêk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ka ran rual zînga kêl notê ka pe ang che,” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Min rawn pêk hmain eng emaw hrên tûr dahkham i nei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Eng nge dahkham ka pêk ang che?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “I hming nemna awrh leh i tiang kha le,” a ti a. Chûng chu a pe a, a mutpui a, nau a pai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, a inkhuhna puan chu a hlîp a, a lusûn thuamhnaw chu a inbel leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Juda chuan a dahkham la kîr tûrin a ṭhian Adulam mi Hira chu kêltê kengin hmeichhe hnênah chuan a tîr a; a va hmu zo lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuta mite hnênah chuan, “Enaim kawng sîra hmeichhe inkhuh awm ṭhîn kha khaw nge a awm tâk?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Chutiang hmeichhia hetah an awm ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda hnênah chuan a lo kîr a, “Ka hmu zo hauh lo mai. Khuaa mite pawh ka zâwt a, ‘chutiang hmeichhe inkhuh ṭhîn an awm ngai lo,’ an ti asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda chuan, “Kan dahkham chu nei hlen mai rawh se; mi nuihzatbûr kan ni mai dâwn alâwm. Ka tiam angin kêltê chu kei chuan ka pe ngei a, ani chu i va hmu si lo va le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thla thum vêl hnuah chuan Juda chu, “I monu Tamari chuan tlangvâl a nei a, sâwn a pai asin,” tiin an hrilh a. “Kai chhuak ula, hâl hlum rawh u,” a ti khu khu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An kaih chhuah lai chuan a pasala pa hnênah Tamari chuan, “Hêng neitu fa hi a ni ka pai; hêng hming nemna awrh leh tiangte hi tu ta nge lo en teh se,” tiin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Juda chuan a lo hre mai a, “Kei aiin thil a tidik zâwk a ni; ka fapa Sela hi ka neihtîr ta si lo va,” a ti a. Ani chu a pâwl leh ngai tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nau hrin a lo hun chuan phîr a pai a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A han hrin dâwn chuan pakhat bân a lo lang a, nau chhartu chuan bân lo lang chu piang hmasa tih hriat nân la sen a buntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A bân chu a pil leh a, a pakhat zâwk chu a lo chhuak ta a. Nau chhartu chuan, “Nangma thuin i lo chhuak ta mai a ni maw,” a ti a, a hmingah Pereza a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />La sen bun zâwk pawh chu a lo piang a, a hmingah Zera a sa a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa chu Ismael-ho chuan Aigupta ramah an hruai chhuk a, Aigupta mi, mi pakhat, Farawa hnuaia milian, vêngtu hotu Potifara hnênah an hralh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a awmpui avângin Josefa chu a hmuingîl hle zêl a; a pu, Aigupta mi chuan, in chhûng lam hna a thawhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a awmpui a, a thiltih apiangah a hlawhtling zêl tih a pu chuan a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A duh hle a, amah viltu bîkah a ruat a. An chhûngkaw enkawltu leh a neih zawng zawng kawltua a dah chinah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Josefa avângin Lalpa chuan Aigupta mi chhûngkua chu mal a sâwm a, a neih zawng zawngah, in lam leh ram lamah, Lalpa malsâwmna chu a dawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A neih zawng zawng chu Josefa kutah a dah vek a, ani a awm phawt chuan eng mah a ngaihtuah lo, a ei tûr bîk tih chauh lo chu. Josefa chu tlangvâl tlâwntlai ṭha deuh, hmêlṭha tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah chuan a pu nupui chuan Josefa chu a ngaizâwng a, mutpuiah a thlêm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chu a ṭang a, a pu nupui hnênah chuan, “Kei ka awm phawt chuan ka pu hian in chhûng lam thil eng mah a ngaihtuah lo; a neih zawng zawng min kawltîr vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He in chhûngah hian kei aiin thu a nei chuang lo; nang, a nupui tih chauh lo hi chu ka tân ui pawh eng mah a nei lo. Chuvângin, Pathian lakah hetiang thil sual hi engtin nge ka tih theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni tin a thlêm ngut ngut a; mahse, a duh lo tlat a, a bul hnaia awm pawh a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat chu in chhûngah hna thawk tûrin a lût a, chhiahhlawh tu mah in chhûnga an awm loh lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A puanah chuan a lo man a, “Ti rawh, i mu dûn ang,” a ti a; mahse, a tlân chhuahsan ta a, a puan erawh chu a kutah chuan a tlânsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tlân chhuak a, a puan a tlânsan tih a hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chhiahhlawhte chu a au ta chiam a, “En teh u, Hebrai mi, mi timualpho tûr a rawn hruai lût a lo nih hi. Min mutpui tumin khum pindanah a lo lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mahse, theih tâwkin ka au va, puan pawh chuh lovin a tlân ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josefa pu a lo haw hma chuan puan chu a kawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hnênah, “Hebrai mi i rawn hawn khân min sual a tum a, a lo lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, ka au chiam a, a puan pawh chuh lovin a tlânchhe ta a ni,” tiin chanchin a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘I bawihin chutin khatin min ti’ a tih a han hriat chuan Josefa pu chu a thinur ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa chu a hruai a, lal lung in tâng dahna lung inah a tântîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tân ina a awm pawh chu Lalpa chuan a awmpui a, a khawngaih a, tân in vêngtu chu a duhsaktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tân in vêngtu chuan lung in tâng zawng zawng enkawltuah a hmang a; tih tûr awm apiang a titu a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a awmpui avângin tân in vêngtu tân eng mah tih ve a ngai lo, a tih apiangah Lalpa chuan a tihmuingîl zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Aigupta lal no kengtu leh chhang siamtu chuan an pu Aigupta lal hmaah thil tih fel loh an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farawa chu a chhiahhlawh pahnih, no kengtu leh chhang siamtu chungah chuan a thin a ur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josefa tânna hmun, tâng vêngtu hotu awmnaah chuan anni chu an rawn tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tâng vêngtu hotu chuan chûng mi pahnihte tirhkah atân Josefa chu a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rei fe an tân hnu chuan Aigupta lal no kengtu leh chhang siamtute pahnih chuan zan khatah mumang awmze hrang nei an mang ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tûk zînga Josefa a lo kal chuan an hmêl a lo ngui hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pu, tâng vêngtu hotu ina tâng ve, Farawa miliante chu, “Engtizia nge vawiin chu in va ngui ve?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mumang kan nei a, tu man min hrilh fiahsak thei lo va ni,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Mumang hrilh fiahnate chu Pathian pêk alâwm, mi han hrilh teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No kengtu lu ber chuan Josefa hnênah, “Ka mumangah chuan grep hrui zâm hi ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pêng pathum a nei a, a kuhmûm chauh tih chuan a pâr parh a, a rah ta mai a, a rah bâwr chu a hmin a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farawa no ka lo keng a, grep rah chu ka lo va, Farawa novah chuan ka sâwr a, Farawa kutah no chu lo zu pe ia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josefa chuan, “A awmzia chu hetiang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pêng thum chu ni thum tihna a ni, ni thumah Farawa chuan i lu a chawikâng ang a, i hna ngai a thawhtîr leh ang che, a no kengtu i nih laia i tih ṭhin angin no chu Farawa i hlân dâwn a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I chan a ṭhat hunah chuan heta ka awm dân hi hre reng la, Farawa hnênah hemi aṭanga mi chhuah tûrin kamkhat talin mi han sawisak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hebrai mite ram aṭanga rûk bo ka ni a, tân ina dahna khawp thil sual eng mah tih ka nei bawk si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhang siamtu chuan ṭha takin mang chu a hrilh fiah tih a hria a, Josefa hnênah, “Ka mang ve chu, bâwm pathum ka lo chhîpchhuan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a chung berah chuan Farawa ei tûr chhang tuihnai chi tinrêng a awm a. Ka chhîpchhuan lai chu savaten an rawn chu noh noh mai zu nia!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josefa chuan a chhâng a, “Hei hi a awmzia chu a ni: bâwm thum chu ni thum tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni thum a nihin Farawa chuan i lu a tan ang a, i taksa chu thingah a khai ang a, savate chuan i sa chu an rawn tlân noh noh dâwn a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni thum ni chuan Farawa chuan a pian champha lâwmin a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng tân ruai a ṭheh a. A no kengtu leh chhang siamtu chu a hre chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No kengtu chu a no kengtuah a dah leh a, Farawa no a keng leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhang siamtu lal ber erawh chu Josefa sawi ang khân thingah a khai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />No kengtu lu ber chuan Josefa chu a ngaihsak ta awzâwng lo va, a theihnghilh hmin dêr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum hnih hnuah chuan Faraw-an mumang a nei a. Nail lui kamah a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lui aṭang chuan bâwngpui pasarih, thau ṭha tak tak an lo chhuak a, lui kam rairuang hmunah chuan an tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnung maiah chuan bâwngpui pasarih chêr chhe êm êm an lo chhuak a, a hmasate bulah khân an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bâwng chêr chhe tak tak chuan bâwng thau tak tak chu an ei zo ta mai a. Farawa chu a ṭhangharh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A han muhîl leh a, mang a nei zawm a: buh kûng khatah vui sarih, ṭha tak, bit deuh a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dawtah vui sarih, sîn tê tê, thli lum chhêm ro rim rem a lo awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Buh vui pasarih, sîn tê tê chuan vui sarih, ṭha pui pui chu an ei zo ta mai a. Farawa chu a ṭhangharh a, a mumang a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan Farawa chu a buai rilru hle a. Aigupta mi, arsi chhui thiam te leh mi fing zawng zawng chu a ko va. Farawa chuan a mang chu a hrilh a; mahse, tu man an hrilh fiah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No kengtu lu ber chuan Farawa chu a bia a, “Vawiin hian ka haihawtzia ka hriat chhuah chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vawi khat, Farawa chu a chhiahhlawh chungah a thinur a, vêngtu hotu ber awmnaah kei leh chhang siamtu kha min tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zan khat chu kan pahnihin mumang kan nei ve ve a, a awmzia erawh chu a inang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hebrai saltâng tlangvâl pakhat, vêngtu chhiahhlawh chu a awm ve a; kan mumang chu kan hrilh a, min hrilh fiahsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min hrilh ang chiahin thil a lo awm ta a. Kei chu ka hna ngaiah min dah leh a, chhang siamtu erawh chu thingah khai a nih tâk kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa chu a kohtîr ta nghâl a. Rip chhûng aṭangin an la chhuak vat a; a inmêt fai a, a silhfên a inthlâk a, Farawa hmaah a va inlan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah, “Tu ma hrilh fiah theih loh mumang ka nei a ni; mahse, nang chuan i hriat veleh i hrilh fiah thei an ti che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josefa chuan Farawa chu a chhâng a, “Kei chuan thei lo ve; Pathian erawh chuan Farawa mumang chu dik takin a hrilh fiahsak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah, “Ka mumangah chuan Nail lui kamah ka lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lui aṭang chuan bâwngpui pasarih, thau mûm ṭha tak tak an lo chhuak a, a kam rairuang hmunah chuan an tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An hnu lawkah chuan bâwngpui pasarih, berh êm êm, chêr chhe tak tak, thêp thin then hi an lo chhuak ve a - Aigupta ram zawng zawngah chutiang êma bâwng chêr chhia ka la hmu ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bâwng chêr chhe êm êmte chuan bâwng thau tak lo chhuak hmasate chu an ei zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ei zawh hnu pawh chuan a hma ang bawk khân an la thêp ta tho va: tu man a dangte kha an ei tih hriat tûr a ni lo. Tin, ka han harh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mumang ka neih lehah chuan buh kûng khatah vui sarih, lian tak tak leh pum ṭha tak tak ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A dawtah buh vui pasarih, sîn tê tê, thli lum chhêm ro rim rem a lo chhuak leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Buh vui chhe tê tê chuan vui ṭha pui pui chu a lem zo ta maiin ka hmu a. Tin, arsi chhût thiam te ka hrilh a; mahse, tu mah hrilh fiah thei an awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josefa chuan Farawa hnênah, “Farawa mumang hi awmze thuhmun a ni. Pathianin a thil tih tûr Farawa hnênah a hrilh lâwk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bâwng thau tak tak pasarih kha kum sarih entîrna a ni, buh vui ṭha tak tak pasarih pawh kum sarih entîrna bawk a ni; mumang awmze thuhmun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bâwngpui chêr chhe tak tak rawn zuitu pawh chu kum sarih ṭâm tla tûr entîrna a ni. Chutiang bawkin buhvui sarih khawchhak thli chhêm ro, chhe tê tê kha kum sarih ṭâm tla tûr entîrna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Farawa ka hrilh ang chiah khân Pathian chuan a thiltih tum Farawa hnênah a hrilh lâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kan hma kum sarih chhûng hian Aigupta ram zawng zawngah buh tawntawin a haw ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />mahse, chu chu ṭâmpui mitthiin a zui ang a, tawntawa buh a haw lai kha an theihnghilh vek ang, ṭâm chuan ram chu a tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ramah ṭâm a nasat dâwn êm avângin buh tam lai hnuhma rêng rêng kha hmuh tûr a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Faraw-an awmze thuhmun mang a neih nawn hi Pathianin chu thil chu a nemnghet a, a rawn tithleng thuai dâwn tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Farawa chuan mi remhria leh fing zawng sela, Aigupta ram enkawltu atân siam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Farawa chuan hotute ruat sela, kum ṭhat kum, kum sarih chhûngin Aigupta ramah, buh chu hmun ngaa hmun khat chhûntîr sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kan hma kum sarih, kum ṭha tak lo awm tûr chhûng hian buh chu khawn khâwm sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Farawa thupêkin buhte chu chhêk khâwm ni rawh se; khawpuia an la ei atân chhûn khâwm ni rawh se. Aigupta rama kum sarih ṭâm tla tûr atân chûng chu khêk ni rawh se, ṭam avânga ram pum a boral loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Farawa leh a khâwnbâwlte chuan ṭha an tih zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Farawa chuan a hote hnênah, “Ani ang Pathian thlarau awmna hi kan hmu zo dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Farawa vêk chuan Josefa hnênah, “Pathianin hêng thil thleng tûr hi a hriattîr che a, nang anga thil hre thûk leh fing tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka ram enkawltu i ni ang a, ka mite chu i thu thuin an awm ang, thuneihnaa mi dawttu i ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah heti hian a ti bawk: “Ngai teh, Aigupta ram zawng chunga hotu-ah ka siam tâk che hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Farawa chuan a hming nemna zungbun chu a phawi a, Josefa chu a buntîr a. Puan zai sîn a sintîr a, rangkachak khaidiat a awrhtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A sakawrtawlailîr ṭha ber dawttuah a chuantîr a, a hmaah chuan, “Kiang ru,” tiin an au va. Chutiang chuan Aigupta ram chunga hotu-ah ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah, “Farawa ni mah ila, i thu lo chuan Aigupta ram pumah tu mahin an kut an ke an lek tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Farawa chuan a hmingah Zafenat-panea a vuah a, On khaw puithiam Potifara fanu Asenathi chu nupuiah a neihtîr a. Aigupta ram pumah Josefa chu an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Josefa chu kum sawmthum a nihin Farawa hnuaiah a thawk ṭan a, Farawa bul aṭang chuan a chhuak a, Aigupta ram chu a fang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kum ṭhat kum sarih chhûng chuan buh tawntawin a haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kum ṭhat kum sarih chhûnga thlai thar chi tinrêng chu a chhûng khâwm a, khawpuiahte chuan a chhêk a; khawpui tinah, a vêl lova buh haw chu, a chhêk zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Josefa chuan buh tam tak, tuifinriat kama ṭiauvaivut anga tam a chhêk rui a, a tam êm avângin a zât pawh a chhiar sêng ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ṭâm a tlâk hmain On khaw puithiam Potifara fanu Asenathi chuan Josefa chu fapa pahnih a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A fa tîr chu a hmingah Manasea a sa a, “Pathianin ka vânduaina leh ka nu leh pa min theihnghilhtîr ta a ni,” a tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A fa pahnihna hmingah Efraima a sa a, “Ka hrehawm tuarna ramah Pathianin min tipung,” a tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aigupta rama buh tawntawa a haw hun chhûng chu a tâwp ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />ṭam kum sarih chu Josefa sawi ang khân a inṭan ta a, ram tinah ṭâm a tla a, Aigupta ram zawng zawngah erawh chuan ei tûr a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aigupta ram pumah pawh chuan an ṭam ve ta a. Farawa hnênah an kal a, ei tûr an dîl a. Farawa chuan Aigupta mite chu, “Josefa hnênah kal rawh u, a sawi ang apiang chu ti ang che u,” a ti zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ṭâm chu ram puma a tlâk tâk vek hnu chuan a buh chhêkna inte chu a hawng a, ṭâm chu Aigupta ramah chuan a nat êm avângin buh chu a leitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Khawvêl pum puiah pawh an ṭâm nasat êm avângin Josefa hnênah ram tina mi an lo kal a, pûr an rawn chaw ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Aigupta ramah buh a awm tih a hriatin a fate hnênah, “Engati nge in inen mai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta ramah buh lei tûr a awm tih ka hria a ni; chhuk thla ula, tlêm azâwng tal zu lei rawh u; tichuan, rilṭâma thi lovin ṭâm hi kan tuar chhuak thei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa u sâwmte chu Aigupta rama pûr chaw tûr chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josefa pianpui, Benjamina erawh chu a ûte zîngah a pa chuan a kaltîr ve lo, tawh sual a tâwk palh hlauh ang tih a hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kanan ramah ṭâm a tlâk avângin pûr châwk tum mi dangte rual chuan Israela fate chu an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu ram hotu ber chu Josefa a ni a, mi zawng zawng hnênah buh lei phalsak theitu a ni. Josefa ute chu an lo kal a, lei si-a kûnin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni a hmuh chuan Josefa chuan an hmêl a lo hre mai a; mahse, hnam dang angin a intilang a, ram takin a bia a, “Khawi lam mi nge in nih?” a ti a. “Kanan ram aṭangin pûr chaw tûra lo kal kan ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josefa chuan a unaute chu a hria a; a unaute erawh chuan a hmêl an hre ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josefa chuan an chungchâng mumanga a hmuh kha a hre chhuak a. Tichuan, an hnênah, “Enthlatute in ni ang. Ram dinhmun en thlithlai tûra lo kal in ni phawt mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ni suh e, ka pu, i chhiahhlawhte hi pûr chaw tûr maia lo kal kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan za hian mi pakhat fa kan ni a, mi hlauhawm kan ni lo, enthlatu kan ni awzâwng lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka awih lo, ram dinhmun en thlithlai tûra lo kal in nih hi maw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An ṭang hle a, “I chhiahhlawhte hi unau sâwm leh pahnih, mi pakhat hrin, Kanan ram mi kan ni. Kan tlum ber chu kan pa hnênah a awm a; pakhat erawh chu a awm tawh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Josefa chuan, “Ka sawi ang khân enthlatu zawng in nih ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetiang hian in thu a dik leh dik loh kan fiah ang. In tlum ber chu han hruai rawh u. In rawn hruai loh chuan, Farawa hming chhâlin ka sawi e, in haw leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In nau hruai tûrin in zînga pakhat intîr haw ula, mi dang chu tân inah ka khung ang che u. Chutiang chuan thu dik in sawi nge sawi lo fiah a ni ang. Chutilo chu, Farawa chhâlin ka sawi hi, enthlatu in lo ni ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni thum chhûng tân inah a tântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni thum ni chuan Josefa chuan an hnênah, “Ka sawi ang khân ti ula, in him ang. Pathian ṭih mi tak ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thu dik sawi in nih chuan in zînga pakhat in zaa aiah hrên ni sela, mi dang chuan in chhûngte ei tûr nei lo tân, ei tûr phur haw ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In nau tlum ber chu in rawn hruai ngei ngei tûr a ni; tichuan, in thu chu finfiah a ni ang a, in thi lo vang,” a ti a. Rem an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A va pawi êm! Kan nau avângin kan tuar ta a nih hi. Hrehawm a tih êm êm lai khân kan en mai mai a, khawngaih tûra min ngen ṭâwk ṭâwk lai khân kan ngaihsak hek lo. Chuvâng chu a nih hi he manganna hian mi a rawn tlâkbuak tâk ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Reubena chuan, “In nau chungah thil dik lo ti suh u, ka ti che u a, in ngaithla lo va, a thisen mawh chu in phur ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ṭawng lettute chu an inkâra an awm avângin Josefa chuan an thu sawi chu a lo hre reng tih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An hmuh loh tûrin a hawi a, a ṭap a. Fel taka a ṭawng leh theih hnu chuan an zîng ata Simeona chu a thlang chhuak a, an hmuh lai chuan a phuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josefa chuan an ipah buh dah khahsaka, an tangka pawh an ipa dah leh vek tûrin thu a pe a; kalkawnga an riah chaw tûr pawh a paitîr a. Chutiang chuan tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An buh lei chu an sabengtungte chu an phurhtîr a, an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chuan an zân riahnaah chuan sabengtung chaw pêk tumin a ip chu a han hawng a, a ip rawng bulah chuan a tangka chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tu-in emaw ka tangka mi pe kîr leh a ni, hei ka ipa hi a awm reng mai,” tiin a unaute chu a hrilh a. An hlauthâwng rilru hle a, khûr chungin “Pathianin engtizia nge kan chungah hetia a tih tâk le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kanan rama an pa Jakoba hnên an thlen chuan an thil tawh zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ram hotupa ber chuan min lo be ram hle a, ram enthlatuah min puh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Mi hlauhawm kan ni lo ve, enthlatu kan ni awzâwng lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />unau sâwm leh pahnih, pa pakhat hrin kan ni a; pakhat chu a awm tawh lo va, kan naupang ber erawh chu kan pa hnênah Kanan ramah a awm,’ kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ram hotu ber chuan, ‘mi hlauhawm in ni lo tih heti hian kan hre thei ang; in zînga pakhat hnutchhiah ula, mi dang chuan in chhûng ei nei lote tân, eng emaw phur haw ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In tlum ber nên in lo kîr leh hunah enthlatu in ni lo va, mi hlauhawm lah in ni hek lo tih kan hre thei ang; tin, in unau kan hrên chu ka chhuah ang a, in duh duhin in awm thei ang,’ a ti a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An ip an han phawrh chuan an tangka kha an ipah chuan a lo awm ṭheuh va. An tangka fûn an hmuh chuan an pa ho chuan an hlauthâwng hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An pa chuan, “Nangni hian ka fa zawng zawng min sûntîr a nih hi. Josefa chu a awm tawh lo va, Simeona a awm ta lo bawk a. Benjamina pawh min lâksak in tum leh zêl em ni? Kei hi a tuartu ber ka nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reubena chuan, “Ka rawn hruai kîr leh loh chuan ka fate pahnih hi i that mai dâwn nia. Ka kutah dah la, ka rawn hruai kîrsak leh ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Ka fapa hi in rual chuan a kal ve tûr a ni lo; a u a thi tawh a, amah chauh hi la dam chu a ni. In kalna tûrah tawh sual a tawh hlauh chuan kei lu ṭuak bum tawh hi lungngaiin thlânah min liamtîr dâwn a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ramah chuan ṭâm chu a na ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga an buh zu phurh an ei zawh chuan an pa chuan, “Kal leh ta ula, buh zu lei leh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda chuan, “Mi chuan, ‘in nau in rawn hruai loh chuan ka hmaah lo lang tawh suh u,’ min ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan nau hi a kal ve i phal chuan kan zu kal ang a, buh chu kan rawn leisak mai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I phal loh erawh chuan kan kal leh ngam lo va ni. Mi chuan, ‘in nau in rawn hruai loh chuan ka hmaah lo lang tawh suh u,’ min ti tlat a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Engati nge min tihrehawm tûr rêng rênga ‘nau pakhat kan la nei,’ tia chu mi chu in hrilh kher kher le aw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kan chanchin leh kan chhûng chanchin min zâwt si a, chhân loh theih ni hek lo, ‘in nau chu han hruai ngei rawh u,’ a ti ang tih engtin nge kan hriat ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda chuan a pa Israela hnênah, “Ka kutah naupang chu dah la; tu mah, nang emaw, keini emaw, i tute emaw thi lova kan dam khawchhuah theih nân kan zu kal leh mai ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A chungchângah a bul tumtu ka ni ang a, a mawh ka phur ang e, ka rawn hruai kîr lohva, i hmaa ka rawh thlen loh chuan min thiam lo kumkhua ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan muangchâng mai mai a ni, kal ta ila, vawi hnih lai kan vei hman tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An pa Israela chuan, “Chuti a nih si chuan heti hian ti rawh u: Chu mi hnêna pêk tûr chuan he rama thil ṭha ṭha hi in ipah khung ula, thinghnai damdawi te, khawizu tlêm te, beraw te, Mura te, khawkherh te leh theitê te kensak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tangka pawh in ken lêt hnih keng ula, in ipa an dah kha in pe kîr tûr a ni, an tihsual palh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In nau pawh chu hruai ula, chu mi hnênah chuan zu kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />El-Sadaian chu mi chu khawngaihtîr che u sela, in unaupa leh Benjamina pawh an lo haw phaltîr teh se. Ka fate chu ka chân a nih pawhin ka chân poh a ni ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, thilpêk tûrte chu an keng a, tangka pawh a lêt hnih an keng bawk a, Benjamina pawh an hruai a. Aigupta ramah chuan an chhuk a. Josefa hmaah chuan an va inlan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamina hruaia an lo kal a hmuh chuan, “Hêng mite hi ka inah hruai rawh, ran talh ula, chawchhûn ka eipui dâwn nia,” a in enkawltu hnênah chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan a sawi ang chuan a ti a, anni chu a inah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josefa in lama an hruai ta chu an hlauthâwng hle a, “Kan kal hmasaka kan tangka ipa min dahsak leh vâng kha a ni phawt ang; min mana bawih atân kan rante nên min manna remchâng an zawng a ni ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josefa in enkawltu chu in luh dâwnah chuan an bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ka pu, buh lei tûrin vawi khat kan lo kal tawh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kan zân riahna hmunah kan ip kan han hawng a, kan ip rawng bulah kan tangka kha a lo awm ṭheuh mai. Kan buh leina zât chiah vek kha a ni. Hei, chu chu kan rawn la kîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Buh leina tûr pawh tangka dang kan rawn keng asin. Kan ipah tu nge kan tangka kha dah kan hre lo a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chûng thil chu a fel vek alâwm, thlaphâng suh u. In Pathian, in pa Pathian chuan ro hlu a dahsak che u a nih chu. In buh leina chu ka dawng vek alâwm,” a ti a. Simeona pawh chu a rawn hruai chhuak nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Josefa inah a hruai lût a, an ke silna tûr tui a pe a, an ran ei tûr chaw a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chhûna Josefa lo haw nghâkin thilpêk an kente chu inah an la lût a, chaw an ei ho dâwn tih an hre tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josefa a lo haw chuan thilpêk tûr an kente chu an pe a, lei siin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An chanchin a zâwt a, “In pa, tar tawh tak in sawi kha engtin nge a awm, a la ṭha zêl maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“I chhiahhlawhte pa chu a dam a, la hrisêl tak a ni,” an ti a, zah takin a hmaah an kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nu fapa, a nau Benjamina chu a han hmuh chuan, “Hei hi em ni in tlum ber in sawi kha?” a ti a. “Mama, Pathianin khawngaih che rawh se,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Josefa chu a nau a han hmuh chuan a lung a chhia a, a ṭah a chhuak a, a tlân chhuak a, pindan dangah a kal a, a va ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hmai a phih a, a lo chhuak leh chu a insûm thei tawh a ni. “Chaw ei siam rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu a hrangin an eitîr a, anniho chu a hrangin an ei ho va, Aigupta mi, a ina chaw ei ṭhînte pawh chu a hrangin an ṭhu a. Aigupta mite chuan Hebrai mite nên chaw an ei ho thei lo a ni; Hebrai mite chu tenawm an ti êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hmaah chûng mite chuan anniho chu a upat dân indawtin a naupang ber thlengin an ṭhuttîr thliah a; an inen a, mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dawhkân aṭang chuan ei tûr an rawn suahsak a, Benjamina chan chu mi dang chan lêt nga lai a ni. Josefa ho chuan ruai an ṭheh a, duh tâwkin uain an in ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chuan a in enkawltu hnênah, “Hêng mite ipah hian an phurh zawh tâwkin buh thun khat la, an pawisa pawh an ipah dahsak ṭheuh ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka tangkaraw no kha, an naupang ber ipah, ama tangka nên dah bawk ang che,” a ti a. Josefa thupêk ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua a vâr veleh an rante nên an chhuahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua aṭanga thui an kal hmain Josefa chuan a in enkawltu hnênah, “Tho la, khâng mite kha va ûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ûm phâk hunah, ‘Engtizia nge thil ṭha thil suala in rulh le, ka pu uain inna no, aien nâna a hman ṭhin asin in lâk kha; thil tenawm tak in ti a ni,’ va ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A va ûm phâk a, chutiang chuan a va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Ka pu hian engtiziaa chutia rawn ti mai nge maw i nih le? I chhiahhlawhte hian chutiang chu kan ti teuh hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan ipa tangka kan hmuh pawh kan ram aṭangin kan rawn keng vang vang a nih kha. I pu tangka emaw, rangkachak emaw han ru âwm kan ni nêm. I chhiahhlawhte zîngah chutiang lo titu kan awm a nih chuan tihhlum ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mai chu ni lovin, ka pu, i bawihah kan ṭang vek ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“In thil sawi chu a âwm hle a; amaherawhchu, no latu chauh ka bawihah ṭang rawh se, mi dang chu in fihlîm vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahni ip ṭheuh an hlâng thla a, a ṭâwnna chu an phelh sawk sawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A upa ber ip aṭangin a han zawng ṭan a, a naupang ber ip chu a zawng hnuhnûng ber a; no chu Benjamina ipah chuan a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu veleh an silhfênte an pawtthlêr a, mahni phur an siam sawk sawk a, khawpui lamah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda leh a unauten khua an luh chuan Josefa chu inah a la awm a. A hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josefa chuan, “Thil in va han ti mak ve! Keini ang hi chuan aien kan thiam ang tih in hre na nge?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Juda chuan a chhâng a, “Kan pu hnênah eng nge kan sawi tâk ang? I chhiahhlawhte thil sual tih tilangtu hi Pathian a lo ni e. Hei, ka pu, i bawihte kan nih tâk hi, i no latu mai ni lovin kan vai hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Chuti êm chu ni lo ve, ipa no an hmuhna chauh ka bawihah ka nei ang; mi dang chu in pa hnênah haw vang vang rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu veleh Juda chuan Josefa chu a hnaih a, “Ka pu, khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawh hian ka pu Farawa tluka lal hnênah thu min sawitîr la, lo ngaithla hrâm teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hi ka pu chuan, ‘Pa in la nei em, unau dang in la nei em?’ tiin min zâwt a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pu hnênah, ‘Upa tawh tak pa kan nei a, a upat lama a fapa, fa tlum ber pawh a la awm, a u erawh chu a thi tawh a; a nupui duat fa la dam chhun a nih avângin a ngai êm êm a ni,’ kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangin, ‘Han hruai thla rawh u, ka lo hmu duh e,’ i chhiahhlawhte hnênah i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka pu, i hnênah, ‘Naupang chuan a pa a kalsan thei lo vang, a kalsan chuan a pa chu a thi mai ang,’ kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, nangin i chhiahhlawhte hnênah, ‘In nau tlum ber chu in rawn hruai loh chuan mi rawn hmu thei tawh lo vang,’ i ti miau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh, kan pa hnêna kan han thlen chuan, ka pu, chûng thu chu kan hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nakin deuh hnuah kan pa chuan, ‘Kal ula, ei tûr zu lei leh rawh u,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Kan kal a sâwt lo, kan tlum ber a tel ve erawh chuan kan kal mai ang; kan tlum ber tel lo chuan chu mi chu kan hmu thei dâwn lo a ni,’ kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh, kan pa chuan, kan hnênah, ‘Ka nupui khân fapa pahnih min hrinsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />pakhat chu a awm ta lo va, ramsakawlhin an pawt sawm a ni ang ka ti ta a ni, vawiin thleng hian ka hmu leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He mi leh zêl hi zawng mi hruai bosak teh suh u, tawhsualte a tawh hlauh chuan lungngaiin kei putar hi mitthi khuaah min liamtîr dâwn a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh, kan pa chuan, kan nau hi ngaih tak têin a ngai si a, a tel lova a hnêna kan kîr chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a tel ve lo tih a hriat veleh a thi mai ang, i chhiahhlawhte hian kan pa, i chhiahhlawh tar tawh tak chu lunglêngin mitthi khuaah kan liamtîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh, kan nau kan rawn hruai theih dân hetiang hi a ni; ka pa hnênah, ‘I hnêna ka rawn hruai kîr loh chuan i lakah thiam loh ka chang kumkhua ang,’ tiin mawhphurtuah ka insiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin kei, i chhiahhlawh hi, kan nau aiah ka tâng mai zâwk ang e, ani chu a ute rualin haw rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka nau tel lo hi chuan kan pa hnêna kîr leh thei ka ni lo. Ka pa chunga chhiatna thleng tûr min hmuhtîr lul suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa chu a ina awmte hmaah chuan a insûm zo ta ngang lo va, mi zawng zawng chu a chhuahtîr a. A unaute hnêna Josefa a insawi lai chuan tu mah an awm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ṭap ta rawih a, Aigupta mite chuan an hre pha a, Farawa inah pawh an lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josefa chuan a unaute hnênah, “Josefa kha ka ni alâwm. Ka pa a la dam maw,” a ti a. Mak an ti lutuk a, a unaute chuan chhân pawh an chhâng thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josefa chuan, “Lo hnai deuh teh u!” a ti a. An va hnaih deuh hnu chuan, In nau Josefa kha ka ni. Aigupta mite hnêna in hralh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In rilru mangang suh se, hetia min hralh avâng hian inthiam lo rilru hek suh u. Kan zavaia tân himna tûrin in hmaah Pathianin min tîr hmasa a lo nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram pumah kum hnih chhûng kan ṭam tawh a, kum nga dang lei an let lo vang a, buh seng tûr a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, mak taka chhan tûr che uin Pathianin min lo tîr hmasa a ni; nangni leh in thlahte in mang lohna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hetia min kaltîrtu hi nangni ni lovin Pathian a lo ni. Farawa tân pa angin min siam a, a chhûngkaw hotu ber Aigupta ram rorêltuah min siam a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pa hnênah chuan han kîr leh thuai ula, a hnênah, ‘I fapa Josefa chuan, Aigupta rama hotu-ah Pathianin mi dah hi, i tute leh i berâm te, i ran rual leh i neih zawng zawng nên ka bul hnaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gosen ramah i awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭâm hian kum nga a la awh dâwn a, nang leh i chhûngte leh i ṭhuihruaiten eng mah tlâkchham an neih loh nân ka lo enkawl ang che u a ti,’ han ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmahni ngeiin min hmu a, ka nau Benjamin, hei min hmu a, in hnêna thusawitu, kei hi, Josefa ngei kha ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta ramah dinhmun sâng takah ka din thu te, in thil hmuh te hi ka pa chu han hrilh ang che u. Kal thuai ula, ka pa chu hetah han hruai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutia a sawi zawh chuan a nau Benjamina chu a pawm a, a ṭap a, Benjamina pawh a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ute pawh a fâwp ṭheuh va, a ṭah khum zêl a. Chutia a tih zawh chuan thu an sawi tlâng thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josefa unaute lo kal thu chu Farawa inah pawh an hre ta a. Farawa leh a upate chu an lâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah, “I unaute chu hrilh rawh. Hetiang hian ti rawh se. An ran phurte chu siam sela, muangchâng lovin Kanan ramah kîr vat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In pa chu a chhûngte nên rawn hruai rawh se, hetah lo kîr leh sela, Aigupta rama ram ṭha ber laiah ka dah ang e, ram hausakna chu an tlân dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Heti hian tihsak rawh: an fate, an nupuite leh in pa chuanna tûr Aigupta rama tawlailîrte hâwn sela, lo kîr leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An thil neih dangte chu engto tehchiam suh se, Aigupta rama thil ṭha tinrêng an nei dâwn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israela fate chuan chutiang chuan an ti a. Josefa chuan Farawa thupêk angin tawlailîr te, kalkawnga an riah chaw tûr te a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An za chuan kawr thar a pe bawk a, Benjamina phei chu tangka sekel zathum leh inthlâkna tûr kawr panga a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pa tân Aigupta rama thil siam ṭha ber chi sabengtung phur sâwm leh buh te, chhang te leh ei tûr dang kalkawnga an riah chaw tûr sabengtungpui phur sâwm a thawn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, a unaute chu a tîr haw a, “Kawngah va inmawhchhiat suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aigupta ram an chhuahsan a, an awmna Kanan ram chu an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Josefa chu a la dam a, Aigupta ram pum puia rorêltu a ni,” tih an pa an han hrilh chuan a mit sulh a, a awih thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Josefa thu zawng zawng kha an han hrilh a, Josefan a chuanna tûr tawlailîr a rawn thawn te a han hmuh chuan a lo harh leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israela chuan, “Ka fapa Josefa a la dam chu a tâwk e, ka thih hmain a hmêl hmu tûrin ka kal ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israela chu a neih zawng zawng nên a chhuak a. Beer-seba a lo thleng a, hetah hian Pathian, a pa Isaka Pathian hnênah inthawina a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zânah chuan Pathianin Israela chu inlârnaah a ko va, “Jakob, Jakob,” a rawn ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “I pa Pathian ka nih hi, Aigupta rama chhuk chu hreh suh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta-ah chuan ka kal thlâkpui ang che a, keimah ngeiin ka hruai kîr leh ang che. Josefa ngeiin a dawm hlum ang che,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Beer-seba chu a chhuahsan a, Israela fate chuan a chuanna tûra Farawa tawlailîr rawn thawnah chuan an pa Jakoba chu, an nupuite leh an fanaute nên an chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ran rualte chu an khalh a, Kanan rama an awm chhûnga an thil neih zawng zawng nên, Jakoba leh a thlahte chuan Aigupta ram chu an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A fapate, a tupate, a fanute, a tunute, a thlah zawng zawngte chu a rawn hruai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta rama pêm, Israel mi, Jakoba leh a thlahte chu hêngte hi an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba fa tîr Reubena leh a fate chu: Hanoka, Palua, Hezrona leh Karmia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeona leh a fate chu: Jemuela, Jamina, Ohada, Jakina, Zohara, Kanan hmeichhe laka a hrin Saula te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levia fate chu: Gersona te, Kohata te, Meraria te hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda fate chu: Sela, Pereza, Zera; a fa upa Era leh Onana chu Kanan ramah an thi tawh. Pereza chuan fa Hezrona leh Hamula a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isakara fate: Tola, Pua, Joba, Simrona.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zebuluna fate chu: Sereda, Elona, Jahleela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûngte chu Leaiin Padan-aram-a Jakoba a hrinsakte chu an ni; a fanu Dinaii nên, an vaiin sawmthum leh pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gada fate: Zefona, Hagia, Sunia, Ezbona, Eria, Arodia, Arelia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asera fate: Imna, Isva, Isvia, Beria, an farnu Seri nên. Beria fate chu: Hebera, Malkiela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng chu Labanan a fanu Leaii tân chhiahhlawha a pêk Zilpaiin Jakoba a hrinsakte chu an ni; an vaiin sâwm leh paruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba nupui Rakili fate: Josefa, Benjamina.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Josefa chuan fa pahnih On puithiam Potifara fanu Asenathi hrinsak Manasea leh Efraima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamina fate: Bela, Bekera, Asbela, Gera, Naamana, Ehia, Rosa, Mupima, Hupima, Arda,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng hi Rakili thlah, Jakoba fate chu an ni, an vaiin sâwm leh pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dana fa: Husima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naftalia fate: Jazeela, Gunia, Jezera, Silema.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng hi Labanan a fanu Rakili tân chhiahhlawh a pêk Bilhaiin Jakoba a hrinsakte chu an ni; an vaiin pasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakoba ruala Aigupta rama pêm thlahte chu: ama fa ngei, an nupuite chhiar telin, mi sawmruk leh paruk an tling a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aigupta rama Josefa fa pahnih leh Jakoba ho Aigupta rama pêm thla chu a lu nungin sawmsarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Juda chu Josefa hnênah Gosen rama lo kal hmasa tûrin a tîr a. Gosen ram an lo thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josefa chuan a tawlailîr a buatsaihtîr a, a pa Jakoba hmuak tûr chuan Gosen ramah chuan a kal ta a. A va hmuh veleh a pawm chawt a, rei fe a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israelan Josefa hnênah, “Nungdamin i la awm a, i hmêl ka hmu leh ta a, tûnah chuan duh leh thi tawh rawh i,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa leh a pa chhûngte hnênah chuan, “Ka kal ang a, Farawa ka va hrilh ang e. ‘Kanan rama awm ṭhîn ka unaute leh ka chhûngte chuan min rawn pan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />berâm vulh mi an ni a, ran vulh mi rêng an ni. Ani berâmte leh an ran rualte leh an neih zawng zawng pawh an rawn chhawm,’ ka va ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Faraw-an a koh che ua, in hna thawh ṭhinte a zawh hunah che u chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />‘hmânlai aṭang tawhin tûn thlengin i chhiahhlawhte hi ran vulh mi kan ni, keini leh kan pate pawh,’ ti ang che u; tichuan, Gosen ramah a awmtîr dâwn che u nia, Aigupta miten berâmpute hi an ten êm êm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa chu a kal a, Farawa hnênah, “Ka pa leh ka unaute chu Kanan ram aṭangin an lo chhuk a, an berâm te, an ran rual te leh an neih zawng zawng nên Gosen ram an lo thleng ta,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A unaute panga a thlang chhuak a, Farawa hmaah chuan a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farawa chuan, “Eng hnathawk ṭhîn nge in nih?” tiin a unaute chu a lo zâwt ta ngei a. Anni chuan, “I chhiahhlawhte hi berâm vêngtu kan ni ṭhîn, kan pate pawh chutiang mi chu an ni ṭhîn,” tiin Farawa chu an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Farawa hnênah chuan hetiang hian an ti bawk a: “He ramah hian lo pêm kan duh a ni; ṭâm a nat êm avâng hian i chhiahhlawhte hian Kanan ramah kan ran peh tûr hnimhring kan hmu zo tawh lo va ni. Gosen ram vêlah hian kan lo awm min phalsak tûrin kan ngên a che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Farawa chuan Josefa hnênah, “I pa leh i unaute chuan an rawn pan che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta ram chu a awm duai alâwm, ram ṭha berah i pa leh i unaute chu awmtîr rawh; Gosen bialah awm rawh se. An zînga fel fâl bîk i hriat chuan ka ran enkawltuah te dah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa Jakoba chu Farawa hnênah a hruai a, a hmaah chuan a dintîr a. Jakoba chuan Farawa chu chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Farawa chuan, “Kum eng zât nge i nih tawh le?” tiin Jakoba chu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba chuan, Farawa chu a chhâng a, “Khualzin ka nih chhûng kum chu kum za leh sawmthum zawng a ni ve ta. Ka pate dam chhûng nêna teh chuan ka dam chhûng nite chu a la tlêm hle a; mahse, a hahthlâk hle a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Farawa chu chibai a bûk leh a, a chhuahsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa leh a unaute chu Farawa thu ang chuan Ramases bialah, ram ṭha berah, ram a pe a, a awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa leh a unaute, a pa chhûngte chu a naupang ber thlengin an mamawh ang zêlin ei tûr a tumsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭâm chu a nasa ta hle a, ram tinah ei tûr a awm ta lo va. Aigupta leh Kanan ram chu ṭâm tuarin an chau zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta leh Kanan rama pawisa awm zawng zawng chu an buh dawn manah a lâksak a, Farawa tangka inah a dah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta leh Kanan rama pawisa awm zawng zawng an hman zawh chuan Aigupta mite chu Josefa hnênah an lo kal a, “Buh min pe rawh, i hmuhah kan thih mai dâwn hi, pawisa lah kan nei tawh si lo,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josefa chuan, “Pawisa in neih tawh si loh chuan buh manah in rante han pe ta che u, buh ka lo pe ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa hnênah an rante chu an rawn pe a. Sakawr te, berâm te, bâwng te leh sabengtungte chuan buh an lei ta a. Chumi kum chhûng tla chu an ran chuan an lei thei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi kum chu a ral a, kum tharah chuan Josefa hnênah an lo kal leh a, “Ka pu, kan pawisa leh rante chu buh manah kan pe zo tawh a. Ka pu, keimahni leh kan lo tih loh chu eng mah pêk tûr che kan nei ta lo tih hi zêp thei kan ni ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engah nge i mit hmuha kan thih anga, kan lote pawh a chhiat vek ang? Buh manah keimahni leh kan lote hi la mai la, kan ram nên Farawa bawihah kan ṭang mai ang. Buh chi tûr min pe la, boral lovin kan dam khawchhuak thei hlauh mahna, kan lote pawh a chhe hlen dâwn lo nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa chuan Farawa tân Aigupta rama lo zawng zawng chu a neihsak ta a. Ṭâm chu a nat tâk êm avângin Aigupta mi zawng zawngin an ram chu an hralh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta ram dung leh vânga mi zawng zawng chu Farawa bawihah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puithiamho ram erawh chu a lâksak ve lo; Farawa chuan buh pêk tâwk a ruat a, Farawa pêk ang chu an ei tâwk a ni; chuvângin, an ram chu hralh ve a ngai lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josefa chuan mipui hnênah, “Farawa tân nangmahni leh in lote ka lei ta a; hei le, in tuh tûr buh chi ka pêk che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Buh in seng hunah hmun ngaa ṭhena hmun khat chu Farawa hnênah in pe tûr a ni, a bâng hmun li chu a chi-ah te, in chhûngte nêna in eiah te, in fanaute châwm nân te hmang ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kan nun i chhandam a, min khawngaih a, Farawa bawihah min siam hi, ka pu, i chungah kan lâwm êm êm a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josefa chuan buh thar hmun ngaa hmun khat chu Farawa chanvo atân Aigupta ram dânah a siam ta a; tûn thlengin chu chu an la hmang ta zêl a ni; puithiamho ram chauh Farawa ta a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aigupta rama Gosen bialah chuan Israela te chuan awmhmun an khuar ta a. Ramte an nei nghet a, an chi a ṭha a, an pung chak ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakoba chu Aigupta ramah kum sâwm leh pasarih a dam a, Jakoba dam chhûng chu kum za leh sawmli leh pasarih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A thih hun a lo thlen hnaih chuan Israela chuan a fapa Josefa chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Min duhsak takzet a nih chuan ka thu angin i ti ang tih i tiam nân i kut ka malpui kârah dah la, Aigupta ramah min phûm lo tûrin tiam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ka pate hnêna ka mut ve hunah Aigupta ram aṭangin min la chhuak la, an inphûmnaah min phûm ve ang che,” a ti a. “I sawi ang chuan ka ti ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chhechhama tiam tûra a phût ang chuan a tiam ta a. Tichuan, Israela chu khum lu siin a kûn ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnu deuhvah chuan Josefa hnênah, “I pa a chau ta hle,” an rawn ti a. A fa pahnih, Manasea leh Efraima chu a hnênah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakoba hnênah chuan, “I fapa Josefa a lo kal e,” an ti a. Israela chu a intiharh a, khumah chuan a ṭhu chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakoba chuan Josefa hnênah, “Kanan ram Luz khuaah El-Sadaia ka hnênah a rawn inlâr a, mal min sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘I chi ka tiṭha ang a, ka tipung ang che, hnam tam tak pung khâwm tih thamah ka siam ang che; he ram hi kumkhuaa i thlahten an neih atân ka pe a ni,’ a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta rama ka rawn fin ve hma che-a Aigupta rama fa pahnih i hrinte kha ka ta an ni ang. Efraima leh Manasea chu Reubena leh Simona te ka ta an ni ang bawkin ka ta an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An pian hnua piangte leh i fate erawh chu i ta an ni ang, ro khâwm tûr chungchângah an ûte chan ai an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Padan aṭanga ka lo hawa, Kanan rama kan vahvaihna lamah i nu Rakili chuan Efratha bul lawkah min thihsan a; Efratha kawngah, Bethlehem-ah kan phûm ta a nih kha. I nu avângin chutiang chu ka remruat dân a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josefa fate chu Jakoba chuan a han hmuh chuan, “Hêng hi tute nge an nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa hnênah, “He rama Pathianin min pêk ka fate chu an nih hi” a ti a. “Ka bulah han hruai hnai teh, mal ka lo sâwmsak teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israela chu a upat tawh avângin a mit a thim tawh a, khua a hmu thei tawh lo. Josefan a fate chu a rawn hruai hnai a, a lo fâwp a, a pawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israela chuan Josefa hnênah, “I hmêl hmuh leh rêng ka inbeisei lo va, i fate lam Pathianin min hmuhtîr tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josefa chuan a fate chu Israela malchung ata chu a la sawn a, lei siin a kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josefa chuan a ding lamin Efraima a chelh a, Israela kut vei lamah a dintîr a; Manasea chu a vei lamin a chelh a, Israela kut ding lamah a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israela chuan a ban kawkalh a, a kut ding lam chu a naupang zâwk Efraima lu-ah a nghat a, a vei lam chu a upa zâwk Manasea lu-ah a nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetiang hian anni chu mal a sâwmsak ta a: Ka pa Abrahama te, Isaka te zui ṭhin Pathian, Ka pian ni aṭanga tûn thlenga min vêngtu Pathian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo zawng zawng laka min humtu Vântirhkoh chuan Hêng naupangte hi malsâwm sela, Anni hi ka hming leh ka pa Abrahama leh Isaka hming pu zêltu ni sela. Leiah hian lo pungin tam tak ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pain a fapa naupang zâwk Efraima chunga a kut ding lam a nghat chu a tihpalh a nih ringin Efraima lu aṭangin Manasea lu-ah a kut ding lam chu sawnsak a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa hnênah, “Ka pa, khati chuan ti teh suh, a upa zâwk lu-ah i kut ding lam kha nghat teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pa chuan a duh lo va, “Ka hria e, ka fapa. Ani pawh hnam ropui tak a la ni ang. A naupang zâwk hian a la khûm dâwn a ni, a thlahte pawh hnam lian tak tak an ni ve tho vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan anni chu mal a sâwmsak a, “Israel mite chuan hetiang hian duhthu an insamsak tawn ang: ‘Efraima leh Manase angin Pathianin siam che rawh se,’ tiin. Efraim chu a dah pawimawh ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israela chuan Josefa hnênah, “Ka thi mai dâwn ta, Pathianin a awmpui ang che u. I pate ramah a hruai kîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amor mite ram, ka khandaih leh ka thala ka lâksak Sekem ruam ṭha chu i ute nêna in chan bâkah i tân ka pe chuang a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a fate chu a ko khâwm a, “Nakin hnua in awm dân tûr ka lo hrilh ang che u, lo kal khâwm rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jakoba fate u, lo kal khâwm ula, ngaithla rawh u, In pa Israela thu hi ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang Reuben, ka fa tîr, ka chak ka vânglai fa, Mi dang aia chungnung leh zahawm i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui lian anga awm hle hle thei lo, Mi dang aiin i chungnung tawh lo vang, I pa khumpui i kaia, Ka khum i tihbawlhhlawh avâng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeona leh Levia hi unau phîr ang mai an ni, Dân bawhchhiat hi an hna a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An remruatah ka tel lo vang a, An punkhâwmnaah kei chu ka awm ve lo vang. An thinur a, tual an that a, An nawm an mâkin bâwngchal thate an chhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thin a chhiat êm avâng leh An thin a ram êm avângin Jakoba zîngah ka sem darh ang a, Israel-te zîngah ka tidarh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda, i unauten an fak ang che; I hmêlmate chu an ringah i rêk ang a, I unaute i hmaah an kûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda zawng sakeibaknei tuai, Sa seh zo hlim, pûka lawi, Bawka zi awr awr ang hi a ni; Tu man an titho ngam lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal tiang a thlah lo vang a, A thlahte pawh an lal reng ang a, A ke kâr ata rorêltu tiang a insawn hek lo vang. Silo-a a lo kal hma chu miten a thu an awih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Grep hruiah sabengtungno a thlung a, A no ṭha chi chu grep rah tui ber kûngah. A kawr uain-ah a chiah a, grep tui senin a puan a su.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Uain avângin a mit a sen rûm a, Hnutetui avângin a hâ a vâr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zebulun chu tuifinriat kamah a awm ang a, Lawng rual tân chawlhhmun a ni ang, A ram chuan Sidon a ri ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isakara chu sabengtung chak tak, A puak phurh tûr kâra a bawk reng ang hi a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chawlhna hmun chu ṭha a ti a. phur tûrin a hnungzâng a tihniam a bawih angin an chhawr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dana chuan a mite ro a rêlsak ang a, Israel hnam dang ang bawk an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dana chu kawngsîra rûl ang a ni, Rûlrial, kalkawng laia mi chu. Sakawr ke a chu a, hnung lamah a chungchuang a sêp thla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , min chhandam hlân kan va han nghâkhlel em!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gada chu sumdâwng rualin an bei ang a, A bei lêt ang a, a ûm nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asera chu a chênghnâwng hle ang, Lal ei tlâk thil tui a nei rei rui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naftali hi zukpui tla chhuak No duhawm tak nei ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josefa hi ram sakawr tui awmna rama sabengtung no, tlâng panga ram sabengtung tla ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thal kâptuten an bei a, Thal nên an ûm nek mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, a thalngul chu a che ngai lo. A ṭuan lah a ṭha, Jakoba Mi Chaka thahrui leh Israela Lungpui, Vêngtua vâng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I pate Pathian chu a ni pui ṭhîntu che, El-Sadaia a ni, malsâwmtu che. Chung lam aṭanga malsâwm ruah, Lei hnuai aṭanga malsâwmna tuihna, Ran vulh leh fanauva hmuingîlna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thil pâr leh buh vuia malsâwmna, Tlâng hlun malsâwmna te, Tlâng sânga thil duhawm tinrêng te, Josefa lu chungah awm rawh se, A unaute zînga thlan chhuah lu chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Benjamina hi chinghne koham ang a ni, A sa seh chu zîngah leh tlaiah a tlân reng mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng mite chu Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnihte chu an ni; anmahni thlah nân chutiang chuan an pa chuan thu a sawi a ni; a mal malin a âwm tâwk zêlin mal a sâwmsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An hnênah hetiang hian thuro a chhiah bawk, “Ka laichînte hnênah min hruai lawk dâwn tawh a. Ka pate phûmna pûkah min phûm ve ang che u. Chu pûk chu Hit mi Efrona lova awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Makpela hmuna pûk, Mamre zâwn, Kanan rama mi, Abrahaman Hit mi Efrona hnên aṭangin thlân atân a lei a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutah chuan, Abrahama leh a nupui Sari chu an phûm a, Isaka leh a nupui Rebeki pawh an phûm a; kei pawhin Leaii ka phûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu pûk leh a bula lo chu Hit mite ta lei a nih tawh kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakoban a fate thu a chah zawh chuan khumah a ke a hlâng kai a, a hnuk a chat ta a; a laichînte hnênah hruai a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa chuan a pa ruang chu a bawh a, a ṭah a, a fâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josefa chuan a hnuaia thawk damdawi thiamte ṭawih thei lo tûrin a pa ruang chu a siamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutianga ruang siam chuan ni sawmli a awh ṭhîn; Aigupta mite chuan ni sawmsarih chhûng an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sûn hun chhûng a ral hnuin Josefa chuan Farawa miliante hnênah, “Min khawngaih ula, Farawa hnênah hei hi min dîlsak teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pa khân ‘Kanan rama ka thlân buatsaihah min phûm ngei ang che,’ a ti a; chhia min chhamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah ka pa chu han phûm tûrin ka chho thei dâwn lâwm ni? Ka lo kîr leh mai ang,” a ti a. Farawa chuan, “Chhia a chhamtîr che ang chuan kal la, i pa chu han phûm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josefa chu a pa phûm tûr chuan a chhuak a, a rual chuan Farawa sawrkâr hotu rual leh Aigupta ram milian zawng zawng pawh an chho ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josefa chhûngte pawh, a unaute, a pa chhûngte nên, an kal ve vek a ni; an fanaute leh an ran rualte erawh chu Gosen ramah an hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tawlailîrte, sakawr chungchuang mite pawh a rual chuan an kal ve a, an kawi duah mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan ral hlîng hmun hruihzâwl an han thlen chuan urhsûn takin an sûn a, Josefa chuan a pa chu ni sarih chhûng a ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kanan mite chuan chu hmuna an lusûn an hmuh chuan, “Aigupta mite lusûn dân a nih hi,” an ti a. Chuvângin, chu hmun hmingah chuan Abel-mizraim, ‘Aigupta mite lusûn mual’ an vuah a, Jordan râla awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakoba fate chuan an pa sawi angin an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fate chuan Kanan ramah an zâwn lût a Makpela hmuna pûk, Mamre zâwn, Hit mi Efrona hnên aṭanga Abrahaman thlân atân a leiah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa a phûm zawh chuan Josefa chu Aigupta ramah a haw leh a. A unaute leh a ruala a pa phûm tûra chho zawng zawng pawh an haw vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josefa unaute chuan an pa a thih tâk hnu chuan, “Josefa hian min la haw rilru rengin a chunga thil dik lo kan tih ang khân kan chungah a ti ve mai ang a!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa hnênah thu an chah a, “A thih hma khân i pa chuan hetiangin thu min chah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josefa hnênah, ‘i ûte thil sual tih leh thil ṭha lo tak an tih ngaidam tûrin ka ngên a che, tiin in sawi tûr a ni,’ min ti a. Chuvâng chuan, i pa Pathian chhiahhlawhte thil sual tih kha khawngaih takin ngaidam ang che,” an ti a. An thu a lo hriat chuan Josefa chu a ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ute chu anmahni ngei a hnênah chuan an va kal a, a hmaah an bawkkhup a, “I chhiahhlawhah kan ṭang mai ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josefa erawh chuan, “Hlauthâwng suh u, Pathian tlukah ka insiam ngam hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Min tihboral zawng in tum ngei a, Pathianin hmanraw ṭhaah a hmang ta hlauh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hlauthâwng rêng rêng suh u, nangni leh in fate ei tûr zawng ka tum zêl ang,” a ti a. An hnêna ngilnei taka thu a sawi chuan an thla a timuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josefa chu a pa chhûngte nên chuan Aigupta ramah an awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josefa chu kum za leh sâwm a dam a, Efraima fa, khûp thum thlengin a hmu a, Manasea fa Makira fa pawh a malchungah a chawi hman a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tâwpah, Josefa chuan a unaute hnênah, “Ka thih a hnai ta, Pathianin a hre reng ang che u a, he ram aṭang hian Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna pêk a tiam ramah chuan a hruai chho vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josefa chuan Israel fate chu chhia a chhamtîr a, “Pathianin a rawn kan hunah che u ka ruhte hi heta ta la chhuak ngei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josefa chu kum za leh sâwm mi a nihin a thi ta a. A ruang chu ṭawih thei lo tûrin an siam a, Aigupta ramah chuan kuangah an zalh a.
  </para>
</usx>
